DiazCodes"},"message":"feat: supervised multi-agent cross-repo architecture analysis system\n\nFile-based orchestration for terminal coding agents (GitHub Copilot CLI\nfirst-class): a supervisor fans out narrow analysts over module-federation\nand GraphQL-federation repos, gates their JSON outputs against schemas, and\nsynthesizes one evidence-cited report per run.\n\n- 8 agent roles under .github/agents/ with per-role output contracts\n- dependency-free node scripts: init, doctor, new-run, sync-workspace,\n  extract-federation-configs, compose-check, validate-outputs\n- example-config generalization layer: real registry/config are gitignored,\n  git pull updates tooling without touching local setup\n- runs/ and decisions/ gitignored by default so platform data never enters\n  a public-origin clone","tree":{"sha":"aae32a430c9b9f1bd0057ecd8359dcf208d2e6b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hozay-dev/federalist/git/trees/aae32a430c9b9f1bd0057ecd8359dcf208d2e6b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hozay-dev/federalist/git/commits/2753060579a4cfdabeaad66ba3b4005fc5a64aae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114456874?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hozay-dev","id":114456874,"login":"hozay-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOBtJ5Kg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hozay-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u