","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/artokun","id":7666455,"login":"artokun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjY0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/c8c3e9a9771324e1b9a5362efbe6dc5f7a913022/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:06:51Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T20:06:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(2854): a stale socket flag refused every panel_run while everything else worked (#2248)\n\nThe run-dispatch identity read the sticky comfyBackendSocketDown flag\ndirectly:\n\n    backendSocketState = comfyBackendSocketDown === true ? \"down\" : transportState;\n\nEvery other panel_* path asks comfyBackendIsDown(), whose #1325 rule is\nthat flagged-down over an OPEN socket is a STALE or busy-poll signal, not\na down socket. ComfyUI arms that flag from a failed _pollQueue during a\nlong GPU-bound render, and ''reconnected'' never fires because the websocket\nnever left OPEN -- so it never clears.\n\nResult, exactly as reported: reads, edits, set_widget, connect and the\nComfyUI queue all keep working and graph_outline reports backend_socket\n''up'', while panel_run alone reports ''backend socket down'' and refuses\nevery dispatch, across reconnects and rebinds, indefinitely.\n\nFail-closed directions are unchanged: flaggedDown with a non-OPEN or\nUNREADABLE readyState still yields ''down'' (#646), and a clear flag still\ndefers to backendSocketTransportState, which will not call an absent\nreadyState available.\n\nThe existing source pin asserted the buggy line, so it is updated; the new\nbehavioural tests drive the decision through the real helpers both ways,\nso the pre-fix form is pinned as the thing that produced the refusal.\n\nCloses #2854\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e06e592d6f3a25e2be5fd22c4ba766b8e2c5c98e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/e06e592d6f3a25e2be5fd22c4ba766b8e2c5c98e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/c8c3e9a9771324e1b9a5362efbe6dc5f7a913022","verification":{"payload":"tree e06e592d6f3a25e2be5fd22c4ba766b8e2c5c98e\nparent d98d7aa094d520a65ced034389d4f7e73f21f72e\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788811611 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788811611 -0700\n\nfix(2854): a stale socket flag refused every panel_run while everything else worked (#2248)\n\nThe run-dispatch identity read the sticky comfyBackendSocketDown flag\ndirectly:\n\n    backendSocketState = comfyBackendSocketDown === true ? \"down\" : transportState;\n\nEvery other panel_* path asks comfyBackendIsDown(), whose #1325 rule is\nthat flagged-down over an OPEN socket is a STALE or busy-poll signal, not\na down socket. ComfyUI arms that flag from a failed _pollQueue during a\nlong GPU-bound render, and ''reconnected'' never fires because the websocket\nnever left OPEN -- so it never clears.\n\nResult, exactly as reported: reads, edits, set_widget, connect and the\nComfyUI queue all keep working and graph_outline reports backend_socket\n''up'', while panel_run alone reports ''backend socket down'' and refuses\nevery dispatch, across reconnects and rebinds, indefinitely.\n\nFail-closed directions are unchanged: flaggedDown with a non-OPEN or\nUNREADABLE readyState still yields ''down'' (#646), and a clear flag still\ndefers to backendSocketTransportState, which will not call an absent\nreadyState available.\n\nThe existing source pin asserted the buggy line, so it is updated; the new\nbehavioural tests drive the decision through the real helpers both ways,\nso the pre-fix form is pinned as the thing that produced the refusal.\n\nCloses #2854\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnxlbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOFkQAJ31P0nLxo/V54PXsr7HZbEt\nIq8HeanjulW+bcysB/7Akit7Tja/axoc9mPHXliUIUHztRW9fBYY3i1SFY15B1uT\nLmmvWEEoElaYuPXN+MpC6f8xA7RMXzy3oK5EuLd/Gpwhy6jAmk6QAa6oMAEPv5Dg\n8q6j9g6RiD6NAPkjoj0u884vFhIsDGRO2364AdRIenp0cRQWCJMt037XRe7WAC+E\nHKi67athkoZvic9t2BMcbNStnsyKSvE0zffDSBmanmMsP4D1EnTUs9CVlpxkb9Do\nSIGKVgdLJtGXo/o//VubvtDpg7Y3qTnuyWco00X6ZHXFuFnV2oovsUNHG/8UhFau\nWAYMba5KJhtA66lCnMU2eGvpzo9zihLjy3tAz/AUq0Nvr4yu8mmHw+by2fnJSvlR\nxvj63s7R+YpyNbpcWeDwM9uKZ5IlONlI+TIc1R2i8DcsVSllV4pwJQpATlvHZjB7\nDgLNOf7rV2DlU+BwvcHd5zvRKdaWM9WrjGjJpxmtCTMlY/1FqmF9AM6Wm8iBVeam\nePfC5II7q2b2SoEkSCBV1gX2BRgSWdF8szhtzel69ZBdaGAw1Dh1qdQTvzQ1eocv\n4+xa8lJp1JeJCTuymSxLUNGSzfKVZfS7ZZC/kGra4d/yev3H0BhFzkbAgM8y/Eva\nujI+Ucl2Wv8auuzGgKgj\n=7IxN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T20:06:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}",