ub.com/users/artokun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/88f2c8f7fb1b9263697a144ca3e70eef1ecb363f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:40:34Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T04:40:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve Autogrow display-label aliases in panel_connect (#2273)\n\n* fix: resolve Autogrow display-label aliases in panel_connect (#2266)\n\nto_input \"ref_image_0\" on MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo is the canvas alias\nof the dotted slot \"ref_images.ref_image_0\". A name-miss fell through to\ntype-name matching, found zero slots typed \"ref_image_0\", and threw\n\"no input accepts type IMAGE\" while the listing already showed the IMAGE\nslot. Unique label / localized_name / dotted-suffix aliases now resolve\nbefore that pass; leftover misses name the internal slots.\n\n* fix(2266): Autogrow aliases feed #2008 dotted-name reconcile\n\nCopilot: resolving to_input \"ref_image_0\" to an index left requestedSlotName\nas the alias, so reconcileDynamicPrefixSlots skipped (needs a dotted name).\nCanonicalize to the live input.name. graph_connect fixture now uses\nresolveExplicitSlot so the alias path is covered.","tree":{"sha":"315159fc5768c3c964750534513e823056217402","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/315159fc5768c3c964750534513e823056217402"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/88f2c8f7fb1b9263697a144ca3e70eef1ecb363f","verification":{"payload":"tree 315159fc5768c3c964750534513e823056217402\nparent 1e60c0a443ad24cdc5d05d77ca5635d929edfc92\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788669634 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788669634 -0700\n\nfix: resolve Autogrow display-label aliases in panel_connect (#2273)\n\n* fix: resolve Autogrow display-label aliases in panel_connect (#2266)\n\nto_input \"ref_image_0\" on MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo is the canvas alias\nof the dotted slot \"ref_images.ref_image_0\". A name-miss fell through to\ntype-name matching, found zero slots typed \"ref_image_0\", and threw\n\"no input accepts type IMAGE\" while the listing already showed the IMAGE\nslot. Unique label / localized_name / dotted-suffix aliases now resolve\nbefore that pass; leftover misses name the internal slots.\n\n* fix(2266): Autogrow aliases feed #2008 dotted-name reconcile\n\nCopilot: resolving to_input \"ref_image_0\" to an index left requestedSlotName\nas the alias, so reconcileDynamicPrefixSlots skipped (needs a dotted name).\nCanonicalize to the live input.name. graph_connect fixture now uses\nresolveExplicitSlot so the alias path is covered.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnO7CCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzzIQAEarHP8VMC2eH/wX+8hrX+ar\nIihq1/T791HzDH8KSmKuDMPD0i15p7h7F9804W72qQ1FOll7zYg+n/eCx7Apkw1j\nBQ8sDKGOuEchQU5gu45RNK6w3DGiC1bckR2Vn1jNTbT0Cvz2wds4L9SkluAWYhsu\nXbPeucZD5pIyAZYgl9ndxJ8gtsweSrsmliVeNPVqFdhLaKZWgZ4Y6wEBwF/7DSyl\nLlpEHZhssY8zwLoQWptTLJoLhT2crxyiGeguI0byTTmeDBf2DoG3K85jGNUor30c\nB/wGQO8VnHjyMUTv+dfRYnn7GT9RgNDWYrbjpuQqAGjIrLuNr79NvCYEgdZ6nc3C\nF4t4h8nHnHLWBHiScN8JOCKWzNByjUX80e5z93GjlJW4aC/33FfXTMPC2iEI8qbT\nBhI3u3OpmAqef06nv1cVtR3HswBQNH8v/b+GzgVeyyUTCr69Np10IbcFATBhHIpD\nEfi1/t3/4k9STHh/jYE6m2LZprNdGk555C/B+W8xVYQPe5/MCy5C0idhjt2YEFfI\n+RxrG/BmFKAjQ9M8L337JttEN6mfhQvSyyZE9vuLislkXE6hH+fIpiC9cfiq05fa\nw8XxFd0ge1lOq6mFzEcnXELCx9KJZPbnALx2a8dHZQQE9iqrv8ty6JeqcCF9ZG3n\ncUyUO5/inx3kct4+pkl5\n=GoYA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T04:40:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/event