6-09-05T09:30:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(2257): keep Save-As identity after refresh_nodes (#2259)\n\n* fix(2257): pass { workflow } to the Save-As restore canvas fence\n\nFailed Save-As cleanup called canvasFence(workflow). The fence destructures\n{ workflow }, so the record itself always failed closed (\"source canvas\nrestore returned false\") and the next graph read hit root-shape-mismatch\non a partial canvas.\n\nFixes #2257\n\n* fix(2257): keep Save-As identity after refresh_nodes\n\nProve destination uuid+path on the canvas before a Save-As refusal, recapture\nthe active tracker after panel_refresh_nodes, and recapture after a proven\nsource restore so cleanup cannot leave root-shape-mismatch.","tree":{"sha":"4927c7bd62a6413468239ecc1ad0b9e852a5cd27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/4927c7bd62a6413468239ecc1ad0b9e852a5cd27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/8a62c149a125446cd926845638b5ca36ff7f398b","verification":{"payload":"tree 4927c7bd62a6413468239ecc1ad0b9e852a5cd27\nparent bbba5724d7563b4d40e5be0c9624eecace56a4c2\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788600639 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788600639 -0700\n\nfix(2257): keep Save-As identity after refresh_nodes (#2259)\n\n* fix(2257): pass { workflow } to the Save-As restore canvas fence\n\nFailed Save-As cleanup called canvasFence(workflow). The fence destructures\n{ workflow }, so the record itself always failed closed (\"source canvas\nrestore returned false\") and the next graph read hit root-shape-mismatch\non a partial canvas.\n\nFixes #2257\n\n* fix(2257): keep Save-As identity after refresh_nodes\n\nProve destination uuid+path on the canvas before a Save-As refusal, recapture\nthe active tracker after panel_refresh_nodes, and recapture after a proven\nsource restore so cleanup cannot leave root-shape-mismatch.","reason":"valid","signature":"----