.5, then a Vue/widget-store flush re-assigned the parent combo and\nrebuilt children from spec defaults. The graphToPrompt wrap was too late:\npanel_query_graph already showed 2.\n\nWrap live COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3 parents before the write so a same-value\nparent assign restores the live children.\n\nFixes #2031\n\n* fix(2031): wrap DynamicCombo parents after schema fetch before the write\n\nThe first wrap ran before getFreshObjectInfo. Re-wrap the live parent immediately before applyWidgetWrite so a Vue remount during that await cannot leave mode.scale unprotected.","tree":{"sha":"4bbf3dea3b32eda4e63d27eb2d1a306f49c4a7ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/4bbf3dea3b32eda4e63d27eb2d1a306f49c4a7ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/bbba5724d7563b4d40e5be0c9624eecace56a4c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bbf3dea3b32eda4e63d27eb2d1a306f49c4a7ba\nparent 52943cfcb7c30c5110748ba0961911f18ea755fe\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788600321 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788600321 -0700\n\nfix(2031): keep DynamicCombo dotted FLOAT writes across the set_widget flush (#2258)\n\n* fix(2031): keep DynamicCombo dotted FLOAT writes across the set_widget flush\n\npanel_set_widget on MinimaxH3LatentUpscaler3D mode.scale returned applied:true\nfor 2→1.5, then a Vue/widget-store flush re-assigned the parent combo and\nrebuilt children from spec defaults. The graphToPrompt wrap was too late:\npanel_query_graph already showed 2.\n\nWrap live COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3 parents before the write so a same-value\nparent assign restores the live children.\n\nFixes #2031\n\n* fix(2031): wrap DynamicCombo parents after schema fetch before the write\n\nThe first wrap ran before getFreshObjectInfo. Re-wrap the live parent immediately before applyWidgetWrite so a Vue remount during that await cannot leave mode.scale unprotected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATUR