ail":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T22:12:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(2249): age out switch fence after delivered workflow_open (#2250)\n\nA pending settle/safe-repaint step kept activeWorkflowReloadGuard immune\nto the 30s ceiling, so workflow_list, mode:current, and graph_outline\nstayed refused for minutes after an applied open. Exempt the recovery\nprobe, journal applied once the frontend names TARGET, and unlatch\ndispatch when that receipt matches — leftover previous-tab graph still\nfails closed via switchRepaintUnproven.","tree":{"sha":"7c57006ef8c910f12c1c9e6fcebb71e2cfb6d7c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/7c57006ef8c910f12c1c9e6fcebb71e2cfb6d7c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/cfd39db715c24f60f280c05c5e8b5e8431685133","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c57006ef8c910f12c1c9e6fcebb71e2cfb6d7c3\nparent d7316a5a70fe2b18dcc32caea5d5dc3c4f78ce02\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788559921 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788559921 -0700\n\nfix(2249): age out switch fence after delivered workflow_open (#2250)\n\nA pending settle/safe-repaint step kept activeWorkflowReloadGuard immune\nto the 30s ceiling, so workflow_list, mode:current, and graph_outline\nstayed refused for minutes after an applied open. Exempt the recovery\nprobe, journal applied once the frontend names TARGET, and unlatch\ndispatch when that receipt matches — leftover previous-tab graph still\nfails closed via switchRepaintUnproven.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqm0IxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxQMQAAdG70KdAJ2P1dUPMqWHaf9C\nx3cYIyMHZ5RNPkLzJ8gNpV7lFNvaBOxsclsUz6nJ0/ecafFQWzd3CDJGKWcGZDDB\nNQTg4iXY6JQWf7kd9nuTUXhRdGfHb3FR9Om20Z0gBZppucURt0167zPT9fQRCFk6\npQlt3lONKOSOgjnd51TMLJrEeeSfF+8Ae9bxDRqPStCtJFuE0LCO5tUvYDaXr3qC\nRAmCPS