51fa6746687d86402a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:52:44Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:52:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(984): keep missing models named on a promoted subgraph rail (#2245)\n\nThe load-time missing-asset store blames the inner locator. After\npromotion the inner widget may hold an on-disk fallback while the host\nrail still names the absent file (#1181). Treating \"inner no longer\nholds the filename\" as a user fix made panel_get_errors report clean\nwhile the turn-start scan still named the MiniMaxH3 paths.\n\nStill-referenced now also looks at the host rail (and the reverse),\nand the live combo scan walks nested subgraphs from the bound root.","tree":{"sha":"23195c276785f7c5d409308e42e7d6986a88eaf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/23195c276785f7c5d409308e42e7d6986a88eaf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/020f4c946ba28c23fb0d951fa6746687d86402a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 23195c276785f7c5d409308e42e7d6986a88eaf6\nparent 9b04aa06cbf688726d75054ecc118e06481bee54\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788526364 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788526364 -0700\n\nfix(984): keep missing models named on a promoted subgraph rail (#2245)\n\nThe load-time missing-asset store blames the inner locator. After\npromotion the inner widget may hold an on-disk fallback while the host\nrail still names the absent file (#1181). Treating \"inner no longer\nholds the filename\" as a user fix made panel_get_errors report clean\nwhile the turn-start scan still named the MiniMaxH3 paths.\n\nStill-referenced now also looks at the host rail (and the reverse),\nand the live combo scan walks nested subgraphs from the bound root.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqm