ed\nvalue sources.\n\n* fix(1181): resolve primitive GetNode buses through SetNode\n\nA GetNode INT/STRING feeding a subgraph input still dropped the linked\nprimitive; follow the matching SetNode instead of writing the bus name.\nTensor GetNode outputs stay untouched.","tree":{"sha":"c7084da819e085e4b0e430e8026b74e23c4e000a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/c7084da819e085e4b0e430e8026b74e23c4e000a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/3fb5d047ce20a70d731946f53c5a085d52e2371d","verification":{"payload":"tree c7084da819e085e4b0e430e8026b74e23c4e000a\nparent 79d43e77ebf15fe04a13cc9842ffcacd06d8a4a7\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788521855 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788521855 -0700\n\nfix(1181): copy promoted subgraph values into the compiled prompt (#2243)\n\n* fix(1181): copy promoted subgraph values into the compiled prompt\n\n#1327 only disclosed that graphToPrompt drops a virtual PrimitiveNode at a\nsubgraph boundary. The Krea2 recurrence still executed stored inner width,\nheight, and prompt while panel_run warned about GetNode bus relays.\n\nPatch the serialized prompt (not the live graph) with promoted rails and\nlinked primitive payloads, and stop treating GetNode/SetNode as dropped\nvalue sources.\n\n* fix(1181): resolve primitive GetNode buses through SetNode\n\nA GetNode INT/STRING feeding a subgraph input still dropped the linked\nprimitive; follow the matching SetNode instead of writing the bus name.\nTensor GetNode outputs stay untouched.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmq1/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApF4QABmXx//V5F6xJ5AGHw0Ef1Wp\nyWqbT1k6fz+GslLcn3eQKhzGLhmhu8A1fsNoYnWqec35tiSJKYBNNyN3kjjUSClA\n7CYeGhoqKyde4VhXrWvq+HbSrh7zLvZpFxba3KH8xE0avhPauINs0fgduTGSbeO3\ngTDzROFp9ze3RpdrZb2hZnzKMI5xY0+Knl0n6+S3xCJE0dj5vAbUhChHZdP0ZTH0\nsNkUpxNCC/8yvrHIc7tPP5w+GvmRq7JqYcF2dkKAWFgW+h0J66ruiKjGgqbOFGZx\nXKJMwWD