i.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/32c7fad9aa67f0ce7bc711acd733d97b2bb992ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:39:18Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:39:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(#2234): reuse storyboard identity on refused completion retries (#2235)\n\nA down bridge decrements the unacked budget (intentional for #370/#1739),\nso every 20s sweep re-composed the same finished video. Persist the\nidentity and uploaded refs on the video record, replay that batch instead\nof minting a fresh /history object, and skip sample/upload when the sheet\nalready exists. New completions still cache-bust.\n\nCloses #2234","tree":{"sha":"ae91584dff1bccfcb38a7c205eac2b93beeb3c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/ae91584dff1bccfcb38a7c205eac2b93beeb3c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/32c7fad9aa67f0ce7bc711acd733d97b2bb992ea","verification":{"payload":"tree ae91584dff1bccfcb38a7c205eac2b93beeb3c05\nparent 6ca93ad2b8f80a4f8e09b16efa77c84859097895\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788500358 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788500358 -0700\n\nfix(#2234): reuse storyboard identity on refused completion retries (#2235)\n\nA down bridge decrements the unacked budget (intentional for #370/#1739),\nso every 20s sweep re-composed the same finished video. Persist the\nidentity and uploaded refs on the video record, replay that batch instead\nof minting a fresh /history object, and skip sample/upload when the sheet\nalready exists. New completions still cache-bust.\n\nCloses #2234","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmlmGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM0UQAGTRvls7csJYTRz/mKg54k40\nZn2Dd9zZJpR+m42mPddV+rJ7/y