complete\npromoted_terminals and panel_set_widget refused width/height/seed writes\nthat outline already listed.\n\nRebind each host input/widget onto the unique same-named subgraph input-rail\nslot after load and after panel_refresh_nodes. Resolve PrimitiveInt.value\nterminals through that slot, and do not let a stale file proxyWidgets pair\nveto a live parent-rail-authenticated witness.","tree":{"sha":"431bcfb234b4184d6b739da912a004c8d83374b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/431bcfb234b4184d6b739da912a004c8d83374b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/44575e058efd5fdcd01bbbeb4da2a3bfd64e799d","verification":{"payload":"tree 431bcfb234b4184d6b739da912a004c8d83374b9\nparent 3e0e3dbb01fe0d872d3b24fad40856c3216d8baf\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788489945 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788489945 -0700\n\nfix(#2225): rebuild promoted-terminal mapping after reopen (#2226)\n\nworkflow_open published the instance fence while a modified subgraph still\nhad unbound _subgraphSlot rails, so graph_get_subgraph emitted incomplete\npromoted_terminals and panel_set_widget refused width/height/seed writes\nthat outline already listed.\n\nRebind each host input/widget onto the unique same-named subgraph input-rail\nslot after load and after panel_refresh_nodes. Resolve PrimitiveInt.value\nterminals through that slot, and do not let a stale file proxyWidgets pair\nveto a live parent-rail-authenticated witness.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmjDZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+2EQAK2fDqx4MjDbg9qgXJpuRWrO\n1kOE5L42rXSpOv0j5u3szhA0smdYSorHe1UeOQBo2xT1pelel/TwmBTgb9917ZA3\nE1lxurW3oimhChoaPOE/s/P7dDZo5jLHfHXDqhsTHQ1ElxygxxSc8JaswmbkFuQE\nYRtxLKXt0KTTSU6gv9O5NP8EuSOpVta2Cc1WaUOHlf2k1lPlzutwgp+7UvPnDjsu\nYSF0xLfaYWiSxiYh0Ou/JybUtJoCbwyrMlu+ZjUSQmfQcrIf4extm4Y59rXpsLQx\nWypLqt7N5JNZ8bfOB5UqEFfWX0uqoWdSy3FZH0037AEUJ82KC+5uU1cG3t/118MW\n