let inside the shipped section. check-changelog reads released\nsections as fact and cannot see that.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y","tree":{"sha":"9867ffd4dbba86c173ff4f7f5605d653d3ed99f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/9867ffd4dbba86c173ff4f7f5605d653d3ed99f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/a77864002020470673282574d7fe19fa3453d8de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7666455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/artokun","id":7666455,"login":"artokun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjY0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commit/a77864002020470673282574d7fe19fa3453d8de","node_id":"C_kwDOS48I39oAKGE3Nzg2NDAwMjAyMDQ3MDY3MzI4MjU3NGQ3ZmUxOWZhMzQ1M2Q4ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commit/a9f38867aa2a4bc3c91b4b1706944ec7872724b8","sha":"a9f38867aa2a4bc3c91b4b1706944ec7872724b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/a9f38867aa2a4bc3c91b4b1706944ec7872724b8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commit/c58396dccec6d23d01a4ab2e4dfc29000bc68a1b","sha":"c58396dccec6d23d01a4ab2e4dfc29000bc68a1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/c58396dccec6d23d01a4ab2e4dfc29000bc68a1b"}],"sha":"a77864002020470673282574d7fe19fa3453d8de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/a77864002020470673282574d7fe19fa3453d8de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7666455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/artokun","id":7666455,"login":"artokun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjY0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/c58396dccec6d23d01a4ab2e4dfc29000bc68a1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:44:18Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:44:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(2057): keep graph_get_subgraph ownership envelope untruncated (#2209)\n\n* fix(2057): keep graph_get_subgraph ownership envelope untruncated\n\nMCP''s promoted-write fence treats truncated !== false as an incomplete\nownership envelope and will not dispatch graph_set_widget. A 162-node\nwrapper was sliced at MAX_STATE_NODES, so panel_set_widget refused a\npromoted model_name write even though promoted_terminals was complete.\n\ngraph_get_subgraph now publishes the full inner node list with\ntruncated:false. Older MCP treated an unset flag as a veto, so the\nboolean is emitted even when the list is complete. Listing caps stay\non graph_get_state and panel_query_graph.\n\nFixes #2057.\n\n* test(2057): pin untruncated graph_get_subgraph node list\n\n* chore(2057): keep the entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 promotion\n\nThe merge with main was CLEAN, which is the dangerous case: the release had\nalready moved the Unreleased block into [0.15.162], so git placed this branch''s\nown bullet inside the released section. check-changelog cannot see that -- it\nreads the released sections as fact -- so it passed while the entry claimed to\nhave shipped in a version that was already tagged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f86de7b4fd0a3a80d71fe4397b727c2f8195a206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/f86de7b4fd0a3a80d71fe4397b727c2f8195a206"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/c58396dccec6d23d01a4ab2e4dfc29000bc68a1b","verification":{"payload":"tree f86de7b4fd0a3a80d71fe4397b727c2f8195a206\nparent 1a21adb993d445684b6a77a54aeb451010f8ba79\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788464658 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788464658 -0700\n\nfix(2057): keep graph_get_subgraph ownership envelope untruncated (#2209)\n\n* fix(2057): keep graph_get_subgraph ownership envelope untruncated\n\nMCP''s promoted-write fence treats truncated !== false as an incomplete\nownership envelope and will not dispatch graph_set_widget. A 162-node\nwrapper was sliced at MAX_STATE_NODES, so panel_set_widget refused a\npromoted model_name write even though promoted_terminals was complete.\n\ngraph_get_subgraph now publishes the full inner node list with\ntruncated:false. Older MCP treated an unset flag as a veto, so the\nboolean is emitted even when the list is complete. Listing caps stay\non graph_get_state and panel_query_graph.\n\nFixes #2057.\n\n* test(2057): pin untruncated graph_get_subgraph node list\n\n* chore(2057): keep the entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 promotion\n\nThe merge with main was CLEAN, which is the dangerous case: the release had\nalready moved the Unreleased block into [0.15.162], so git placed this branch''s\nown bullet inside the released section. check-changelog cannot see that -- it\nreads the released sections as fact -- so it passed while the entry claimed to\nhave shipped in a version that was already tagged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmc4SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAenAQAJWLdA0QKD0kKzaH+Mgtp0FA\nfMllwCj8tY2EVrW6Yt10OCi7BqPiaV+K0sqrgtsJGILWpIUorWdZTeqfeNjyPPP0\neAC+AtmKpNQbxGCkcMkiIU/9lMmsyQzoRPnnZvdPmWmKEqwv8DHXL+v6TVjDAiv1\nrvUVZRFsN5iA1Yup0k4tTAeOz1wh38W5p24dzzuZFxTowNvDiPc8yhBwhXaaSwmp\n0zH4rhB4jjktOkBxlr5ZHxMUHyXsehz4ac1uHRTAhwyYy4KG5D++2GunqhA+AGjn\nCfS7WsYS4GM0LTBcWdzzwiarCZhXn9ueKUSDJNTSOq9ZG6yVVQ4PYim+QYxPzWSn\n6M9rdmV8DBXz9ajF45Hse18cB2nxhN6p2L6CRUZ6ZTe5yOVHlBQVzaMTDdHscb0e\nyGN5asJtMajnVEzdD0BQDsmGIh73CJcbT4ntV4k+I+khYDFN2PCRJdmyruhXewyb\ne88eCElatQlXAxD0zxWJmkY+MLJip3CPnhY348goxUS+gCvZfFngvRPqHNCaCitZ\nuY+DkkkNrUTN5Lkai6dM9BUhLWoiWG+tFm9E6GYx3is6TPm+VYDqfso640Bf4gkV\ngjksY82/P5A7ZJBXoZCaeRPCWyiH479A87QxVU3rdwdietgwQYIMGzbWQmLENr5o\nEUvIxHH0wUuXCgJuKQaE\n=k3ww