okun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/artokun","id":7666455,"login":"artokun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjY0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/artokun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/commits/1a21adb993d445684b6a77a54aeb451010f8ba79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:37:40Z","email":"art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com","name":"Arthur R Longbottom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:37:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(#2128): count custom-key saved videos as saved output (#2207)\n\n* fix(#2128): count custom-key saved videos as saved output\n\nSave3DAdvanced already reports as saved output on v0.15.160. The issue\nreopened because NKDVideoViewer with save_output=true parks a real MP4\nunder the custom `nkd_video` key as {filename, subfolder, type:\"output\"}.\nThat key matches neither images/gifs/videos nor /(?:images|gifs|videos)$/,\nso collectNodeOutputMedia ignored it and buildStillsSegment inferred\n\"no saved output node ran … Add a SaveImage node\" from 16 preview taps.\n\nSaved videos on unrecognised keys now join deliverable (existing\nstoryboard path). buildStillsSegment is told about type:output videos\nand withheld saved files, so it names them instead of claiming nothing\nran. CompareFrames temps and a genuinely preview-only run are unchanged.\n\n* chore(changelog): keep the entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 promotion\n\n* chore: keep this branch''s entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 release\n\nThe release promoted the Unreleased block wholesale, so merging main filed this\nbranch''s own bullet inside the shipped [0.15.162] section. check-changelog reads\nreleased sections as fact and cannot see that, so it passed either way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a627000e7f16bd557cd5f5f847fe492b3e9eb64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/trees/9a627000e7f16bd557cd5f5f847fe492b3e9eb64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/artokun/comfyui-mcp-panel/git/commits/1a21adb993d445684b6a77a54aeb451010f8ba79","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a627000e7f16bd557cd5f5f847fe492b3e9eb64\nparent dccefc324846c0a7c6452617a927ebdac6e20c8c\nauthor Arthur R Longbottom <art.longbottom.jr@gmail.com> 1788464260 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788464260 -0700\n\nfix(#2128): count custom-key saved videos as saved output (#2207)\n\n* fix(#2128): count custom-key saved videos as saved output\n\nSave3DAdvanced already reports as saved output on v0.15.160. The issue\nreopened because NKDVideoViewer with save_output=true parks a real MP4\nunder the custom `nkd_video` key as {filename, subfolder, type:\"output\"}.\nThat key matches neither images/gifs/videos nor /(?:images|gifs|videos)$/,\nso collectNodeOutputMedia ignored it and buildStillsSegment inferred\n\"no saved output node ran … Add a SaveImage node\" from 16 preview taps.\n\nSaved videos on unrecognised keys now join deliverable (existing\nstoryboard path). buildStillsSegment is told about type:output videos\nand withheld saved files, so it names them instead of claiming nothing\nran. CompareFrames temps and a genuinely preview-only run are unchanged.\n\n* chore(changelog): keep the entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 promotion\n\n* chore: keep this branch''s entry under Unreleased after the 0.15.162 release\n\nThe release promoted the Unreleased block wholesale, so merging main filed this\nbranch''s own bullet inside the shipped [0.15.162] section. check-changelog reads\nreleased sections as fact and cannot see that, so it passed either way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GqXS5Qys1hiK9aDdXJRJ6Y\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmcyECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANCsQAJn/1CuHF30BuSDz7A3jf6iU\n5i7ufjXs1B1rpv+k5R7JID4nZWBoRQpuwNyeW7AYQ2Z4VhqMvem3MOT2ehifnpv1\nR1bNNZdqwi5nlSH3k1hLgEtV2ELe/X7PvC4lRIMbyS/WXLgY/Nj0CxcPvzlyXnbu\nOTtiXCMgrI+hcW1OIwN5qf+pqKufCxamiqhS82oV90GT8DW4HZ0DiVqZGv3rNDdm\nCfIaSrmcHIlJueXkPvL1J+wM8dCgM9Suyc40/bgsP5uFPNV/LPrP60s7oNmSFiUz\naLp3hhne+6/rgcmfhon7YvgJEWjhtmG/mpDPMztKzpYsjM0RmJEaa1WqLNsWkh75\nFjzzKm1JO6MAXXm+TEfmkZSIS0tMPylWTLUw2Y9aX9h3/4GDtC6Cf5zH61iRI8qb\nR+VAqyCGYE2dfHCEJ01g98VaNhF28t7LqDBbQ4QznDXr/nal4d1UwidawCRTT09X\nvO975i/T8DgW1y9zbCpoGZn244kVJiTF9TCy8zVcjXacwv2eLJfD4wQKA4PzSiIR\nsbuAHt4XAsWS2asj88cYx7F/yvAHdlaWXK5ZXU0w83GbSuurCMiO68mREc7XFHHQ\n8oP4AERan/iwoimDf0J6vHrGvnLcFd3IKq9MrHxH0wJ+cDWYGNwkcoCTWqXkTLBu\nddZ6K56OSSoyjV0fXwTy\n=+773\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T19:37:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl