ing + plan JSON). Gate cũ dùng\nextractFirstJsonObject — hàm này QUÉT cả ''{'' con, nên khi plan ngoài chưa đóng nó\nkhớp SỚM step con {id,role,input,direction} -> render ID/ROLE/INPUT/DIRECTION, rồi\nkhi plan ngoài đóng lại nhảy sang reasoning sạch = flash.\n\nThêm firstJsonObjectClosed() (chỉ xét khối từ ''{'' ĐẦU TIÊN đã cân bằng, không quét\n''{'' con) và dùng làm gate orchReady -> giữ hint tới khi plan NGOÀI đóng, render 1 lần sạch.\n\nnode --test 100/100 · vue-tsc sạch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1837d2d2d40636d5796e761f0d0a17e9e6e284ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/1837d2d2d40636d5796e761f0d0a17e9e6e284ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/048faa2922999b88bb24024da015d33a144e4f01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173996404?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/danghohai2004","id":173996404,"login":"danghohai2004","node_id":"U_kgDOCl75dA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danghohai2004","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/048faa2922999b88bb2