/users/cds0987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/1c10a8ee7e7bed336e186172708260c6ff6a34ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T09:31:09Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T09:31:09Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"message":"fix(rag-worker): doc.access delete-cascade chết do NATS \"consumer already bound\"\n\nTriệu chứng: xóa doc (document-service bulk/single delete) KHÔNG xóa Qdrant\nvector + GCS artifact -> orphan tích lũy (khảo sát prod: 1636 loadtest doc rác,\n1 đợt = 5753 point orphan, phải xóa Qdrant tay).\n\nNguyên nhân: 6 replica (5 ingest-worker + 1 search) đều durable push-subscribe\nCÙNG consumer -> chỉ 1 bind được, 5 cái \"consumer already bound\". Và 2\nsubscription (doc.ingest + doc.access) chung 1 try/except -> ingest \"already\nbound\" raise -> doc.access KHÔNG start -> delete-cascade dừng hẳn (handler 0\nfiring/60'' dù xóa 200+ doc). Restart deploy còn tệ hơn: binding cũ chưa nhả ->\ninstance mới raise -> không ai retry -> chết luôn.\n\nFix:\n- runtime.py: tách try RIÊNG mỗi subscription + KHÔNG tear-down broker khi 1 cái\n  fail -> instance thua race ingest VẪN bind được doc.access -> cascade chạy lại.\n- nats_client.subscribe: retry 5 nhịp x2s khi \"already bound\" (chờ binding cũ\n  nhả), lỗi khác raise ngay -> restart-safe.\n- test: 3 ca retry (nhả->bám lại / lỗi khác raise ngay / hết nhịp bỏ cuộc).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee9c74fe97837d06762aa789ff9af4067c9293b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/ee9c74fe97837d06762aa789ff9af4067c9293b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/1c10a8ee7e7bed336e186172708260c6ff6a34ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fals