ehuuhung2001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/c1ead292e80a4981973c6019ea63566f21545eac","node_id":"C_kwDOS48NV9oAKGMxZWFkMjkyZTgwYTQ5ODE5NzNjNjAxOWVhNjM1NjZmMjE1NDVlYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/8e6429f7c801c33b2a9749fe337b25557828ade8","sha":"8e6429f7c801c33b2a9749fe337b25557828ade8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/8e6429f7c801c33b2a9749fe337b25557828ade8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/ce97c5ed4b72f08929a201da4a0f3a2c95059e1a","sha":"ce97c5ed4b72f08929a201da4a0f3a2c95059e1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/ce97c5ed4b72f08929a201da4a0f3a2c95059e1a"}],"sha":"c1ead292e80a4981973c6019ea63566f21545eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/c1ead292e80a4981973c6019ea63566f21545eac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96464915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lehuuhung2001","id":96464915,"login":"lehuuhung2001","node_id":"U_kgDOBb_wEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/8e6429f7c801c33b2a9749fe337b25557828ade8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:33:07Z","email":"huuhung1962001@gmail.com","name":"Huu Hung"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:33:07Z","email":"huuhung1962001@gmail.com","name":"Huu Hung"},"message":"fix(query): không lộ raw worker data ra user + fail mềm mọi lỗi stream\n\nLỗi user gặp: chatbot trả về raw JSON nội bộ (''[rag_retrieve · ...] {\"results\":[...]}'')\nthay vì câu trả lời. Gốc: khi LLM node verify_answer timeout/lỗi -> answer=None ->\ncode cũ fallback `answer = data_text` (format nội bộ chỉ dành cho LLM) -> orchestration\nword-chunk thẳng JSON thô ra UI.\n\nSửa (defense-in-depth):\n- verify_answer: LLM fail -> câu thân thiện, TUYỆT ĐỐI không dùng data_text làm answer.\n- Guard _is_raw_data_leak (regex cấu trúc ''[role_snake_case]'' tổng quát — phủ mọi role\n  hiện có lẫn role thêm sau) ở orchestration boundary: answer mang nhãn worker -> chặn,\n  không bao giờ word-chunk JSON ra user.\n- Lưới an toàn top-level ở stream(): mọi exception chưa lường (DB/ACL/context fetch raise\n  TRƯỚC graph) -> kết thúc bằng done-event sạch + câu xin lỗi, KHÔNG để client đứt kết nối.\n- _save_assistant + output_guardrail.redact -> best-effort: lỗi không chặn done-event\n  (answer đã stream tới user; save/redact lỗi -> log, vẫn chốt message).\n\nTests: +5 (guard unit + regression LLM-fail-không-lộ-JSON + stream-luôn-emit-done).\n338 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f380463d7cf35c14ab2b8aae5d2491bc8d79f887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/f380463d7cf35c14ab2b8aae5d2491bc8d79f887"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/8e6429f7c801c33b2a9749fe337b25557828ade8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96464915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/events{/pr