át hiện qua Langfuse (7/8 trace huuhung@gmail.com leak). 2 bug:\nBUG#1 (raw-dump, 6/7): graph_builder verify_answer khi answer rỗng -> fallback ''data_text'' = context\n  THÔ ''[rag_retrieve]{results,document_name,parent_text...}'' -> DUMP JSON nguyên khối ra message.\n  Fix: bỏ fallback data_text -> CHỈ message an toàn (không bao giờ dump context).\nBUG#2 (<NEED_MORE> leak, 1/7): _VA_NEEDMORE regex đòi ''<<NEED_MORE>>'' (2 ngoặc) nhưng model //hóa\n  reasoning-off nhả ''<NEED_MORE>'' (1 ngoặc) -> không khớp -> sentinel RÒ vào answer. Fix:\n  - regex tolerant ''<+ NEED[_ ]?MORE >+'' (1+ ngoặc, _ hoặc space) + _VA_NEEDMORE_START.\n  - streaming ''answer'' mode: gặp <NEED_MORE> cuối -> NGỪNG stream (answer_done), không leak sentinel.\n  - đã trả lời rồi mới nhả NEED_MORE -> KHÔNG replan (strip sentinel khỏi state).\nTest: +6 case (single/double bracket, space, start-detect, trailing-strip), 45 pass va_split + 62 verify.\nĐiều tra: eval/playwright-eval/lf_huuhung_leak.py (Langfuse 2-layer login -> soi trace user).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4f744e91638d16870da26ea0fa059b8a4df454d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/d4f744e91638d16870da26ea0fa059b8a4df454d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/6a85ab215ba4ffbff871974d4d06c8be02271943","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124873197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987","id":124873197,"login":"cds0987","node_id":"U_kgDOB3Fp7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds09