id":124873197,"login":"cds0987","node_id":"U_kgDOB3Fp7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/8f7ecf3d27a9b12bdfeb5c010f76a719d1a6a2d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:43:22Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:43:22Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"message":"fix(ai-router): embed est = MAX per-text (KHÔNG sum batch) — fix no_capacity 503 do feasible_model\n\nGỐC 7/14 doc mất khi re-ingest: est=SUM(100 chunk/batch)~8300 tok > context_length bge-m3(8192)\n-> feasible_model loại OAN -> resolve None -> 503 no_capacity (KHÔNG phải credit/inflight/429).\ncontext_length là PER-TEXT (mỗi text embed độc lập, ≤ ctx). Phải MAX per-text (~200 tok) < mọi ctx.\nKhớp phân bố quan sát: qwen8b(ctx32k) hầu như qua, pplx(ctx4096)/bge-m3(8192) loại nhiều = batch\nsum vượt ctx nhỏ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ca701c9f9b0ff235040a76f6f187d7491f0a149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/1ca701c9f9b0ff235040a76f6f187d7491f0a149"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/8f7ecf3d27a9b12bdfeb5c010f76a719d1a6a2d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124873197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c