ers/cds0987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commits/a0322d9b567f7fc721660944cac5b88daf445390/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:33:28Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:33:28Z","email":"ttnguyen1410@gmail.com","name":"cds0987"},"message":"fix(ai-router): bỏ AIMD inflight-cap cho embed (no_inflight_cap) — đẩy thoải mái + failover\n\nGỐC: embed ingest 503 ''no capacity'' KHÔNG phải hết tiền/credit (single call vẫn chạy, key còn\ntiền) — mà ai-router TỰ bóp: AIMD inflight gate cap N-call-đồng-thời/key (init 8, shrink ->2 khi\n429) -> dưới concurrency vượt cap -> tự trả no_capacity 503. AIMD = throttle cho CHAT (dò trần\nOpenRouter qua 429 kiểu TCP-congestion), PHẢN tác dụng cho embed (throughput-bound).\n\nFIX (cơ chế LLM-router chuẩn — LiteLLM/OpenRouter routing):\n- adaptive_balanced: param no_inflight_cap -> KHÔNG gate inflight (bỏ acquire_inflight), round-robin\n  key (next_seq) rải đều, GIỮ failover: live đã loại key cooldown-on-429 + router retry-across-keys\n  + reserve(RPM/daily) backstop. Bão hòa = provider tự 429 -> cooldown key -> key kế; chỉ fail khi\n  MỌI key cooldown/cạn-quota. CHỈ áp tier OpenRouter embed (chat giữ AIMD nguyên).\n- routing.yaml: 5 capability embed thêm no_inflight_cap:true.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14c2e55be248f4f7a965a718096b1b3aa0f3cd32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/14c2e55be248f4f7a965a718096b1b3aa0f3cd32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/a0322d9b567f7fc721660944cac5b88daf445390","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu