d) — e5large ctx=512 hết bị loại oan\n\nHệ quả phụ của commit trước (est_tokens 0->est cho TPM-spread): estimate_tokens = chars//4 +\nDEFAULT_OUTPUT_EST(600) -> MỌI embed est ≥600 > ctx model nhỏ -> feasible_model loại e5large\n(ctx=512) -> no_capacity 503. embed KHÔNG sinh output nên +600 vô nghĩa. Đổi est = input tokens\nTHẬT (input-only) -> e5large feasible cho chunk ngắn + te3s vẫn TPM-spread đúng theo input.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5639103a02d09c4a7b3735a54a41fb5a7c8b3625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/5639103a02d09c4a7b3735a54a41fb5a7c8b3625"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/6a6b1f041fb1cefcd6f475cb465aa0b0e8a5c100","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124873197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987","id":124873197,"login":"cds0987","node_id":"U_kgDOB3Fp7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/6a6b1f041fb1cefcd6f475cb465aa0b0e8a5c100","node_id":"C_kwDOS48NV9oAKDZhNmIxZjA0MWZiMWNlZmNkNmY0NzVjYjQ2NWFhMGIwZThhNWMxMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https:/