)=0.96; gửi model=e5large vs qwen8b ra Y HỆT). routing.yaml\nđã có alias+capability embed_e5large/bgem3/pplx/te3s nhưng router CHƯA route tới -> tính năng dở dang.\n\nFIX:\n- router.embeddings(): capability_alias = body[''model''] -> resolve THẬT (qwen8b->embed, e5large->\n  embed_e5large, te3s->embed_te3s/OpenAI...). emit/trace/handle_error/canon dùng cap_label thật.\n  est_tokens=est (was 0) cho TPM-spread. Primary qwen8b KHÔNG đổi (model=qwen8b->embed như cũ).\n- routing.yaml: 5 capability embed thêm selector adaptive_balanced (rải ĐỀU mọi key: OpenAI theo\n  TPM, OpenRouter theo AIMD) thay banded dồn key-1 (embed token nhỏ -> band 250K không đầy -> kẹt\n  key-1, 4 key bỏ phí -> burst 5-embed/query đập 1 key -> 429/tail 54s). KHÔNG save_mode (embed\n  cấm degrade model = vỡ vector space). te3s giữ embed_oai (5 key OpenAI).\n\nVerified: OpenRouter serve THẬT e5large(intfloat)/bge-m3(parasail)/pplx — dim đúng native.\nSAU deploy phải: clear 5 collection (data qwen8b giả) + re-ingest ra embedding THẬT đa model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d3039b1ac835b9bb3a9b9d578e2ba50d9a37582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/5d3039b1ac835b9bb3a9b9d578e2ba50d9a37582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/96377ca2b337e7b8bc90d7f3d5bfca70b5311b1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124873197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987","id":124873197,"login":"cds0987","node_id":"U_kgDOB3Fp7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds09