vider-bound ~18 chunk/s.\n\nREAD: query embed × 5 model -> search 5 collection -> merge candidate (dedup chunk_id) -> rerank.\nACL + hợp đồng /api/search giữ. Doc cũ replicate vẫn tìm được qua merge; doc mới shard. Tradeoff:\nread 5× embed/query (parallelized). mode: replicate|shard (default replicate; embeddings.yaml=shard).\n16 test (shard determinism/spread/primary-slot, read merge dedup+ACL+fail-isolation, replicate compat).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef9fe448d6e82c47088cb35d654b5d725d01a9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/ef9fe448d6e82c47088cb35d654b5d725d01a9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/643f1709b334a4b434f1f1a2df00d0acdf096336","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124873197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987","id":124873197,"login":"cds0987","node_id":"U_kgDOB3Fp7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cds0987","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/643f1709b334a4b434f1f1a2df00d0acdf096336","node_id":"C_kwDOS48NV9oAKDY0M2YxNzA5YjMzNGE0YjQzNGYxZjFhMmRmMDBkMGFjZGYwOTYzMzY","parents":[{"ht