: mcp-service THIN -> rag-worker POST /api/search -> mcp rerank\n- rag-worker: ingest + query-search (:8000 nội bộ); prod tách rag-ingest-worker x8 + gotenberg\n- ai-router selector: banded_rotation (default) + adaptive_balanced override\n- Agent graph: orchestrate -> worker -> join -> verify_answer (gộp verify+synth+citation)\n- api-spec: thêm endpoint ingest nội bộ của rag-worker\n- Mới: docs/ai-architecture.md (kiến trúc AI), docs/document-taxonomy.md (loại tài liệu nội bộ + ACL)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee764c0c77b82e3d66c0cad06d6636d04b3ab5f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/trees/ee764c0c77b82e3d66c0cad06d6636d04b3ab5f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/git/commits/c46e28ddf325122de7e22b496a0e5f961c142290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96464915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lehuuhung2001","id":96464915,"login":"lehuuhung2001","node_id":"U_kgDOBb_wEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lehuuhung2001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cds0987/DA08-VSF-AI/commit/c46e28ddf32512