timurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2d40bda88ee6194d495734a79cba4b9c849d05d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T17:09:01Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T17:09:01Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"blocks 5+6: maturity stage filter + admin materials CRUD + debug session view\n\nFinal two blocks of the canonical scope.\n\n§3 ''Стадии зрелости'' lands as a first-class field on CorpusEntry\n(integer 0..5, nullable). On startup, backfill_default_maturity sets\nthe stage for any row where it is still NULL using a kind-based\ndefault map (source_card 0, micro_aspect / phase_doc 1, micro_game /\nchimera / precard 2, breed / genome / appspec 3, attractor / r_root\n4). Explicitly-set values are preserved across re-runs.\n\nAPI:\n  GET /api/library/entries  accepts ?maturity=N (exact),\n                            ?maturity_min=N&maturity_max=M (range)\n  PATCH /api/library/entries/{id}/maturity  raises and persists per row.\n  Every entry serializer now exposes maturity_stage.\n\nFrontend:\n  · MaturityBadge component: color-coded chip ''стадия N · подпись''\n  · Library section page gets a maturity filter row (все / 0-5) and\n    the badge on each row card.\n  · Library entry page gets the badge in the header plus an inline\n    select to revise the stage directly.\n\nPhase 16 — Admin + Debug:\n\n  POST   /api/admin/materials               create\n  GET    /api/admin/materials               list all (every game,\n                                            every namespace)\n  PUT    /api/admin/materials/{id}          edit title / payload /\n                                            namespace\n  DELETE /api/admin/materials/{id}          remove\n\nNo app-level auth on the router — the production deployment lives\nbehind Caddy basic_auth, and the local dev surface is intentionally\nopen. If/when accounts ship, this router gets a require_admin\ndependency.\n\nFrontend routes:\n  /admin/materials       — create form + editable row list, JSON-\n                           editor inline. Linked dimly from the home\n                           header so it doesn''t intrude on play flow.\n  /debug/session/{id}    — raw GET /api/sessions/{id} dumped as JSON,\n                           one-pre-block. Profile page now has a\n                           ''debug raw'' tiny link in the header so any\n                           completed session can be opened in raw\n                           form for inspection.\n\nTests (8 new):\n- maturity backfill on startup gives source_card 0, breed 3,\n  attractor 4\n- exact-maturity filter\n- range filter\n- patch endpoint accepts 0-5, rejects out-of-range with 400\n- admin lists all materials (>=12 — one per shipped genre)\n- admin create → put → delete round-trip\n- debug session view goes through the existing /api/sessions/{id}\n  endpoint and returns moves + interventions + trace_profile\n\n127/127 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"b560673e1d75e0b464b46d5181e98c06a735946c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/b560673e1d75e0b464b46d5181e98c06a735946c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/2d40bda88ee6194d495734a79cba4b9c849d05d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","si