:"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/3949836990cf6f58ef9943943ae622e5e6f4949a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:52:59Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:52:59Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"smoke: live chimera_weaver probe through running backend","tree":{"sha":"215f82a59c6e5525dfa8344d38a5e53d9aff823c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/215f82a59c6e5525dfa8344d38a5e53d9aff823c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/3949836990cf6f58ef9943943ae622e5e6f4949a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/3949836990cf6f58ef9943943ae622e5e6f4949a","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDM5NDk4MzY5OTBjZjZmNThlZjk5NDM5NDNhZTYyMmU1ZTZmNDk0OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24","sha":"ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24"}],"sha":"3949836990cf6f58ef9943943ae622e5e6f4949a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/3949836990cf6f58ef9943943ae622e5e6f4949a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:50:55Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:50:55Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"block 4: chimera generator — LLM produces draft genome from two attractors\n\nEach of the 40 chimera matrix cells is now a launchpad: a button on\nthe entry page asks chimera_weaver to produce a draft GameGenome that\nlives at the crossing of the two parent attractors. The draft lands\ndirectly in /configurator as a player-scoped GenomeDraft, ready for\nGameWeaver to attack it.\n\nLLM:\n- New role chimera_weaver with a system prompt that forbids degradation\n  organs and asks for a concrete shape (name, function, single playable\n  verb, maturity_stage 0..5, 1-3 named organs per active bank, one-line\n  critique). The role takes the chimera cell title + body and the FULL\n  canonical organ list per bank as menu — the weaver picks from there\n  whenever possible.\n- Provider mock fills each non-degradation bank with the first canon\n  organ name so test_block4 can drive the full path deterministically.\n- max_tokens 1200 for this role (between the 600 default and the 3500\n  mutator/converter budget).\n\nBackend:\n- POST /api/library/entries/{id}/generate-chimera-draft\n  · 400 if kind != ''chimera''\n  · resolves weaver-returned organ NAMES against existing Organs by\n    case-insensitive name match within the same bank\n  · unknown names become NEW Organs with source=''chimera_generated'' and\n    source_entry_id pointing at the cell, so the banks grow alongside\n    chimera generation (matching the canon §4 ''извлечь орган'' logic\n    in Phase 14)\n  · degradation organs are filtered out unconditionally, no matter what\n    the LLM returns\n  · the resulting GenomeDraft carries weaver_verdict = {critique,\n    source_chimera_id, source_chimera_code} so the design trail is\n    traceable from the chimera cell to the draft\n\nFrontend:\n- Library entry page conditionally renders ''Запросить химеру у LLM''\n  ONLY on entries with kind==''chimera''. Click sends the request and\n  navigates to /configurator where the new draft appears in the\n  player''s draft list and can be edited / re-validated.\n\nTests (5 new):\n- draft is created and linked to the source chimera cell\n- all selected organ ids resolve to existing Organ rows\n- the generated draft passes the playability_critic loop (minimum\n  bank coverage was already filled in)\n- 400 returned when the source kind is not ''chimera''\n- canonical names returned by the weaver are matched, not duplicated\n\n119/119 backend tests pass.\n\nThe ''Блок 1 → Блок 2 → Блок 3 → Блок 4'' loop is now closed:\n  4200 cards (triage) → grow banks → configurator picks organs →\n  GameWeaver validates → playable. Plus: chimera cell → weaver →\n  same flow. Both paths feed the same GenomeDraft table.","tree":{"sha":"bbe77c39088a296c8106635331e83c21489b4e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/bbe77c39088a296c8106635331e83c21489b4e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGVkNmQ4YTkwZTY3ODBmMjA4ZTY1YmNjMjg1YTcyZDY0ZmIxNDVhMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f","sha":"2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f"}],"sha":"ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ed6d8a90e6780f208e65bcc285a72d64fb145a24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:43:13Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:43:13Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"block 3: 7 canonical породы — full 12-genre roster live\n\nCanon §11 (стр. 4011-4131) listed 12 пород; we shipped 5 of them.\nThis commit fills the remaining 7. Each порода gets:\n\n  game_genomes/<id>.json\n  seed_materials_real/<id>/real_<id>_001.json\n  profile builder in services/profile_builder.py\n  entry in BUILDERS\n\nReusing existing field_type renderers (no new field components) keeps\nthe change additive and lets all 7 land in one batch. Mapping:\n\n  4. Промпт-снасть          clickable_text_units  spackler\n  5. Помощник как чужой     card_sorting          literal_alien  (grok-routed)\n  8. Паспорт сцены-агента   card_sorting          prosecutor\n  9. Таможня онтологий      medium_shift_phrase   spackler\n 10. Игра под захватом      clickable_text_units  prosecutor\n 11. Ложное согласие        card_sorting          prosecutor\n 12. Сжечь свой лучший\n      когнитор              card_sorting          sprout_advocate\n\nProfile builders:\n- _generic_card_sorting_profile is the reusable engine for 5/7 of\n  the new породы. Tracks fate distribution, revisions, and the\n  zone the player overuses; produces an actionable directive\n  matching the bias. Each порода wraps it with its own primary\n  dimension name (alien_blindness, agency_detection_bias,\n  consensus_bias, idol_attachment).\n- Prompt Tackle has its own builder (verdict-based scaffold\n  dependency vs over-shedding).\n- Game Under Capture has its own builder (which axis dropped first\n  under pressure — field/proof/subject/register).\n- Ontology Customs has its own builder (preserved/distorted/\n  smuggled/forbidden distribution + new-organ transfer accuracy).\n\nEach new porода''s replay directive vocabulary is sentence-shaped\nand concrete, not ''улучшай различение''.\n\nReal seeds picked from real-world domains:\n  - Prompt Tackle: a 12-unit Russian system+user prompt for analysing\n    a strategic report; a mix of removable scaffold and load-bearing\n    operations.\n  - Assistant as Foreign: 20 LLM answer fragments across 4 alien\n    types (smooth/literal/moral_smoothing/lost_register).\n  - Agent Passport: 16 phrases with confirmed-agent / questionable /\n    decorative-mask / fail labels (city met him with silence vs the\n    archive starts choosing what comes back to work).\n  - Ontology Customs: ''зона ближайшего развития'' across psychology,\n    engineering, philosophy, interface, body — with concrete\n    declarations per crossing.\n  - Game Under Capture: a Friday-evening CTO Slack message with\n    three noise blocks and three load-bearing operational facts.\n  - False Consensus: 16 phrases from a 4-hour strategy session\n    spread across real_action / text_only / silent_dissent /\n    synchrony_only.\n  - Burn Cognitor: 12 candidate cognitor names with stress-test\n    verdicts (organ_extracted / burned / idol_kept / transferred).\n\nFrontend:\n- Play page game-aware default model: assistant_as_foreign also\n  routes to grok-4-0709 because its primary role is literal_alien,\n  same constraint that ships Register Sapper to grok already.\n- No new field component needed; existing renderers handle all 7.\n\nTests:\n- 7 genome-load assertions, 7 real-seed assertions,\n- one full-flow path per порода verifying its dominant profile\n  dimension appears in the trace,\n- one parametrized replay-loop check across all 7 (complete → replay\n  → new material with correct field_type),\n- test_games.py expects the full 12-genre roster now.\n\n114/114 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"d4b6729a064ece5c1268170a5a01180aaf4a46f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/d4b6729a064ece5c1268170a5a01180aaf4a46f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDJlMWNhN2VjMjAyZWI0ZWYwNTA1NTRlNWE2YmY4NjdkNmY5OTRhOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019","sha":"bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019"}],"sha":"2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e1ca7ec202eb4ef050554e5a6bf867d6f994a9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:26:12Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:26:12Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 14: triage 4200 + organ extraction into banks\n\nThe §4 promise from the canonical doc was that every raw unit gets a\nFATE, not a score. This phase makes that operation directly playable\nin the library.\n\nWhat landed:\n\nBackend models:\n- TriageVerdict   one row per (entry × player × decision). Multiple\n                  verdicts per entry are allowed — different players\n                  see the same card differently, and a player can\n                  revise their own call later. Each row stores fate,\n                  optional note, optional extracted_organ_id.\n\n§4 fates (verbatim from canon):\n  bury                   похоронить\n  extract_organ          извлечь орган\n  keep_seed              оставить семенем\n  shrink_to_exercise     сжать до упражнения\n  lift_to_game_exercise  поднять до игры-упражнения\n  cross                  скрестить\n  breed                  вырастить как породу\n  defer_to_interface     отложить до интерфейса\n  forbid                 запретить\n\nOrgan extraction (the load-bearing fate):\n- When fate == extract_organ, the request must carry organ_bank and\n  organ_name. The handler creates a new Organ row with source=''extracted'',\n  source_entry_id pointing back at the card, and a stable code\n  ''<bank>.<slug>_from_<card-suffix>'' that de-dups repeat extractions.\n- The new organ shows up in the configurator''s bank list immediately\n  alongside the canonical 130. From now on you ARE growing the banks\n  by playing through the 4200.\n\nAPI:\n  GET  /api/triage/fates                 the 9 with Russian labels\n  POST /api/triage/entries/{id}          assign a fate\n  GET  /api/triage/entries/{id}          per-entry verdict history\n  GET  /api/triage/queue?kind=...        next entries the current player\n                                         has not yet triaged\n  GET  /api/triage/stats?mine=true       counts per fate + extracted-organ\n                                         total\n\nFrontend:\n- TriagePanel component used in two places:\n  · inside the library entry reader, so any record (not only 4200)\n    can be triaged on its own page;\n  · inside the new /triage queue route, which streams the next 25\n    un-triaged entries of a chosen kind in a vertical pass.\n- /triage shows running counts per fate, a kind filter\n  (source_card / micro_game / micro_aspect / chimera / residual),\n  and the extracted-organs counter so the bank growth is visible.\n- Home page header now links to Library / Triage / Configurator /\n  Operator Profile.\n\n8 backend tests cover the fates list, simple fate assignment, organ\nextraction with bank-growth assertion, validation of missing\nbank/name, unknown fate, queue exclusion of triaged entries, and\nstats accuracy under the mine filter. 86/86 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"dbc3b617f677ac50ae10a3f6bfe3fa5a205e826f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/dbc3b617f677ac50ae10a3f6bfe3fa5a205e826f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGJjZDY0MGRlYTUyNjE0NzU2MmVlYTIxOTk5ZWE5MjJhYmRjNDQwMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f","sha":"6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f"}],"sha":"bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bcd640dea526147562eea21999ea922abdc44019"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:09:49Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:09:49Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"smoke: live GameWeaver probe through running backend","tree":{"sha":"e67360daebe48dea0f50ab3ef2893ae794327802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/e67360daebe48dea0f50ab3ef2893ae794327802"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDZhN2EwZmJhZDgxOWFhMDlmOTg3ZmZhYWVlZTYzMTlhZjg0YmE3NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847","sha":"804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847"}],"sha":"6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/6a7a0fbad819aa09f987ffaaeee6319af84ba76f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:07:57Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T16:07:57Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 13: configurator + GameWeaver — 8 organ banks, draft genome, playability critic\n\nThe whole point of the canonical document is the ''органогенетический\nконфигуратор'', not the four games. The four games (plus Promise Court)\nare a first batch. This phase builds the actual configurator: a place\nwhere a designer assembles a draft GameGenome by picking organs from\neight banks, names a playable verb, picks a maturity stage, and runs\nthe draft past GameWeaver before promoting it.\n\nWhat landed:\n\nBackend models:\n- Organ        bank-tagged organ, 130 seeded from spec §8 ''Первый банк\n               органов v0.1'' (15 field, 20 object, 20 action, 20 llm_role,\n               15 crisis, 15 trace, 12 mutation, 13 degradation).\n- GenomeDraft  designer''s working draft. Carries name, function, verb,\n               maturity_stage (0..5 per §3), selected_organs (bank ->\n               organ ids), weaver_verdict (last critic output),\n               player_token (Phase 6 hook).\n\nBackend services:\n- organ_seed.py  verbatim canonical list with BANK_LABEL / BANK_HINT\n                 for the UI. Idempotent — re-running adds only missing.\n- migrations: adds organs + genome_drafts tables on next startup;\n              extends the previous ALTER TABLE pass with no-ops on\n              already-created columns.\n\nLLM:\n- New role ''playability_critic'' (GameWeaver). System prompt is\n  organ-shaped, not assistant: it ATTACKS the draft, never rewrites\n  it. JSON contract:\n    verb_status, crisis_status, trace_status ∈ present|missing|weak\n    degradation_warnings: [names of degradation organs present]\n    playable_verdict ∈ playable | not_playable_yet | rotten\n    critique: one short Russian sentence naming the single worst gap\n  Provider mock applies deterministic rules covering the four common\n  failure modes (no verb, no crisis, no trace, degradation present)\n  so tests run without a live model.\n\nAPI:\n  GET    /api/configurator/banks\n  GET    /api/configurator/organs?bank=field\n  POST   /api/configurator/drafts                 create\n  GET    /api/configurator/drafts?mine=true       list (player-scoped)\n  GET    /api/configurator/drafts/{id}            read\n  PATCH  /api/configurator/drafts/{id}            update\n  POST   /api/configurator/drafts/{id}/weaver     run critic\n\nFrontend:\n- /configurator landing page assembles everything in one screen:\n  name + function + verb + maturity dropdown at the top,\n  eight bank cards underneath, each rendering its organs as\n  toggle chips. The degradation bank is bordered in warn color\n  with chips highlighting in orange when picked, so ''фича вместо\n  органа'' visibly bites the designer if they reach for it.\n- Validation block under the buttons shows the GameWeaver verdict\n  with three column statuses, a playable/rotten badge, and a\n  warning row listing any degradation organs.\n- Drafts list at the bottom, scoped to the local player token.\n\nHome page links: Library / Configurator / Operator Profile.\n\n7 backend tests cover banks, canonical seed, full draft lifecycle,\nplayable verdict when minimums are met, rejection when verb is\nmissing, degradation flagging, and the player_token mine filter.\n78/78 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"03e72a0310e7c6f452339e2ff592159d3320c7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/03e72a0310e7c6f452339e2ff592159d3320c7fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDgwNGU5MTUwMGE5YTFkZTY0ZmI0N2VlMjFiMzNlMDczMWExMTI4NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c","sha":"5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c"}],"sha":"804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/804e91500a9a1de64fb47ee21b33e0731a112847"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:42:50Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:42:50Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 12: ingest the actual 4200 raw cards into the library\n\nThe real source the user pointed at is docs/raw_corpus_4200.md (832K,\n5002 lines). It is a flat structured catalogue:\n\n  ## **<roman>. Section title**       — 160 sections\n  N. **Card name** — description.     — 4200 numbered cards\n\nTwo new corpus kinds:\n\n  source_section  the Roman-numeral section header. Body is a stub\n                  (''контейнер раздела — карточки ниже'') because the\n                  payload of value lives in the children, not in the\n                  header text.\n  source_card     one row per numbered card, code = src_card_NNNN\n                  zero-padded so ordering is correct, title = ''N. Name'',\n                  body = the after-em-dash description.\n\nEach card is linked to its containing section via CorpusLink\nrelation=''in_section''. parse_phase_docs now skips raw_corpus_4200.md\nso it isn''t double-ingested as a single 800K phase_doc.\n\nThe library now exposes:\n\n  source_section  160\n  source_card    4200\n\nTotal library size after this phase: ~4700 entries across 13 kinds.\nFTS5 still answers in single-digit ms; queries can be scoped with\n?kind=source_card.\n\nTest additions (6 new):\n  · 4200 cards present\n  · sections present + first section is ''I''\n  · first card ''Пальцы'' / last card ''останавливает-список'' correct\n  · src_card_0001 linked to src_section_I\n  · search finds ''Хромая обезьяна'' (known card from section I)\n  · search filtered by kind=source_card returns only that kind\n\n71/71 backend tests pass. Suite is now ~100s due to startup ingest of\n4200 entries per fixture; if it becomes painful, conftest can move to\nsession scope.","tree":{"sha":"ea1a37ce7c2249f3de9f8c6e20e7f437d2befc84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/ea1a37ce7c2249f3de9f8c6e20e7f437d2befc84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDViZThiYjMxODFjZTc4ZThhNjI5OWM3MTI4MzJjNTRlZTVkMmJjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/d39c08ab99bd0971f097e6c714259947ffb31a76","sha":"d39c08ab99bd0971f097e6c714259947ffb31a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/d39c08ab99bd0971f097e6c714259947ffb31a76"}],"sha":"5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/5be8bb3181ce78e8a6299c712832c54ee5d2bc3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/d39c08ab99bd0971f097e6c714259947ffb31a76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:30:29Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:30:29Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 11: micro-cards layer — 242 sub-entries linked under parents\n\nSecond-pass parser over spec.md extracts smaller structural units that\nlive INSIDE the top-level entries from phase 7, and stores them as\nchildren with CorpusLink rows.\n\nTwo new kinds:\n\n  micro_game     72 entries  — every attractor v0.2 carries three\n                              proposals (малое упражнение / игра-\n                              упражнение / большой симулятор) on its\n                              closing line. Each becomes its own\n                              browsable card.\n  micro_aspect  170 entries — label:value lines inside the breeds\n                              (Источник / Функция / Минимальный slice\n                              / LLM-роль / След / No-LLM-версия /\n                              Replay mutation / Токсин / Статус) and\n                              similarly structured prose inside\n                              R-roots, attractors and a few precards.\n                              Filtered by a heuristic: ≤4-word label,\n                              8-400-char value, not narrative leads\n                              like ''Это бывшая ...''.\n\nThe parser tracks the most recent top-level entry on every line, resets\non any non-matching ## / ### heading so wandering lines after a section\nends don''t accumulate under the previous parent, and caps at 40 micro-\ncards per parent as a safety net.\n\n60 of the 111 top-level entries now carry at least one child. Children\nare exposed by /api/library/entries/<id> under the existing ''children''\narray (relation=''contains''), so the entry reader UI surfaces them\nwithout further changes.\n\nOut of scope: the broader ''4200 не игр'' the user mentioned. Those live\noutside this repo''s spec.md as raw collected material; nothing inside\nthis file matches that count. The second pass extracts everything\ninline that fits a stable shape.\n\n4 new tests cover micro_game and micro_aspect counts, parent linkage,\nand FTS5 retrieval of a known phrase (''Семантический сапёр''). 65/65\nbackend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"892525cbf51bc1edd4dfddbc3a18a27940