ps://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/35f22e77c4a8e6e267f45490a9b5618b8c533769","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDM1ZjIyZTc3YzRhOGU2ZTI2N2Y0NTQ5MGE5YjU2MThiOGM1MzM3Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2","sha":"0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2"}],"sha":"35f22e77c4a8e6e267f45490a9b5618b8c533769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/35f22e77c4a8e6e267f45490a9b5618b8c533769"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:01:24Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:01:24Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 10: fifth genre — Promise Court\n\nThe four existing genres each test ONE shape of misreading. Promise\nCourt tests something none of them did cleanly: the contract structure\nof a promise. Missing Operation has ''promise'' as one of eight absence\ntypes; making it its own genre lets the field interrogate the promise\non four explicit dimensions instead of folding it into a generic\n''absence'' verdict.\n\nField type: promise_court_text. The player reads a memo-style text,\nclicks up to 5 phrases that look like promises, and for each fills a\n4-field form: owner / deadline / criterion / fallback. Any empty\nfield forces ''send to court''. A full form unlocks the ''accept'' button.\nThis makes the player''s blindness mechanically visible — if every\ndeadline is empty, the next round will know to hide deadlines harder.\n\nThe qualitative profile:\n\n  promise_blindness     missed_no_owner | missed_no_deadline |\n                         missed_no_criterion | missed_no_fallback | balanced\n  court_load            completeness_strict | balanced | court_overload\n  completeness_demand   strict | balanced | loose\n  missing_field_distribution  count map per field\n  verdict_distribution        accepted vs sent_to_court\n\nReplay directives are concrete and field-specific\n(''next round: hide deadlines behind soft adverbs'').\n\nReal seed real_promise_court_001 is a Q4 retrospective newsletter\nwith 7 promise candidates of mixed completeness — one is genuinely\ncomplete with a named fallback (the ''good'' case the player should\naccept), three are owner-passive / collective-we slop, and the rest\nhover in the middle.\n\nFrontend renderer PromiseCourtText.tsx implements:\n  · click-to-mark with cap of 5\n  · 4-input form per marked promise with live completeness check\n  · ''accept'' button disabled until all 4 fields non-empty\n  · ''court'' button always available\n  · footer counters\n\nWiring is the same as for the other 4 genres — no special-case in\napi/services. GameShell picks the renderer from genome.field_type.\ngpt-4.1-mini default model applies; grok-4 only stays for\nregister_sapper.\n\nReplay loop closes for the new genre too: _REQUIRED_KEYS_BY_FIELD\nand both mutator and converter prompts learn promise_court_text;\nmock provider has a shape-correct stub. Live mutator works through\nthe same /sessions/<id>/replay endpoint without changes.\n\n7 new tests cover genome load, real seed presence, full court flow,\ndeadline-blind flow, and replay loop on the 5th genre. 61/61 tests\npass.","tree":{"sha":"87089bbaf41b6e266970c08de249fab3d8f9fe4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/87089bbaf41b6e266970c08de249fab3d8f9fe4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDBlNmU0YWRjYmMzNWFkNTgzY2I1ODhlZjViZWM3ZjAyNzA5MTYxZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa","sha":"c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa"}],"sha":"0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/0e6e4adcbc35ad583cb588ef5bec7f02709161e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:54:08Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:54:08Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phases 8+9: organ summons + corpus-to-material conversion\n\nThe library is no longer read-only. Each corpus entry can now:\n\nPhase 8 — summon one of the four existing LLM organs against itself.\n  Buttons on the entry page: ''атаковать прокурором'', ''заштукатурить'',\n  ''защитить как росток'', ''прочитать буквально''. One click = one organ\n  pass (not a chat). Each run is persisted as a LibraryComment row and\n  surfaces under the entry as a growing thread, newest-first. The\n  comment thread accumulates across players — the entry develops a\n  layered record of how different organs have pushed against it.\n  Reuses prosecutor / spackler / sprout_advocate / literal_alien\n  without inventing a fifth role.\n\nPhase 9 — convert the entry into a playable material for any of the\n  four genres. New material_converter role takes (game_id, field_type,\n  source_title, source_body) and emits a {new_title, new_payload} pair\n  shaped to the target genre''s schema. The new Material is persisted\n  with namespace=''from_corpus'' and source_corpus_id pointing at the\n  parent entry, then UI navigates to /play/<game>?materialId=<new>.\n  The familiar replay loop from Phase 5 still works on top: play the\n  converted material, complete, mutate, repeat — the entire chain\n  carries back to the corpus origin.\n\nBackend:\n\n- backend/app/models.py: LibraryComment table; corpus_links scaffold\n  kept for Phase 10+.\n- backend/app/llm/roles.py: MATERIAL_CONVERTER_SYSTEM with the same\n  non-assistant footer the other organs use; per-field_type schema\n  hints mirror the mutator''s so the player gets the same play shape.\n- backend/app/llm/provider.py: mock stubs added so test_phase9 can\n  drive the conversion without a live model; max_tokens 3500 applied\n  to converter as well.\n- backend/app/api/library.py: three new routes —\n  GET /entries/{id}/comments\n  POST /entries/{id}/summon\n  POST /entries/{id}/convert\n  The convert handler validates the converter output against the\n  per-genre required keys before persisting, so a misshaped LLM\n  response surfaces as 502, not as a broken Material.\n- backend/app/services/corpus_to_material.py: orchestrates the LLM\n  call, schema check, and type-tag forcing.\n\nFrontend:\n\n- Library entry page now shows:\n  · 4 summon buttons + comment thread,\n  · 4 ''Сыграть как ...'' conversion buttons,\n  · the previous lineage / markdown blocks unchanged.\n- api client gains libraryComments, summonOrgan, convertEntry.\n\n10 new tests (4 summon, 1 unknown role, 1 missing entry, 1 newest\nfirst ordering, 4 parametrized conversions, 1 playable session check,\n1 unknown entry). 56/56 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"4dc72394cf417a65fdade525072d4f727f3e5121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/4dc72394cf417a65fdade525072d4f727f3e5121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGM5OGRkZGMyZDgxZmU2Yjg5ZDBmMDcxNDNkOTVkNGE0NjY4MTViZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac","sha":"f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac"}],"sha":"c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/c98dddc2d81fe6b89d0f07143d95d4a466815bfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:47:22Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:47:22Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 7: library — top-level corpus ingest + reader + FTS5 search\n\nThe original 5190-line source document is now the live corpus, parsed\ninto 111 top-level entries on backend startup (idempotent, safe to\nrerun):\n\n  attractor   24 v0.2 canonical entries + the v0.1 carryover map\n  r_root      12 root operational attractors (R1-R12)\n  breed       12 пород (Ложный клик, Росток или слоп, etc.)\n  chimera     40 cells of the chimera matrix\n  precard      7 first-pass cards\n  residual     8 остатков\n  genome       4 GENOME A01-A04 records\n  appspec      4 APP A01-A04 specs\n\nPlus our own docs/*.md (acceptance audits, playtest protocols, the\ngauntlet report, deploy handoff) are ingested with kind=''phase_doc''\nso they live in the same library as the theoretical material.\n\nStorage and search:\n\n- New tables corpus_entries + corpus_links (lineage scaffold).\n- FTS5 virtual table corpus_fts synchronised by triggers; queries via\n  /api/library/search?q=...&kind=...\n- spec.md and docs/ bind-mounted into the container at /docs so prod\n  doesn''t need a rebuild to pick up parser changes.\n\nAPI surface:\n\n  GET /api/library/sections     section list with counts\n  GET /api/library/entries      filter by kind / source pass\n  GET /api/library/entries/:id  body + parent/child links\n  GET /api/library/search       FTS5 over title and body\n\nReader UI:\n\n  /library                  landing with section tiles + search bar\n  /library/section/:kind    list of entries in a section\n  /library/entry/:id        markdown render + lineage panel\n\nMarkdown rendering is a 40-line vanilla helper — no extra deps; safe\nescaping by default, then headings/bold/code/links/lists.\n\nPhase 8/9 hooks marked in entry footer: discussion organs and\nmaterial conversion will land next. The 4200+ inline cards in spec.md\nare intentionally out of scope for this pass; a second ingest will\nadd them once we are sure the top-level structure holds.\n\n46/46 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"38e6b6145f490e91b723c89aa04b926cf2f99824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/38e6b6145f490e91b723c89aa04b926cf2f99824"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGYzOGM3ZmVmODQ2ZTgzMWY2MTA2OGNjNjYwMThkZWU3Y2UxZmY5YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab","sha":"9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab"}],"sha":"f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/f38c7fef846e831f61068cc66018dee7ce1ff9ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:34:25Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:34:25Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 6: cross-game Operator Profile via lightweight player token\n\nA player''s identity is the UUID written into localStorage on first\ncontact with the app and forwarded as X-Player-Token on every\nsession-creating call. This is not auth — there is no password, no\naccount, no sync between devices. Clearing localStorage = new player.\nSufficient for prototype: enough to stitch sessions across the 4\ngenres for a single browser session.\n\nWhat''s new:\n\n- backend/app/services/operator_profile.py: aggregator. Picks the\n  latest completed session per game_id, surfaces a one-line\n  qualitative meaning per headline dimension (e.g. ''ловится на\n  pseudo-depth — формы важности без операции''), and matches a small\n  set of NAMED cross-game patterns. Patterns are intentionally hand-\n  written, not statistical — connections between games must be\n  diagnostic claims a human can argue with, not opaque scores.\n- backend/app/api/operator.py: GET /api/operator/me (uses the header)\n  and GET /api/operator/{token} (read-only by token). Both return the\n  same shape: coverage line, per_game block per played genre, named\n  cross_patterns, one-line verdict.\n- frontend/src/routes/Operator.tsx: page at /operator. Renders\n  coverage, cross-pattern callouts in an accent panel, per-game cards\n  with dimensions and the latest replay directive. Each game card\n  links to its underlying session/profile page.\n- Home page header gains an ''Operator Profile →'' link.\n\nThe first cross pattern that ships:\n  false_click pseudo_depth + sprout_or_slop oversaves\n  → ''глубина-форма по обоим контурам: вход — pseudo-depth, выход —\n     сохранение dead beauty''\n\nFour more patterns are seeded; the list will grow as real sessions\nexpose actual stable conjunctions.\n\nPhase 6 tests cover: empty profile when no sessions, single-game\nprofile, cross-pattern matching when two compatible genres are played,\nand ''latest session wins'' per game. 38/38 backend tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"3eecd02c99da4dcf36acc42cc07de12d326c15e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/3eecd02c99da4dcf36acc42cc07de12d326c15e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDllZWMzODM2ZDAwYjZiNjgxOGI1Mjg0M2ZlZGY0MGYwNmQ4NWU0YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f","sha":"ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f"}],"sha":"9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/9eec3836d00b6b6818b52843fedf40f06d85e4ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:30:14Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:30:14Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"smoke: live replay loop probe through running backend","tree":{"sha":"230180fa5247af7a5f60da0f0af3ddb8bd1ddd97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/230180fa5247af7a5f60da0f0af3ddb8bd1ddd97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGVhZDJmMjdiNGMzOTdlMzk0MTFkOGRjYjhhYjdhNGQ0NDBkM2I3MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5","sha":"2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5"}],"sha":"ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ead2f27b4c397e39411d8dcb8ab7a4d440d3b70f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:23:48Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T14:23:48Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"phase 5: close the replay loop — completed session mutates next material\n\nAfter a session completes the player can press ''Сыграть мутировавший\nраунд'' on the Profile page. The backend takes the previous material,\nthe qualitative profile and its replay_directive, and asks a new\nmaterial_mutator role to produce a new material of the same field_type\nschema but amplified along the directive. A new Material row is\nwritten with namespace=''mutated'', parent_id pointing at the previous\nmaterial, mutation_directive and source_session_id set for lineage. A\nfresh GameSession starts on the new material and the UI navigates to\nthe play page for it.\n\nWhat''s new:\n\n- backend/app/llm/roles.py: material_mutator role with a per-field_type\n  schema hint and an explicit non-assistant footer (no answer key, no\n  coaching). Returns {new_title, new_payload}.\n- backend/app/llm/provider.py: mutator added to _ROLE_SHAPE; max_tokens\n  bumped to 3500 for this role only.\n- backend/app/services/replay_mutator.py: orchestrates the mutation,\n  validates the new payload has the right top-level keys for the\n  game''s field_type, forces the ''type'' tag.\n- backend/app/services/migrations.py: lightweight startup ALTER TABLE\n  pass; adds Material.parent_id, mutation_directive, source_session_id,\n  source_corpus_id and GameSession.player_token to existing prod DBs\n  without losing data.\n- backend/app/api/sessions.py: POST /sessions/<id>/replay endpoint;\n  X-Player-Token header forwarded to GameSession.player_token (Phase 6\n  hook).\n- backend/app/api/materials.py: serializer surfaces lineage fields.\n- frontend/src/api/client.ts: getPlayerToken generates and persists a\n  UUID in localStorage; every session-creating call carries it as\n  X-Player-Token.\n- frontend/src/routes/Profile.tsx: ''Сыграть мутировавший раунд'' button\n  visible whenever a replay_directive exists; on click POSTs /replay\n  and navigates to /play/<game>?materialId=<new>.\n\nMock provider returns shape-correct stub payloads per field_type so\ntest_phase5 can drive each genre through complete → replay → new\nplayable session end to end without a live LLM. 34/34 backend tests\npass (4 phase5 + the parameterized cross-game replay matrix).\n\nLive mutator quality will be smoked separately against the production\n302.ai gateway via scripts/smoke_replay.py in the next commit.","tree":{"sha":"1f65be0449252abf2d76de4259ab7ef22b4446fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/1f65be0449252abf2d76de4259ab7ef22b4446fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDJlNWJhODhmOGI2ZmVmNTYwZGUzNjEzMjgwM2U1M2NjZWIzYjQxYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/bd3a088ff3b6cce27653cb3073957d19cb90b225","sha":"bd3a088ff3b6cce27653cb3073957d19cb90b225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bd3a088ff3b6cce27653cb3073957d19cb90b225"}],"sha":"2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/2e5ba88f8b6fef560de36132803e53cceb3b41c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bd3a088ff3b6cce27653cb3073957d19cb90b225/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T10:34:50Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T10:34:50Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"deploy: use busybox-compatible wget for static healthcheck","tree":{"sha":"21c52d1fb9f668f9c0fd73267ad2628374f94f36","url":"https://api.git