users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ea76d95d886b341e2743b0f689e1cb269b236a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:23:56Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:23:56Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"deploy: mindfield.mindkampf.ru contour via Caddy + 2 containers\n\nMirrors the Quinta contour on moderbober-prod-01 with two differences:\n\n1. Two containers, not one: a Python/FastAPI api container plus the\n   Vite/nginx static container. Caddy does path routing — /api/* to\n   mindfield-api:8000, everything else to mindfield-static:80. The\n   static bundle never carries the 302.ai key.\n\n2. A persistent SQLite volume bind-mounted at /opt/mindfield/data;\n   the deploy script must never wipe it. The api container reads\n   MINDFIELD_DB=/data/mindfield.db.\n\nAdded files:\n\n- backend/Dockerfile             python:3.13-slim + uvicorn, healthcheck\n                                 on /api/games, mkdir /data on build\n- frontend/Dockerfile            multistage node:22-alpine build to\n                                 nginx:alpine serving dist/\n- frontend/deploy/nginx.conf     SPA fallback so /play/:gameId and\n                                 /session/:id/profile survive reload\n- deploy/docker-compose.yml      both services on moderbober_default,\n                                 env_file: /opt/mindfield/secrets/api.env\n- deploy/Caddyfile.snippet       block to append to /opt/moderbober/\n                                 Caddyfile (basic_auth + handle /api/*)\n- deploy/bin/deploy              git pull -> compose up --build ->\n                                 container/local/edge healthchecks\n- deploy/bin/status              one-line and full status views\n- deploy/bin/backup              tar.gz of data/ + compose, last 10 kept\n- .github/workflows/deploy-mindfield.yml\n                                 ssh-action runs /opt/mindfield/bin/deploy,\n                                 same secrets as Quinta (PROD_HOST etc.)\n- docs/MINDFIELD_VM_DEPLOY_HANDOFF.md\n                                 architecture, security notes, the\n                                 one-time VM install checklist (DNS,\n                                 secrets/api.env, Caddy reload).\n\nBackend 28/28 tests still pass; no runtime behaviour change in this\ncommit.","tree":{"sha":"c6e0705ab4fa68824367b40a736df2bb6bf0785e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/c6e0705ab4fa68824367b40a736df2bb6bf0785e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/ea76d95d886b341e2743b0f689e1cb269b236a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/ea76d95d886b341e2743b0f689e1cb269b236a43","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGVhNzZkOTVkODg2YjM0MWUyNzQzYjBmNjg5ZTFjYjI2OWIyMzZhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148","sha":"36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148"}],"sha":"ea76d95d886b341e2743b0f689e1cb269b236a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/ea76d95d886b341e2743b0f689e1cb269b236a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:17:02Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:17:02Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"false_click: prosecutor speaks in sentences, verdict UI explains the defense step\n\nTwo bugs surfaced during the first live playtest of False Click:\n\n1. Prosecutor returned bare vector tags (''pseudo_depth'', ''dramatic_amplifier'')\n   instead of full attack sentences. The system prompt listed the vectors as\n   ''possible attack vectors'' which the model read as ''return these as the\n   attacks array''. Patched the prompt to require each attack be a full\n   sentence (10-25 words) in the same language as the phrase that QUOTES a\n   fragment of the player''s phrase or claimed operation, with the vector\n   embedded inside the sentence rather than returned as a tag. The\n   probe_question is also forced to the phrase''s language and required to\n   demand a concrete operation rather than praise.\n\n   Live re-probe on the actual phrase from the screenshot now returns\n   Russian attack sentences quoting ''различение, вводит разведение...'' and\n   ''ROI''/''цикл обучения'' fragments on both gpt-4.1-mini and grok-4-0709.\n\n2. After the prosecutor speaks, the verdict dropdown looked like a category\n   picker with raw tags (bearing_node / false_click / weak_sprout /\n   service_phrase) and no explanation of what they meant — the player\n   couldn''t tell that this dropdown IS the defense step (you don''t reply to\n   the prosecutor in text; you decide whether to hold or fold your\n   operation claim). Patched ClickableTextUnits.tsx to:\n   - rename the field to ''Вердикт под давлением'',\n   - add a one-line explanation that this is the defense move,\n   - render each verdict option as ''tag — meaning'' instead of bare tag,\n   - confirm fixation with a small footer (''зафиксировано как X · войдёт\n     в profile.verdict_distribution'').\n\nNo new actions, schema, or LLM calls added.\nbackend/scripts/smoke_user_phrase.py runs the prosecutor against the\nexact text from the screenshot for quick regression sniffing.","tree":{"sha":"7b9dae6a7e979f8ad0af13a0d12e5af784684d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/7b9dae6a7e979f8ad0af13a0d12e5af784684d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDM2Yjk5NWY1OWUzMzY3ZGIwZTY4MDdiZWNkZWRjYmNiYjM4ODQxNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb","sha":"75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb"}],"sha":"36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/36b995f59e3367db0e6807becdedcbcbb3884148"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:05:01Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:05:01Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"set playtest model defaults\n\nAuto-route the LLM organ per game on the Play page, picked from the\n302.ai role-drift gauntlet:\n\n  register_sapper  -> grok-4-0709  (literal_alien needs medium/register\n                                    blindness, mini drifts to generic\n                                    ''tone/relationship'')\n  every other game -> gpt-4.1-mini (faster, holds 3/4 roles cleanly)\n\nThe header still shows the model dropdown so the player can override.\nPer-game manual overrides are persisted to localStorage under\nmindfield.model.<gameId>; absent that key the game default applies on\nload. The new ''active · <Model>'' badge in the header makes the current\nrouting visible to the observer; an orange ''(manual)'' suffix appears\nwhen the player overrode the game default.\n\nPlaytest docs updated:\n- SOLO_PLAYTEST_SCRIPT_PHASE_3.md: model-defaults table, 302.ai env\n  setup, observer-facing badge note in Register Sapper block.\n- HUMAN_PLAYTEST_SHEET_PHASE_3.md: per-game fields for the active\n  model and whether the organ behaviour read as game-organ /\n  assistant / noise.\n\nRegression test (backend/tests/test_llm_picker.py): if either preset\ndisappears from /api/llm/models, the frontend silently falls back to\nits hardcoded default and the auto-routing breaks. 28/28 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"80dcbd519ab778e01bb0f9601a93af04597ad1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/80dcbd519ab778e01bb0f9601a93af04597ad1d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDc1ZjQ4MzRhNmQxNGViZWU4YzM5ZjJhYmI3MzA2YmQyNzljNGE0ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc","sha":"8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc"}],"sha":"75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/75f4834a6d14ebee8c39f2abb7306bd279c4a4eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:56:11Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:56:11Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"Phase 3A: live 302ai role-drift gauntlet on gpt-4.1-mini and grok-4-0709\n\nRun all 4 LLM organs (prosecutor, spackler, sprout_advocate, literal_alien)\nagainst both live 302.ai models on the real seed materials and judge role\nretention against assistant drift.\n\nDrift verdicts (after one prompt repair pass):\n- prosecutor:      mini PASS, grok PASS\n- spackler:        mini PASS (after repair), grok PASS\n- sprout_advocate: mini PASS, grok PASS\n- literal_alien:   mini PASS_WITH_WARNINGS (generic blindness ceiling),\n                   grok PASS\n\nPrompt repairs (backend/app/llm/roles.py):\n- spackler: require patch to be an 8-25 word plausible concealment phrase\n  and risk to name what the patch hides — mini was returning one-word\n  patches like ''критерия'' before the repair.\n- literal_alien: require things_i_cannot_see to pick concrete dimensions\n  (addressee, in-group code, joke/meme, hidden_request/alibi, register,\n  medium conventions) and ban generic answers (''tone'', ''sarcasm'',\n  ''context'', ''relationship'', ''intention'', ''emotion'', ''mood''). Mini still\n  drifts toward the generic shape; grok holds.\n\nDefault model for first human playtest: gpt-4.1-mini (faster, holds 3\nof 4 roles). Backup / hard mode: grok-4-0709. Optional split routing:\nforce grok for literal_alien rounds.\n\nArtifacts:\n- backend/scripts/live_role_gauntlet.py runs the matrix and writes\n  sanitized outputs to docs/live_gauntlet/. No keys or env captured.\n- backend/scripts/smoke_false_click_real.py is the single-game smoke\n  used during provider rewrite.\n- backend/tests/test_llm_picker.py adds non-live tests for the model\n  list endpoint and the per-request model override — does not require\n  302.ai access.\n- docs/LIVE_ROLE_DRIFT_GAUNTLET_302AI.md holds the rubric, per-cell\n  reading, prompt patches, and the routing recommendation.\n- docs/live_gauntlet/ holds the raw role outputs from both models.\n\nTests: 27/27 (24 prior + 3 picker contract). Frontend builds clean.","tree":{"sha":"bc8d7ffc2f5ec2f82fc8c46e2e5259616d98abb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/bc8d7ffc2f5ec2f82fc8c46e2e5259616d98abb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDhiNjIxYTk5Yzc0MWJlNjhiMjNkYzg5M2YzZDc4NzBkM2IxZTY1ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f","sha":"e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f"}],"sha":"8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/8b621a99c741be68b23dc893f3d7870d3b1e65fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:49:17Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T23:49:17Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"add 302ai model picker for live llm runtime\n\nRewrite the LLM provider to make a real OpenAI-compatible gateway the\ndefault — 302.ai at /v1, with gpt-4.1-mini as the default model and\ngrok-4-0709 as the second working preset. Mock provider stays available\nonly for unit tests via explicit MINDFIELD_LLM=mock; otherwise the\nruntime fails loud when no key is configured, since LLM games without\nLLM have no meaning.\n\nProvider now coerces output to the per-role JSON contract (prosecutor:\nattacks+probe_question, spackler: patch+risk, sprout_advocate:\ncounterposition+pressure_question, literal_alien: literal_reading+\nthings_i_cannot_see) and bans assistant-shaped keys in the system\nprompt.\n\nAPI: POST /api/sessions/:id/llm-intervention accepts an optional model\noverride, GET /api/llm/models returns the working presets and the\nactive default. Frontend Play route surfaces a model picker next to\nthe material picker and stashes the choice in localStorage so every\nintervention carries the player''s chosen model.","tree":{"sha":"7aed2b27f0564f13256505678699b3aa6fa9bb52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/7aed2b27f0564f13256505678699b3aa6fa9bb52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGU1NzQyYjk3NWE4MDhmMmEyNmZiYTk5OGQ5NTQxM2RjNjhmOGM4M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506","sha":"25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506"}],"sha":"e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/e5742b975a808f2a26fba998d95413dc68f8c83f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T21:20:42Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T21:20:42Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"Phase 3: first human playtest pack\n\nPlaytest readiness, observation sheet, and 60-minute solo script.\nOnly blocker-level code change is a mid-session trace export button\nso the observer can grab a .md at any point, not just after complete.\n\n- docs/PHASE_3_READINESS_CHECK.md: tests 24/24, build green, real\n  seeds reachable for all 4 games via API and Play picker\n- docs/HUMAN_PLAYTEST_SHEET_PHASE_3.md: per-game observation sheet\n  (timing, hesitation, field-action clarity, role-as-non-assistant,\n  trace meaningfulness, profile specificity, replay actionability,\n  observer verdict alive/unclear/dead/needs repair) + cross-cutting\n  questions\n- docs/SOLO_PLAYTEST_SCRIPT_PHASE_3.md: setup 5 / FC 10 / MO 10 /\n  SoS 15 / RS 10 / reflection 10, with verbatim post-game questions\n  and an observer anti-failure checklist\n- ExportTraceButton component on every game shell, downloads .md\n  via existing export endpoint (no backend change)\n\nNo new features. No game #5. No real LLM required. No analytics\ndashboard. Acceptance: a human can run all 4 games on real seeds,\nobserver fills the sheet without inventing categories.","tree":{"sha":"49933564e21a160493df1abaa1f1bce3aec56776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/49933564e21a160493df1abaa1f1bce3aec56776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKDI1ZDc3ZmQ2YWE2NjJhZTg0NGYxOWNkY2IwNTVlNzUzOTg0MmE1MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6","sha":"bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6"}],"sha":"25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/25d77fd6aa662ae844f19cdcb055e7539842a506"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:56:27Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:56:27Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"Phase 2: acceptance audit + real seeds + actionable replay directives\n\nAudit and seed pack:\n- docs/ACCEPTANCE_AUDIT_PHASE_2.md walks the runtime cycle against spec\n- docs/PLAYTEST_PROTOCOL_PHASE_2.md, manual one-player protocol on real seeds\n- Four real-namespace seeds in backend/seed_materials_real/ wired through\n  genome_loader; Material model gains a namespace column; materials list\n  endpoint surfaces it\n\nProfile + replay:\n- replay_targets stay tag-shaped for the mutator; new replay_directives\n  emit sentence-shaped next-round instructions (no ''try harder'' drift)\n- Missing Operation adds absence_blindness as the diagnostic edge\n  (what the player never named), not just absence_focus\n- Sprout or Slop adds sprout_tendency and slop_tolerance\n- Register Sapper adds action_distinction\n\nUX friction patches:\n- Play.tsx gets a material picker, default to real over demo\n- LLMPanel labels itself ''NOT an assistant'' and describes each role''s\n  resistance per game; idle state explains the panel is not chat\n- TracePanel adds a one-line why-this-move-mattered under every action\n- Profile route surfaces replay_directives prominently\n\nTests:\n- 14 new Phase 2 tests against real seeds\n- Per-game flow produces expected qualitative dimensions\n- Replay directives must be sentences with concrete verbs\n- LLM roles forbidden from drifting into assistant-shaped keys or phrases\n- 24/24 backend tests pass","tree":{"sha":"4b09f7208249441ee9cf20ead85d24f8d3b3313d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/4b09f7208249441ee9cf20ead85d24f8d3b3313d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6","node_id":"C_kwDOS4-sLNoAKGJkMzkyOThiMjgyNzNlYmE0NTBlMjEzYjBmNGJhZjY1MTI2MGEwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commit/6020fefeb46b731b0678f1bc0815dc61ddd89ca1","sha":"6020fefeb46b731b0678f1bc0815dc61ddd89ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/6020fefeb46b731b0678f1bc0815dc61ddd89ca1"}],"sha":"bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/bd39298b28273eba450e213b0f4baf651260a0c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18898907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stimurid","id":18898907,"login":"Stimurid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODk4OTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stimurid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/commits/6020fefeb46b731b0678f1bc0815dc61ddd89ca1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:36:21Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T20:36:21Z","email":"timurid@gmail.com","name":"Timur Shchukin"},"message":"MVP: LLM Game Field Runtime + 4 micro-apps\n\nBackend: FastAPI + SQLite + Pydantic v2. Cycle material -> field ->\nmove -> LLM intervention -> verdict -> trace -> mutation. Genome-driven\nruntime; adding a game = one JSON in /game_genomes.\n\nLLM: provider abstraction with deterministic MockProvider (default) and\nAnthropicProvider. Four roles - prosecutor, spackler, sprout_advocate,\nliteral_alien - explicitly NOT assistant.\n\nGames:\n- False Click (clickable_text_units / prosecutor)\n- Missing Operation (gap_click_text / spackler)\n- Sprout or Slop (card_sorting / sprout_advocate)\n- Register Sapper (medium_shift_phrase / literal_alien)\n\nFrontend: Vite + React + TS, four field renderers, GameShell with\nRoundHeader/LLMPanel/TracePanel, qualitative Operator Profile page,\nMarkdown export.\n\nTests: 10 backend tests, full per-game integration loop, action\nvalidation against genome, mock-LLM-not-assistant contract.\n\nSpec at docs/spec.md.","tree":{"sha":"a28be5cf0b3fddfa10872191366a2fff9e20a5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/trees/a28be5cf0b3fddfa10872191366a2fff9e20a5cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stimurid/mindfield-games/git/commits/6020fefeb46b731b0678f1bc0815dc61ddd89ca1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://a