s/90055433d131aba0f28507619e0d915eb7429718/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T19:37:25Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T19:37:25Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"message":"feat: complete story composer (S1-S5) — workbench, AI editorial, export, fallback data\n\nS1: Data journalism workbench with side-by-side explorer + composer MFEs\nS2: Add-to-story button on explorer cards, cross-MFE event routing\nS3: AI editorial backend (draft sections, suggest headlines, explore more)\nS4: Drag-and-drop reordering, annotations, HTML export with inline CSS\nS5: A2UI JSONL export, fallback data system (FALLBACK_DATA=true),\n    public explore() API on data-explorer, updated OpenMFE manifests\n\nFallback data covers all 4 demo prompts: GDP recovery, EUR/USD,\nrenewable energy, inflation. Set FALLBACK_DATA=true for offline demos.","tree":{"sha":"cc0969810e34e59f1d8b8e8d09c71c0e8373702c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/trees/cc0969810e34e59f1d8b8e8d09c71c0e8373702c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/commits/90055433d131aba0f28507619e0d915eb7429718","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208363?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lxg","id":208363,"login":"lxg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODM2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commit/90055433d131aba0f28507619e0d915eb7429718","node_id":"C_kwDOS5C_FdoAKDkwMDU1NDMzZDEzMWFiYTBmMjg1MDc2MTllMGQ5MTVlYjc0Mjk3MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commit/1d3adcae76dd0f735df75dbbec9bb4a1ef5812ce","sha":"1d3adcae76dd0f735df75dbbec9bb4a1ef5812ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commits/1d3adcae76dd0f735df75dbbec9bb4a1ef5812ce"}],"sha":"90055433d131aba0f28507619e0d915eb7429718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commits/90055433d131aba0f28507619e0d915eb7429718"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208363?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lxg","id":208363,"login":"lxg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODM2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commits/1d3adcae76dd0f735df75dbbec9bb4a1ef5812ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T07:18:58Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T07:18:58Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"message":"rewrite: A2UI v0.8 data explorer with streaming protocol\n\nReplace the old SSE article generator + separate gateway with a unified\nA2UI-based data explorer that streams NDJSON component trees.\n\nBackend:\n- Single Lambda entry point, NDJSON streaming (drop SSE)\n- Intent resolver with structured JSON schema and rich component vocabulary\n  (13 chart types, stat cards, tables, timelines, annotations)\n- Fan-out query execution across Eurostat, World Bank, ECB, GLEIF, ICIJ\n- Narrator streams markdown narrative alongside data panels\n- Eurostat client with automatic catalogue fallback on bad dataset codes\n  and dimension filter relaxation on empty results\n- AgentCore Gateway tool handler (tools.mjs) for agent-driven queries\n- A2UI emitter (a2ui.mjs) for composing component trees\n- Expanded Eurostat catalog with more dataset codes and usage guidance\n- Remove separate gateway/ package (merged into backend)\n\nFrontend:\n- Web component (data-explorer) with shadow DOM, template strings\n- Generic A2UI runtime: resolves component references, manages surfaces\n- Widget registry mapping A2UI types to render functions\n- ECharts-based chart widgets with type switching (line/bar/area/pie)\n- Data display widgets: sortable tables, stat cards, timelines, annotations\n- Lean CSS: no decoration, generous whitespace, subtle depth, #5470c6 accent\n- Drop old main.js/main.scss/openmfe manifest\n\nResearch:\n- Consolidate docs to match implemented architecture\n- Remove superseded planning documents","tree":{"sha":"09a79643d404c036e18fd37a61ef28e0f18eff19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/trees/09a79643d404c036e18fd37a61ef28e0f18eff19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/commits/1d3adcae76dd0f735df75dbbec9bb4a1ef5812ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://