vents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lxg","id":208363,"login":"lxg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODM2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/commits/cd42b94a3b66ec7d274cbe89bd431282ec0b9197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T19:37:55Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T19:37:55Z","email":"lxg@amazon.com","name":"Alexander Günsche"},"message":"Data explorer plan v2 + tool catalog for LLM intent resolution\n\nThree LLM calls: intent (pick APIs + params), narrative (interpret data),\nfollow-ups (suggest next questions). Everything else is deterministic code.\n\nTool catalog: one .md file per data source with parameters, response fields,\nexample queries, and gotchas. Concatenated into the intent prompt so the LLM\nknows what''s available without OpenAPI verbosity.","tree":{"sha":"f127e2781bd411b6236040a0a44a3d9bdb5739bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/trees/f127e2781bd411b6236040a0a44a3d9bdb5739bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfe/a2ui-workbench/git/commits/cd42b94a3b66ec7d274cbe89bd431282ec0b9197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208363?