:"Tony Wang"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-13T05:17:24Z","committedDate":"2026-06-13T05:17:24Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:25:19.610Z","repositoryId":1267962824,"sha":"bc8ba7aed0606368f618e518737bc0c9b6a0432b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-13T03:53:27Z","committedDate":"2026-06-13T03:53:27Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:25:19.610Z","repositoryId":1267962824,"sha":"537b3e70f607be938e017ba8747126928e5a5350"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-13T03:53:06Z","committedDate":"2026-06-13T03:53:06Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:25:19.610Z","repositoryId":1267962824,"sha":"f739b941acc31c1d012001dcfc6747697f9067a3"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-13T03:01:37Z","committedDate":"2026-06-13T03:01:37Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"klj890","providerType":"User"},"email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"wangtao"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:25:19.610Z","repositoryId":1267962824,"sha":"5cda93feff4251c8408b9e21fe4916cbae796183"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:25:19.610Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/69a44262952f212aa215f5e65d9e2073bb8ce6b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:47:05Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:47:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(task): M5a 片C(片1) — 运行时硬化 + 可运营 + 资金预扣 (#30)\n\n* feat(task): M5a 片C 自洽部分——硬化 + 可运营 + 资金预扣\n\n硬化（收 round-4 评审 + 收紧）：\n- SSRF is_blocked_ip 补全 CGNAT 100.64/10、benchmark 198.18/15、192.0.0/24、240/4 保留段\n- 产物下载改分块流式 + 累计上限，兼顾 chunked(无 Content-Length) 与恶意无限流，超限即止\n- worker_loop：set_failed 失败则不 lrem，任务留 processing 由 sweep 重入队（防永久卡 Queued）\n- finalize 重排为 落产物→原子翻转 Succeeded→结算：同时满足 succeeded⇒产物就绪 & cancelled⇒不计费\n\n可运营：\n- TaskAdapter 加 cancel(默认 no-op)；cancel 端点对 Running 任务后台尽力取消上游(凭 vendor_task_id)，闭合泄漏\n- gateway 协议白名单纳入任务协议族(mock_task)，任务渠道可经管理 API 创建(不再 SQL)\n\n资金：\n- 提交时 ensure_funds 预检，余额/授信耗尽 → 402 拒绝(任务有上游真实成本，不走 chat 后扣透支)\n\n验证：clippy --all-targets -D warnings + cargo test 全过；运行时——API 建 mock_task 渠道过白名单、\n负余额提交 402、充值后 202、任务闭环计费 1.4 元(7秒×0.2 单次正确)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——闭合提交期取消泄漏 + 缓冲预分配 + 拦组播\n\n- [critical] process_submit 提交期被取消(rows==0)时，凭已得 vendor_task_id 后台真取消上游，\n  闭合「cancel 当时 status 仍 Queued/vendor_task_id 未落 → 端点取消不到」的泄漏（不止告警）\n- [perf] 产物下载按 Content-Length 预分配缓冲(封顶 MAX)，省分块累计扩容拷贝\n- [security] is_blocked_ip 补 IPv4 组播 224.0.0.0/4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——下载缓冲预分配封顶 1MB 防 DoS\n\n恶意上游可声明接近 256MB 的 Content-Length 却不发数据，按其预分配会预占内存 →\n并发下 OOM。预分配封顶 PREALLOC_CAP(1MB)，超出由 Vec 动态扩容承接。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——上游取消清理路径各失败分支显式记日志\n\nspawn_upstream_cancel 是防泄漏关键路径，原 db/渠道查询失败静默 return，运维无法感知。\n改为各失败分支 tracing::error! 输出 vendor_task_id/channel_id/原因，便于告警排查。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——幂等结算消除 settle 失败致漏扣\n\n片C 此前 flip→settle 顺序下 settle 失败会让任务已 Succeeded 却漏扣（poller 不再扫）。\n改为 store→幂等结算→flip：以 rr-task-{id} 为去重键，settle 失败 ? 上抛 → 任务保持\nRunning 下轮重试；去重键防重试重复扣。运行时验证：任务恰好 1 条计费行、金额正确。\n\n未采纳（据由）：\n- 重复提交(vendor submit 成功后 DB 失败→sweep 重入队): at-least-once 固有，正解需厂商幂等键\n- 并发资金穿透: 与现有 chat 计费明确接受的「MVP 瞬时透支，冻结预扣留待真痛点」一致\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——usage_logs.request_id 加索引\n\n任务幂等结算用 request_id=rr-task-{id} 等值查询；usage_logs 无界增长，无索引则全表扫描。\n新增非唯一索引 idx_usage_logs_request_id（chat 的 request_id 可空/可能重复，唯一约束有风险；\n任务侧幂等由应用层+poller 去重保证）。迁移 up/down 验证、索引已建。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2a6f9c0de62e76a8396a99a9a490eec177e539c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/e2a6f9c0de62e76a8396a99a9a490eec177e539c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/69a44262952f212aa215f5e65d9e2073bb8ce6b7","verification":{"payload":"tree e2a6f9c0de62e76a8396a99a9a490eec177e539c\nparent b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1782575225 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782575225 +0800\n\nfeat(task): M5a 片C(片1) — 运行时硬化 + 可运营 + 资金预扣 (#30)\n\n* feat(task): M5a 片C 自洽部分——硬化 + 可运营 + 资金预扣\n\n