y@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——usage_logs.request_id 加索引\n\n任务幂等结算用 request_id=rr-task-{id} 等值查询；usage_logs 无界增长，无索引则全表扫描。\n新增非唯一索引 idx_usage_logs_request_id（chat 的 request_id 可空/可能重复，唯一约束有风险；\n任务侧幂等由应用层+poller 去重保证）。迁移 up/down 验证、索引已建。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqP/B5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkmQQAB2arNvFAPZRlNy9ywoocKa1\nmAvRLlw2qsnNYcGNTonfB7Go/P1mNuykscLB7Sn7FGJzQIGVP2hchLuRYq9N5Kq9\n3w5GgTNZKk5kOtP2qSc/LAzw4lEYC2M56IDKiUaBXzoNUivtW3zZUHwdit9Umxrq\n84vPIZnHVmiXisBlrXWp35YRBGf/BWB9LcL0csVsoq2djBQA+oBCd4t1YX1amPw2\ngGQJoIW9pODxhpFlez/0S3hL9/ZXkxtW4gH03wjHedm8zKWP6pdIazACR5b8VjYH\ndakC8AeIcsyVloU6jZEqdniDN8U03sT5Lc6IpYBId/M827iJbwu5K3d7qwc/5eDT\nDW3wMll8eYBkaa5tmvmsBDkYr+UIe6TdCaSEkAtprsvBYoYaPbW3Ef4pQhBhugMd\nFBs6KpK3tbQH95+sUJuFvdD/NcpnsX2eqRAfUgeC0P9u6yUnqfAj7OlxWwOHf7DF\n2A+JArt1TbxkSX7ZjaEwdFinXUs3gwLgUxaK0PFEkEprznmJhdaaJb45iGtleGes\nQZa3ugTRPq0c07AgCJpY5zNKNU+YyzHwAHVMxFagVhhoik5VyDkFKi75w9hUEkXn\nlCmRWjtg4WXSbp9LManpb6FWI6cHkqJboYm1mazuPY4CRHmk9ac50PzKSAIOCUqt\nQhSNTM0hyGDNfUxlieDt\n=Si9E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T15:47:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/69a44262952f212aa215f5e65d9e2073bb8ce6b7","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDY5YTQ0MjYyOTUyZjIxMmFhMjE1ZjVlNjVkOWUyMDczYmI4Y2U2Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8","sha":"b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8"}],"sha":"69a44262952f212aa215f5e65d9e2073bb8ce6b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/69a44262952f212aa215f5e65d9e2073bb8ce6b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:08:16Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:08:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(task): M5a 片B — TaskAdapter + worker/poller + 对象存储 + 计费闭环 (#29)\n\n* feat(task): M5a 片B — TaskAdapter + worker/poller + 对象存储 + 计费闭环\n\n- TaskAdapter 扩展点（async trait，按 protocol_adapter 分派）+ mock_task 适配器（零凭据打通管线）\n- worker：BRPOPLPUSH 消费队列 → 解析路由 → adapter.submit → 原子置 Running + vendor_task_id\n- poller：周期扫 Running → adapter.poll；两阶段可恢复（凭 vendor_task_id 续查，重启不丢长任务）\n- 完成：先落产物到 S3 兼容对象存储（object_store/AmazonS3，MinIO 默认）+ 计费结算（复用\n  settle_chat，按量纲 second/image/call）+ webhook，再原子翻 Succeeded（保证 succeeded⇒产物就绪）\n- 启动恢复 sweep：processing 列表中仍 Queued 的任务重入队（worker 崩溃补偿）\n- AppState 增 object_store；config 增 RR_S3_*（默认 MinIO）；GET 产物返回 presigned URL\n- 端到端验证：video 任务 submit→running→succeeded(15s)，产物落 MinIO + presigned URL 可下载，\n  usage_logs 计费 1.6 元（8 秒×0.2），钱包后扣\n- 注：task 协议族渠道经 CRUD 创建需扩展 gateway 白名单（接入真实厂商时统一处理）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——worker 运行时健壮性 7 项\n\n- [critical] sweep 先于 worker 顺序执行，杜绝刚入 processing(DB 仍 Queued)被误重入队 → 重复消费\n- [high] poller 改并发（每任务 spawn），慢/超时上游不阻塞整轮\n- [high] resolve_route 遍历启用路由线找首个启用渠道，恢复故障转移\n- [high] 产物下载用带超时 http_client（不再 reqwest::get 默认无超时挂起 worker）\n- [high] fire_webhook 改非阻塞 spawn，慢 webhook 不拖垮运行时\n- [med] store_artifact 幂等（按 task_id+s3_key 去重，poller 重试不重复落产物）\n- [med] recovery_sweep 单任务查询失败不中断整轮\n\n运行时复验：video 任务仍 submit→running→succeeded，产物+presigned URL+计费正常。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第二轮——并发/安全/计费/资源 6 项\n\n- [critical] poller 在飞去重(HashSet)，杜绝同任务跨 tick 重复 spawn → 重复计费/产物\n- [security] webhook SSRF 守卫：仅 http/https + 解析 IP 拦私网/环回/链路本地(169.254)/ULA\n- [billing] group_id_from_slug 抛 DB 错而非吞错回退默认价（防漏扣）；结算失败重试\n- [perf] http_client 改 OnceLock 单例，复用连接池防套接字耗尽\n- [stability] 产物下载加 256MB 上限(Content-Length 预拦+读后复核)防 OOM（流式留片C）\n- [resource] 提交中被取消时 warn 输出 vendor_task_id 供运营清理泄漏的上游任务\n\n运行时复验：normal 任务成功；webhook 打 127.0.0.1 被拦 → webhook_state=blocked。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第三轮——panic 安全/下载状态/SSRF 重绑定/失败通知\n\n- [critical] poller 用 RAII Drop guard 移除 active id，process_poll panic 也不假死\n- [high] 产物下载加 .error_for_status()，上游 404/500 不被当产物存\n- [security] SSRF DNS 重绑定：http_client 挂连接期过滤 DNS resolver，剔除私网/环回 IP，\n  闭合 pre-check(TOC) 与连接(TOU) 两次解析的缺口；同时护 webhook 与产物下载\n- [high] set_failed 提交阶段失败也触发 webhook（与 finalize_failed 一致）\n\n回归：任务仍 submit→succeeded，产物+presigned URL 正常。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"665142e650c9acde71ea0ba7fcdd6b352a6daeda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/665142e650c9acde71ea0ba7fcdd6b352a6daeda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 665142e650c9acde71ea0ba7fcdd6b352a6daeda\nparent 2ef7f39a45a82d5ea73a3898a66ecd739850251a\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1782569296 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782569296 +0800\n\nfeat(task): M5a 片B — TaskAdapter + worker/poller + 对象存储 + 计费闭环 (#29)\n\n* feat(task): M5a 片B — TaskAdapter + worker/poller + 对象存储 + 计费闭环\n\n- TaskAdapter 扩展点（async trait，按 protocol_adapter 分派）+ mock_task 适配器（零凭据打通管线）\n- worker：BRPOPLPUSH 消费队列 → 解析路由 → adapter.submit → 原子置 Running + vendor_task_id\n- poller：周期扫 Running → adapter.poll；两阶段可恢复（凭 vendor_task_id 续查，重启不丢长任务）\n- 完成：先落产物到 S3 兼容对象存储（object_store/AmazonS3，MinIO 默认）+ 计费结算（复用\n  settle_chat，按量纲 second/image/call）+ webhook，再原子翻 Succeeded（保证 succeeded⇒产物就绪）\n- 启动恢复 sweep：processing 列表中仍 Queued 的任务重入队（worker 崩溃补偿）\n- AppState 增 object_store；config 增 RR_S3_*（默认 MinIO）；GET 产物返回 presigned URL\n- 端到端验证：video 任务 submit→running→succeeded(15s)，产物落 MinIO + presigned URL 可下载，\n  usage_logs 计费 1.6 元（8 秒×0.2），钱包后扣\n- 注：task 协议族渠道经 CRUD 创建需扩展 gateway 白名单（接入真实厂商时统一处理）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——worker 运行时健壮性 7 项\n\n- [critical] sweep 先于 worker 顺序执行，杜绝刚入 processing(DB 仍 Queued)被误重入队 → 重复消费\n- [high] poller 改并发（每任务 spawn），慢/超时上游不阻塞整轮\n- [high] resolve_route 遍历启用路由线找首个启用渠道，恢复故障转移\n- [high] 产物下载用带超时 http_client（不再 reqwest::get 默认无超时挂起 worker）\n- [high] fire_webhook 改非阻塞 spawn，慢 webhook 不拖垮运行时\n- [med] store_artifact 幂等（按 task_id+s3_key 去重，poller 重试不重复落产物）\n- [med] recovery_sweep 单任务查询失败不中断整轮\n\n运行时复验：video 任务仍 submit→running→succeeded，产物+presigned URL+计费正常。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第二轮——并发/安全/计费/资源 6 项\n\n- [critical] poller 在飞去重(HashSet)，杜绝同任务跨 tick 重复 spawn → 重复计费/产物\n- [security] webhook SSRF 守卫：仅 http/https + 解析 IP 拦私网/环回/链路本地(169.254)/ULA\n- [billing] group_id_from_slug 抛 DB 错而非吞错回退默认价（防漏扣）；结算失败重试\n- [perf] http_client 改 OnceLock 单例，复用连接池防套接字耗尽\n- [stability] 产物下载加 256MB 上限(Content-Length 预拦+读后复核)防 OOM（流式留片C）\n- [resource] 提交中被取消时 warn 输出 vendor_task_id 供运营清理泄漏的上游任务\n\n运行时复验：normal 任务成功；webhook 打 127.0.0.1 被拦 → webhook_state=blocked。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第三轮——panic 安全/下载状态/SSRF 重绑定/失败通知\n\n- [critical] poller 用 RAII Drop guard 移除 active id，process_poll panic 也不假死\n- [high] 产物下载加 .error_for_status()，上游 404/500 不被当产物存\n- [security] SSRF DNS 重绑定：http_client 挂连接期过滤 DNS resolver，剔除私网/环回 IP，\n  闭合 pre-check(TOC) 与连接(TOU) 两次解析的缺口；同时护 webhook 与产物下载\n- [high] set_failed 提交阶段失败也触发 webhook（与 finalize_failed 一致）\n\n回归：任务仍 submit→succeeded，产物+presigned URL 正常。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqP9lQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtEIQAAmtz+4fgKEZUN9aBIuHWU4a\neYJaKGOSb1Y+nnEX