a":"2ef7f39a45a82d5ea73a3898a66ecd739850251a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/2ef7f39a45a82d5ea73a3898a66ecd739850251a"}],"sha":"b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b1a892e26f6faa4f95ce522efcd1c3eab6c4cbb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/2ef7f39a45a82d5ea73a3898a66ecd739850251a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:45:48Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:45:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(task): M5a 片A — 多模态任务 数据模型 + /v1/tasks API + Redis 入队 (#28)\n\n* feat(task): M5a 片A — 多模态任务 数据模型 + /v1/tasks API + Redis 入队\n\n- 迁移：tasks（状态机 queued/running/succeeded/failed/cancelled + vendor_task_id +\n  input/extra + 计费快照 + webhook）+ artifacts（s3_key 元数据），up/down 验证\n- 实体：tasks(TaskStatus 枚举) / artifacts\n- AppState 增 Redis 池（deadpool-redis，惰性、M0 容忍缺省）\n- task crate：v1_routes 挂根 /v1（与 /v1/chat/completions 同层）\n  POST /v1/tasks（校验 async_task 模型→入库 Queued→LPUSH 队列→202）\n  GET /v1/tasks/{id}（org 行隔离）/ POST cancel（幂等）\n- 端到端验证：submit→202→Redis 队列→GET→cancel；无鉴权 401；越域 404\n- worker/poller/产物/计费在片B/C\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review——org 隔离下推到 SQL 查询层\n\nget_one/cancel 从 find_by_id + 内存 .filter() 改为 WHERE id=? AND org_id=?，\n避免把越域大 JSON 行载入内存，并在查询层强制行隔离。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review(HIGH)——cancel 改原子条件更新防竞态\n\nread-then-update 在 worker 并发推进任务时会覆盖 Succeeded/Failed 终态。改为\nUPDATE … WHERE id=? AND org_id=? AND status IN(Queued,Running) 原子更新后回读，\n竞态安全 + org 隔离下推 + 幂等。运行时验证：cancel→cancelled、幂等、越域 404。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第三轮——防御性校验与列宽\n\n- main: 空 redis_url 跳过建池，避免误导性告警\n- submit: 校验 type 长度 ≤48，超长返 400（而非 DB 500）\n- 迁移: tasks.webhook_url 改 text（URL 带 token 易超 255）；artifacts.s3_key 改 varchar(1024)（S3 key 上限）\n- DB 校验：webhook_url=text、s3_key=varchar(1024)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第四轮——type 归一化落库 + 字符数校验\n\n- 先 trim 成 task_type 变量，校验与落库同源，避免脏数据（带首尾空格）入库\n- 长度校验改 .chars().count()（按字符，与 varchar(48) 语义及错误文案一致）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: 采纳 gemini review 第五轮——空 webhook 归一为 None\n\n空串/纯空格 webhook URL 过滤为 None，避免片C worker 解析非法 URL 报错。\n（同轮对 type trim/字符数校验的建议已在上一轮实现，且本实现用 chars().count() 更准，故不回退。）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"227e3d8a4d08e2bd8992e203188db3e643b0abc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/227e3d8a4d08e2bd8992e203188db3e643b0abc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/2ef7f39a45a82d5ea73a3898a66ecd739850251a","verification":{"payload":"tree 227e3d8a