//api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/732c1d849b23aca7d7a0363e5483909e1699075e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T03:58:22Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T03:58:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gateway): 协议族适配器层 + 渠道健康管理 (#25)\n\n* feat(gateway): 协议族适配器层 + OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini 三协议转发\n\n将 relay 从硬编码 OpenAI 形态抽象为 ProtocolAdapter trait，按\nchannel.protocol_adapter 分派。同步 object-safe trait + 有状态\nSseTranscoder（move 进流生成器，规避 async-trait 对象安全问题）。\nOpenAI 兼容走纯透传 + PassthroughTranscoder（字节级零回归）；\nAnthropic/Gemini 含 tools/function calling + 多模态 image + 错误归一。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): 渠道健康管理（连通性测试+自动熔断+定时探活）\n\nPOST /channels/{id}/test 五层判定漏斗（挡\"200 但 body 是错误\"与\n\"200 空响应\"两坑，复用同一套 adapter）+ 测速写回；relay 4xx 命中\n401/关键词且 auto_ban → 异步熔断 CircuitBroken；定时探活 + 被动恢复\n（RR_CHANNEL_HEALTH_*，默认关，单实例假设）。channels 新增\nresponse_time/test_time/test_model/auto_ban/disabled_reason\n（迁移 m20260613_000028，已验证 up/down 可逆）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(gateway): 更新 as-built 文档与示例配置\n\nimplementation.md 增 v0.12 增量（协议适配层 + 渠道健康管理）+ 概览\n表行；.env.example 补 RR_CHANNEL_HEALTH_* 探活配置。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(admin): 渠道管理台适配三协议 + 健康字段 + 连通性测试\n\n协议族选项加 anthropic/gemini（后端已支持，前端此前选不了）；渠道表单/\n列表加健康字段（test_model/auto_ban 可编辑，response_time/test_time/\ndisabled_reason 只读展示）；CrudPage 加行级 action 框架，渠道「测试」按钮\n调 POST /channels/{id}/test 弹连通结果并刷新列表。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report): 补全报表构建器图表判定与表格列定义\n\n补回重构中遗漏的两个派生值：canChart（选图表且至少一个维度作 X 轴，\n否则退化表格）与 tableColumns（维度列 + 指标列右对齐千分位）。修复前\ntsc 因 canChart/tableColumns 未定义 + ColumnsType 未使用而失败。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(report): 报表订阅投递模块（邮件+webhook，片E WIP）\n\nM4 报表片E 的投递模块：send_email（lettre，HTML+xlsx 附件）+\npost_webhook（reqwest POST）+ build_transport（465/587/明文）。\n当前为独立文件，尚未在 report crate 接线（lib.rs 无 mod deliver、\n无调用方），落库避免遗失；接入 cron 由片E 后续完成。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 采纳 review — SSE 中途错误归一 + Gemini parts/functionResponse/安全拦截\n\n- anthropic/gemini SSE 转码器：中途 error 事件 → OpenAI 错误帧 + done 守卫\n- gemini build_request_body：ensure_nonempty_parts 防空 parts 400\n- gemini functionResponse.response：tool 内容 JSON 串解析为结构化对象\n- gemini convert_response：promptFeedback.blockReason → content_filter\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(gateway): 采纳 review — 探活合并同行两次 UPDATE 为单次\n\nrun_health_check_once 此前对同一渠道先 write_back_test 再 transition 两次\n独立 UPDATE；改为 ch.into() 转 ActiveModel 一次性 Set 测速/状态/原因后单次\nupdate。删除内联后失去引用的 transition 辅助函数。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"865a7ea9372842676e4da72a717f13837184ea50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/865a7ea9372842676e4da72a717f13837184ea50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/732c1d849b23aca7