.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/67424c2276f5eb9dfd208d2d75b85549048debfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T03:11:24Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T03:11:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(crm): M3 CRM 片D — 前端 CRM 控制台 (#23)\n\n* feat(crm): M3 CRM 片D — 前端 CRM 控制台（客户列表/详情 + 代客开户/充值/改派）\n\n对接片A/B 已落地端点，纯前端零后端改动：\n- 客户列表页 /crm：游标分页 + 按归属销售 id 过滤（全量访问者）+ 「代客开户」弹窗\n- 客户详情页 /crm/:orgId：钱包余额/授信/冻结卡片 + 「代客充值」「改派归属」弹窗\n  + Tabs（跟进记录 列表/新增、归属历史 active 标注）\n- src/api/crm.ts 类型化封装：Decimal 按字符串、枚举按变体名（labels.ts 中文映射）\n- 数据域隔离由后端 require_scoped 强制（前端无法绕过，越域 404）\n- 归属销售/改派目标用 number 输入（identity 无 GET /users，避免为 FK 下拉新建端点）\n\ntsc + vite build 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(implementation): v0.10 记录 M3 CRM 片D 前端控制台\n\n- §16 新增片D 实现说明（页面/路由、API 层契约要点、设计取舍）\n- §1 概览表 + 顶部增量记录\n- §11 标记片D 已落地；补注片C 与报表 sales_perf 数据集重叠的差异化提醒\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini review — 表单健壮性 7 处\n\n- CustomerList: 归属销售过滤拦 NaN（非整数前端报错，避免 owner_sales_id=NaN 触发后端 400）\n- CustomerList: 手机号加正则校验（/^1[3-9]\\d{9}$/，与后端 valid_phone 对齐）\n- CustomerList: 组织名称加 whitespace 校验（防全空格绕过必填）\n- CustomerList: 归属销售 id InputNumber precision={0}（强制整数）\n- CustomerDetail: 跟进列表 List.Item 补 key={n.id}\n- CustomerDetail: 充值金额 InputNumber precision={2}（RMB 到分）\n- CustomerDetail: 改派目标 id InputNumber precision={0}（强制整数）\n\n未采纳：labels.ts i18n 化——管理台 resources.ts/AppLayout/CrudPage 同样硬编码中文，\ni18n 仅用于顶层导航+认证+错误码；片D 遵循既有控制台约定，全控制台 i18n 应作统一切片单独做。\n\ntsc + vite build 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini 第二轮 — 分页探测 + 输入/渲染防御 4 处\n\n- CustomerList: 游标分页改 PAGE+1 探测，满页但无更多时不再误显「下一页」（避免空白页）\n- CustomerList: 归属销售过滤收紧为正整数（拒负数/0）\n- CustomerList: 余额/授信表格渲染 Number(v)||0 防御 NaN\n- CustomerDetail: fmtMoney 加 null/空/NaN 防护，异常降级 \"0.00\"\n\n（第二轮另 3 条 precision 建议为对旧 diff 的滞后评论，已在上一提交 5a523ea 落地。）\n\ntsc + vite build 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini 第三轮 — 清除闭包陷阱 + 缓存失效 3 处\n\n- CustomerList: 过滤框 onClear 显式重置（不复用 applyFilter，避免读到旧 ownerInput 闭包值导致清除无效）[high]\n- CustomerDetail: 代客充值成功后失效 [''crm-customers'']，返回列表余额刷新\n- CustomerDetail: 改派归属成功后失效 [''crm-customers'']，返回列表归属销售刷新\n\ntsc + vite build 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini 第四轮 — 金额规范化 + 加载态防闪烁 2 处\n\n- CustomerDetail: 充值金额 v.amount.toFixed(2) 上送（与 precision={2} 对齐，\n  避免浮点/科学计数法污染后端 rust_decimal 解析）\n- CustomerDetail: 跟进列表加载态不再误渲 <Empty>（加 !isLoading 条件，消除闪烁）\n\n未采纳：onError 改读 e.response?.data?.localizedMessage —— 本项目 api/client.ts 拦截器\n总会把 localizedMessage 合成到 error 对象（网络错误亦走 translateError 兜底），后端不返回该字段；\n当前 e.localizedMessage ?? 兜底 与全站 CrudPage 一致且健壮，Gemini 取法与实际错误契约不符。\n\ntsc + vite build 绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56f0832ce7c38f2d37bf411e79de44c68372fb07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/56f0832ce7c38f2d37bf411e79de44c68372fb07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/67424c2276f5eb9dfd208d2d75b85549048debfe","verification":{"payload":"tree 56f0832ce7c38f2d37bf411e79de44c68372fb07\npa