://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/2dec44cff4041c675004171e37539486c3da139e","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDJkZWM0NGNmZjQwNDFjNjc1MDA0MTcxZTM3NTM5NDg2YzNkYTEzOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb","sha":"3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb"}],"sha":"2dec44cff4041c675004171e37539486c3da139e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/2dec44cff4041c675004171e37539486c3da139e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:39:23Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T08:39:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(report): M4 监控报表 片A — 策展数据集 + RLS 行级隔离查询引擎 (#21)\n\n* feat(report): M4 监控报表 片A — 策展数据集 + RLS 行级隔离查询引擎\n\n内核（策展语义层「不开放原始库」）：\n- 新增 datasets / report_definitions 两表 + 实体 + 迁移\n- source 白名单注册表（report/src/source.rs）：物理关系 + 时间列 + 维度/指标白名单，\n  datasets 只能引用已注册 source 且 metrics/dimensions 取其子集\n- RLS 查询引擎（engine.rs）安全三步：权限门禁 → 按角色取 rls_rule 分支\n  （缺键 403 / null 全量 / {column,param} 绑定参数过滤）→ 仅拼装白名单受控标识符\n  + 值一律绑定参数注入（无注入面）\n- identity 新增 Principal + resolve_principal（有效角色 + org/user + 权限集）\n- rbac 新增 report.* 权限点（read/define/dataset.{finance,crm,ops}/export）+ role_rank + effective_role\n- report 端点：datasets 列表/详情/query + reports CRUD；启动 seed_datasets 落内置「用量」数据集\n- 狗粮：报表为内部一等 App，与第三方走同一数据集契约\n\n验证：fmt/clippy 全 workspace 干净；rbac 单测更新 + role_rank 单测；\n15 项端到端 smoke 固化为 scripts/smoke_report.sh（RLS 隔离/白名单/CRUD），实测 15/15 绿。\ndocs/implementation.md 同步 as-built（§15, v0.8）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report): 采纳 Gemini 第1轮 review — 报表越数据集 BOLA / 删除权限 / RLS 列名引号\n\n- report_def get_one/list: 校验主体对报表底层数据集有访问权（required_permission），\n  防仅 report.read 用户从高权限数据集报表泄露 name/config 元数据（BOLA/IDOR）\n- report_def delete: 增 report.define 权限校验（define 被收回后不应仍能删历史报表）\n- engine RLS/时间窗列名用双引号界定标识符，避免与 PG 保留字（如 user）冲突\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report): 采纳 Gemini 第2轮 review — 删除越权 404 防枚举 + 列表过滤分页下推 DB\n\n- report_def delete: 越权（非 owner/admin）由 403 改 404，与 get_one 一致，\n  防越权用户借 403/404 差异枚举私有报表是否存在（BOLA/信息泄露）\n- report_def list: 可见性/归属/数据集权限过滤下推到 DB（Condition + dataset_id IN）\n  + 偏移量分页（默认 100/上限 500），利用 idx_report_definitions_owner，避免全表载入内存 OOM\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(report): 采纳 Gemini 第3轮 review — 数据集权限过滤下推 DB\n\n- dataset list / report_def list 的可访问数据集计算：由全表载入内存 + Rust 过滤\n  改为 required_permission IN (主体权限集) 下推 DB（is_in），减内存/CPU 开销\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94fa234ecf7be92cf3cda40d8abac6e37e202485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/94fa234ecf7be92cf3cda40d8abac6e37e202485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 94fa234ecf7be92cf3cda40d8abac6e37e202485\nparent 8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781771963 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781771963 +0800\n\nfeat(report): M4 监控报表 片A — 策展数据集 + RLS 行级隔离查询引擎 (#21)\n\n* feat(report): M4 监控报表 片A — 策展数据集 + RLS 行级隔离查询引擎\n\n内核（策展语义层「不开放原始库」）：\n- 新增 datasets / report_definitions 两表 + 实体 + 迁移\n- source 白名单注册表（report/src/source.rs）：物理关系 + 时间列 + 维度/指标白名单，\n  datasets 只能引用已注册 source 且 metrics/dimensions 取其子集\n- RLS 查询引擎（engine.rs）安全三步：权限门禁 → 按角色取 rls_rule 分支\n  （缺键 403 / null 全量 / {column,param} 绑定参数过滤）→ 仅拼装白名单受控标识符\n  + 值一律绑定参数注入（无注入面）\n- identity 新增 Principal + resolve_principal（有效角色 + org/user + 权限集）\n- rbac 新增 report.* 权限点（read/define/dataset.{finance,crm,ops}/export）+ role_rank + effective_role\n- report 端点：datasets 列表/详情/query + reports CRUD；启动 seed_datasets 落内置「用量」数据集\n- 狗粮：报表为内部一等 App，与第三方走同一数据集契约\n\n验证：fmt/clippy 全 workspace 干净；rbac 单测更新 + role_rank 单测；\n15 项端到端 smoke 固化为 scripts/smoke_report.sh（RLS 隔离/白名单/CRUD），实测 15/15 绿。\ndocs/implementation.md 同步 as-built（§15, v0.8）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report): 采纳 Gemini 第1轮 review — 报表越数据集 BOLA / 删除权限 / RLS 列名引号\n\n- report_def get_one/list: 校验主体对报表底层数据集有访问权（required_permission），\n  防仅 report.read 用户从高权限数据集报表泄露 name/config 元数据（BOLA/IDOR）\n- report_def delete: 增 report.define 权限校验（define 被收回后不应仍能删历史报表）\n- engine RLS/时间窗列名用双引号界定标识符，避免与 PG 保留字（如 user）冲突\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report): 采纳 Gemini 第2轮 review — 删除越权 404 防枚举 + 列表过滤分页下推 DB\n\n- report_def delete: 越权（非 owner/admin）由 403 改 404，与 get_one 一致，\n  防越权用户借 403/404 差异枚举私有报表是否存在（BOLA/信息泄露）\n- report_def list: 可见性/归属/数据集权限过滤下推到 DB（Condition + dataset_id IN）\n  + 偏移量分页（默认 100/上限 500），利用 idx_report_definitions_owner，避免全表载入内存 OOM\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(report): 采纳 Gemini 第3轮 review — 数据集权限过滤下推 DB\n\n- dataset list / report_def list 的可访问数据集计算：由全表载入内存 + Rust 过滤\n  改为 required_permission IN (主体权限集) 下推 DB（is_in），减内存/CPU 开销\n\nfmt/clippy/test 全绿；smoke 15/15。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqM667CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7bgQAALI6psO2m8Lxy5kRjIwWYwt\nsjIeVq2J0mE8wU/rcYWTvX/nZ8fT+IS+u+eodSz2GXJDw0OZuJI8gLAfIwZ6Jm4S\nX+D3HAi5vszx2o8Fcr1QFBN0LJkKC6zK4k9lCTtPXVLIq82JH/h/7uLiQ5Sa007H\nNu9l8bOh73sTVuFyFlzmQs4THSoSc5QJPycgCHEqidEome8JqKdDScCaaPpFVLGF\nImwQYSyh2lWhvG6a/D0tnwdXWshWni5s0Qq+sX/XsCveZcRf8kt3OKCbEgTek4YG\nd4ex5ARLmgVvLrdL91mmuZxSGGbD0n8Wflc41eqJdmQrJj+2rs7nWnN5XJtGhR7m\n6D+FkB9sGETEvx93J89Ze/aU66wUcck+OlCOE7vbNejZVmpF8cr3w2atWHoLz45t\nGbfkvpca/Jhb3MjBpg3xU5Bb5JmgkQw7tX2bva3RYS6a0Pp9+i+XRfqaBR/vbyJx\nk0+UDJMkQOzdH4M7E/qPmlHW8BVUqk894v2KCf5tWeN8XTpG8bv6xCFa92qnKNBi\nIJREZjEU8y48vIwk6HhXgzMyN4bEKe3rM4IPr96hLgZROxt6lfA8CY+NSKUm/8ob\nrgVpceALjdPIGPAfUZ/SktXBw+iYTjlCc2vbGZLEQq+HKr6rdVSSf4//ZJublVWA\noVp8vqk8rHaf7U4KcwPy\n=+pWP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-18T08:39:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDNkMjA4MDkyZmNiNjEwNTUwMGYzZWNhNTMyMzgxZjFmODJiNTQ3YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad","sha":"8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad"}],"sha":"3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/3d208092fcb6105500f3eca532381f1f82b547bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T07:06:10Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T07:06:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(crm): M3 CRM 片B — 销售代客开户 + 代客充值 (#20)\n\n* refactor(billing,identity): 暴露 recharge_wallet / valid_phone 供 CRM 复用\n\nbilling 把 wallet::recharge 以 recharge_wallet 别名重导出（避开同模块内同名 HTTP handler）；identity 暴露 session::valid_phone。供 crm 片B 代客开户/充值复用，避免重复实现。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(crm): M3 片B 销售代客开户 + 代客充值（数据域 + 业绩归因）\n\n代客开户 POST /api/crm/customers（crm.write）：事务建 org+user+首条 active 归属，销售强制归己/全量权限指定 owner_sales_id，手机号格式+唯一校验。代客充值 POST /api/crm/customers/{org_id}/recharge（crm.write）：load_scoped_org 数据域校验（越域 404）+ 一步建 Paid 订单（created_by_sales_id=操作者）+ recharge_wallet 同事务入账，原子。零新表（复用 orders/users/customer_assignments）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(crm): smoke 加片B 8 断言（代客开户/充值/越域/越权），21→29\n\n断言 22–29：代客开户归属本人/建账号/首条 active 归属/手机号唯一 400、代客充值 Paid+归因A+入账余额=100、越域充值 404、finance 无 crm.write 开户 403。实测 29/29。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: 同步 M3 CRM 片B 实现（implementation.md v0.7）\n\n新增 §14.5 片B（代客开户/充值设计）+ §9 端点表两端点 + §10 工程清单 + §11 片B 标记完成。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini review — nickname 限长 + pay_channel/memo trim 过滤空\n\n- onboard: nickname 增加 max 64 字符校验（防超长截断/溢出）\n- recharge: pay_channel/memo 先 trim 并过滤空字符串，避免存入纯空白\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini 第2轮 review — 销售角色校验/手机号并发兜底/memo 限长+入流水\n\n- onboard: 管理员代开户时校验 owner_sales_id 确有 sales 角色（防误归属非销售）\n- onboard: 手机号唯一约束并发冲突归一为 400（phone already registered），不再 500\n- recharge: memo 增加 max 255 长度校验\n- recharge: memo 同步写入钱包流水（recharge_wallet 不再硬编码 None）\n- crm crate 新增 rise-rbac 依赖\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"781774a21bdb9bfca56c09f8c8ec72fae266fefa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/781774a21bdb9bfca56c09f8c8ec72fae266fefa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/8b1e5b035771311dc22460cf47ebcb30803c3cad","verification":{"payload":"tree 781774a21bdb9bfca56c09f8c8ec72fae266fefa\nparent 069c08ca4313d530aeb0b86f90e555ce939e8e41\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781766370 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781766370 +0800\n\nfeat(crm): M3 CRM 片B — 销售代客开户 + 代客充值 (#20)\n\n* refactor(billing,identity): 暴露 recharge_wallet / valid_phone 供 CRM 复用\n\nbilling 把 wallet::recharge 以 recharge_wallet 别名重导出（避开同模块内同名 HTTP handler）；identity 暴露 session::valid_phone。供 crm 片B 代客开户/充值复用，避免重复实现。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(crm): M3 片B 销售代客开户 + 代客充值（数据域 + 业绩归因）\n\n代客开户 POST /api/crm/customers（crm.write）：事务建 org+user+首条 active 归属，销售强制归己/全量权限指定 owner_sales_id，手机号格式+唯一校验。代客充值 POST /api/crm/customers/{org_id}/recharge（crm.write）：load_scoped_org 数据域校验（越域 404）+ 一步建 Paid 订单（created_by_sales_id=操作者）+ recharge_wallet 同事务入账，原子。零新表（复用 orders/users/customer_assignments）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(crm): smoke 加片B 8 断言（代客开户/充值/越域/越权），21→29\n\n断言 22–29：代客开户归属本人/建账号/首条 active 归属/手机号唯一 400、代客充值 Paid+归因A+入账余额=100、越域充值 404、finance 无 crm.write 开户 403。实测 29/29。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: 同步 M3 CRM 片B 实现（implementation.md v0.7）\n\n新增 §14.5 片B（代客开户/充值设计）+ §9 端点表两端点 + §10 工程清单 + §11 片B 标记完成。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini review — nickname 限长 + pay_channel/memo trim 过滤空\n\n- onboard: nickname 增加 max 64 字符校验（防超长截断/溢出）\n- recharge: pay_channel/memo 先 trim 并过滤空字符串，避免存入纯空白\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(crm): 采纳 Gemini 第2轮 review — 销售角色校验/手机号并发兜底/memo 限长+入流水\n\n- onboard: 管理员代开户时校验 owner_sales_id 确有 sales 角色（防误归属非销售）\n- onboard: 手机号唯一约束并发冲突归一为 400（phone already registered），不再 500\n- recharge: memo 增加 max 255 长度校验\n- recharge: memo 同步写入钱包流水（recharge_wallet 不再硬编码 None）\n- crm crate 新增 rise-rbac 依赖\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqM5jiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsO4QABFSlHPLe4dEHb64wNYjcJkV\nTila3NpqaCgB0UTiSkwl4ddZFNJLT2Jkg/wk4Ye708b/96WvJOV8uSt+YnyPRXoA\nsLToZnm4mlugMkJWGj+yYmrk8AVKASp6lY7AzZQYaPUhLoXzDP1PqmV+Ziv8qNX2\nqYAlXGRbvhy1xw9hrP6Rolbx3N2Wz/lxv2lUV8bko1nZnIJqVmA5b6hLClvD5W5O\ngzX7H6USr/Ny2mE9o3kYK6xL4jsSaPhiTsFwZcPOweraMta4TsFw95xwO8XcKMcw\nRgYMH4Of09E4WSqO887nSyP3qJ1MCixaE6ZmQ+drPN+DIJKemu0AjOiDaYh4+ubm\nHvLY8l5RhGUdIIQOdgi9rYbnpptTA5Y4Dq9kkGcFNxHuNvY870Y6cZlzqfoGse2j\n7clmCHAx+oCMwm+D7Kkphy75ewKd27OLvgXlrWHz013rjIxLMiih64yRPzPqrdK5\nAjAHSokYeKMQcFHK+zslHKP/y+PrV1qLD8rJOAZ/e6D1kaswPubkyIAR5jfK80e2\nK44yX0AGoBzhAMxVwJlVgiMNrMfkp5Jw03BYCSAAkq55AbpWxKTI8p6+xRzV/vPf\n3kyhv+MkmIv6c4zYHMpFHhvBazYl5aNhKuydYBF4L5z1ug5C/IpHKDOv+DXfU2db\nnMaq0I2qg0cIoof/DuAG\n=fbWJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-18T07:06:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http