0d0089fd27346e3edca9a373d7af4cad49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/cc09fa9f5e2195505ee3a0ee59bda54cc2812009","verification":{"payload":"tree d81b940d0089fd27346e3edca9a373d7af4cad49\nparent 2666a404125aa595f916cbd54a701ad4a5cebabd\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781573343 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781573343 +0800\n\nfix(identity): jwt_secret 未配返回 503 而非 500 (#18)\n\n未配 RR_JWT_SECRET 属部署配置缺失（非运行时故障），require/verify_request\n原返回 AppError::Internal(500)，与 guard/verify_request 文档承诺的 503 不符。\n改走 AppError::Unavailable(503)，响应体不回显配置细节。影响所有管理端点\n+ 用户登录/鉴权。\n\n验证：未配 secret + 无令牌，billing/email/test 与 billing/recharge 均由 500 → 503。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMKbfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADJcQAFeNRmHsmTL1ZhqNkF+vVz3H\nUlS7f8T02JeaLcuaMyW2mump1leYqryMcMgHK0l3HRUoqAPpSRvUQOtO1yS9fbxv\nTUrAEdQnjs5YvKoLK61JiJio1wEFdPgIeS8bGht6znfIY/0TRlRhETNCJLVZKnnu\nc3GZ3y+nTaTsUaB9okS9eVk4N/NQXn4TVikkEByWTBcYSv4mGgKSf7pfyLYlp0RW\np7+bPCbadMc13Kw+nB1cAPKYjHQyql9npAmk5Nkh7ZXegzSCQySfQXwKLWG1uA0y\nbWPLloROiMsksN8huowqYAecPgGjGhXgEbH3WItK5Xb5SN2ESKVq0Apd8WVMbb6W\nFgVU2jQoGi9H9nRb0f/Ml+wMxG+eMxotKNO7t5cDSIq9nH67KjLMvNBPIXBCeqO8\nqvhv9xqU1NTOp25JLIjSt74Xm2hj9KXmScI6FWHu4AoUBaeYfKYmInqPsnIGVXHQ\n2few7kVlcuww2M7CkWSZOYT/UEpkFRbVu1bLbjZLcQQoGBfF0emckKpkGAScpx2x\n1frbWCqkF05FpWXZXFUJNllTNezmCIHfsBUApnh+oMW5rsz4XgpmrTXtSQ1Xn64k\niIi1jiscmLyX0a4xIZnP1LZbXbYcMQ1QMwRIuX9quFpZThzsDiFVhcS6BXZVS6Zu\nQtcw8VppGh5TeDz4K5NK\n=iS1n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-16T01:29:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web