api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/2666a404125aa595f916cbd54a701ad4a5cebabd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T01:16:00Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T01:16:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M2 片F·Part2 月度毛利月报邮件 cron (#17)\n\n* feat(billing): M2 片F·Part2 月度毛利月报邮件 cron\n\n- email_cron：tokio 每分钟 tick，每月 day/hour（CST）触发上月毛利月报，\n  cron_state 防重（进程重启不重发）；compute_margin + render_margin 复用 Part1\n- email：lettre SMTP（465 relay / 587 starttls），HTML 正文 + xlsx 附件\n- config：SMTP（RR_SMTP_*）+ 月报 cron（RR_BILLING_EMAIL_*）env 配置；\n  dry-run 无需 SMTP 即可验证整条渲染+组装链路\n- migration 000023 cron_state（极简 KV，仅防重状态，不建通用 settings 基建）\n- POST /api/billing/email/test（billing.manage）手动触发，便于不等月初验证\n- main.rs DB 连通时 spawn_email_cron\n- 定位：org 无邮箱 → 全量平台毛利月报发固定财务收件人；per-org 客户账单留 M3\n\n本地验证：迁移 up/down/fresh 全通过；test 端点 dry-run 返回 period=上月、\n收件人解析、xlsx 5672B；鉴权无/错令牌 401、超管令牌 200。后端 74 单测绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 采纳 review——月报 cron 改自愈式触发\n\n- 触发条件由「精确 day+hour 窗口匹配」改为「now ≥ 本月预定时间 且本月未发」：\n  窗口内宕机/DB/SMTP 故障后，当月任意时刻重启即补发；cron_state 防重保证只发一次\n- 抽 should_send 纯函数 + 自愈/防重/跨月单测（billing 24，后端 75）\n- config 把 day clamp 到 1..=28、hour 到 0..=23，保证 with_ymd_and_hms 不返回 None\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8bab86310b9b59626175774235c938b7800fffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/c8bab86310b9b59626175774235c938b7800fffc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/2666a404125aa595f916cbd54a701ad4a5cebabd","verification":{"payload":"tree c8bab86310b9b59626175774235c938b7800fffc\nparent 1cb0dd5a76be51abc124c792de3ea25f1968203a\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781572560 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781572560 +0800\n\nfeat(billing): M2 片F·Part2 月度毛利月报邮件 cron (#17)\n\n* feat(billing): M2 片F·Part2 月度毛利月报邮件 cron\n\n- email_cron：tokio 每分钟 tick，每月 day/hour（CST）触发上月毛利月报，\n  cron_state 防重（进程重启不重发）；compute_margin + render_margin 复用 Part1\n- email：lettre SMTP（465 relay / 587 starttls），HTML 正文 + xlsx 附件\n- config：SMTP（RR_SMTP_*）+ 月报 cron（RR_BILLING_EMAIL_*）env 配置；\n  dry-run 无需 SMTP 即可验证整条渲染+组装链路\n- migration 000023 cron_state（极简 KV，仅防重状态，不建通用 settings 基建）\n- POST /api/billing/email/test（billing.manage）手动触发，便于不等月初验证\n- main.rs DB 连通时 spawn_email_cron\n- 定位：org 无邮箱 → 全量平台毛利月报发固定财务收件人；per-org 客户账单留 M3\n\n本地验证：迁移 up/down/fresh 全通过；test 端点 dry-run 返回 period=上月、\n收件人解析、xlsx 5672B；鉴权无/错令牌 401、超管令牌 200。后端 74 单测绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 采纳 review——月报 cron 改自愈式触发\n\n- 触发条件由「精确 day+hour 窗口匹配」改为「now ≥ 本月预定时间 且本月未发」：\n  窗口内宕机/DB/SMTP 故障后，当月任意时刻重启即补发；cron_state 防重保证只发一次\n- 抽 should_send 纯函数 + 自愈/防重/跨月单测（billing 24，后端 75）\n- config 把 day clamp 到 1..=28、hour 到 0..=23，保证 with_ymd_and_hms 不返回 None\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMKPQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs3QQAFs/Y+YLENEdGgKKloQKYU5D\nnHSVlQXDURDflryT+WNgr3WyJmPvlUOrqDaYZj6ZLSipdVVQo66Al+h+CHPsJk3E\nI6DdNa/uCywrMRqDNDcRYiQXYRXcROtw+S3B1eO6bMA4sBmGsfv7K49u0zi1djeo\nZL8UXpIETTLDd/7sB8VaTSOJEJVqFMnBBitH1nzOpkPQpj+qDADuXtsTgvzdOF32\nF5Eqnht5xmtKZEkau7Wo3J/Et/I4NaNkWO+7Ftz8vjU15yEv6XUuyPhU4nWR8/KD\n2vtqsIT3/rU91kekqvKNxMln8GQELJCnENftJ5AHb+z8C9es0jhOF+gmdPK839VR\nsCC+gGLOHZDPlZzxTDtziFyaPO+nv72trW4cAZCMWUCJpmNCZjO8Wj85dWCWnmBM\nAK9x4CIowb7GHUpm0wewpeBAxqs3Lip9J5LVWBOaKZw9GP7Gcd03k9Zz8LsWzpqw\nkhyh0MbPvpWxUwH7ksTNB+ovvxLl//MdtyU7D5+WxU1SwK8Dl5v4pXfkjiM1gJWe\nXlLfjuHdLqsYl55HuYeQGqSYDzZSPHjZfCzhyDByPz