_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/94890ed8642eab90dfe683e809e0b87e75152e90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T09:15:43Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T09:15:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M2 财务·片E 毛利报表（营收−成本 周期聚合 + model/channel 下钻） (#14)\n\n* feat(billing): M2 财务·片E 毛利报表（营收−成本 周期聚合 + model/channel 下钻）\n\n- GET /api/billing/margin?period=YYYY-MM[&group_by=model|channel]（billing.manage）\n- 营收 Σcharged_amount − 成本 Σcost_amount = 毛利，按周期聚合，可按模型/渠道下钻\n- cost_complete 诚实标注毛利可信度（有行缺成本价时偏乐观）\n- 成本走路由线(model_channels)、售价走定价线(prices)，毛利仅为 usage_logs 上事后差额，不引入新耦合\n- 含 period 解析与毛利/毛利率单元测试\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 修复 margin CI——补 ExprTrait 导入 + 公开 MarginResp + fmt\n\n- margin.rs 用 Expr::col(...).sum()/.count() 需 sea_orm::ExprTrait 在作用域内（E0599）\n- pub handler margin 返回类型 MarginResp 须 pub（private_interfaces lint）\n- lib.rs mod 按字母序、margin.rs 长行换行（rustfmt --check）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(billing): margin parse_period 超大年份回归测试\n\n钉住 Gemini review 指出的 y+1 溢出疑虑：i32::MAX 年份在 mk(y,m)?\n处即被 chrono(MAX_YEAR=262142) 判 Err 提前返回，y+1 不可达；\ndebug 溢出检查下断言返回 Err 而非 panic。生产代码不改（false positive）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8