s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:39:54Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:39:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M2 财务·片C 应收侧对账（周期聚合 + draft/locked 封账） (#11)\n\n* feat(billing): reconciliations 对账单表（迁移 + 实体）\n\nreconciliations(period 唯一、status Draft/Locked、total_revenue、total_calls、\nupstream_cost/gap 预留留 NULL、detail jsonb、locked_at)。每周期唯一一张。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 应收侧对账（周期聚合 usage_logs + draft→locked 封账）\n\nPOST /reconciliations 按 YYYY-MM 聚合 usage_logs 营收(SUM charged)+调用数+模型级 detail，幂等\n(不存在建draft/draft重算/locked返400)；GET 列表/详情；POST .../lock 封账(条件 UPDATE 原子，\n枚举参数不硬编码，0行回查区分404/幂等)。全 admin 守卫(跨 org 财务视图)。cost/gap 留 NULL(渠道\n成本未建)。period 边界 [当月1号,次月1号) 左闭右开，手解校验不引 regex。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 对账重算并发护栏(WHERE status=Draft) + lock 用 RETURNING *\n\n- generate 重算的 active.update 改条件 update_many(WHERE id=$ AND status=Draft)：读到 draft 后被\n  并发 lock 时命中 0 行 → 400，消除「读到 draft→并发 lock→仍覆盖封账记录」竞态。\n- lock 改 RETURNING * + from_query_result，命中即直接映射 Model，省一次 find_by_id 回查。Gemini round-1/2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc1e2cd25ade4938a60947daff8256e4599dc98f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/cc1e2cd25ade4938a60947daff8256e4599dc98f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/cf495a41624e762c73d338ccf48df8ca777fe770","verification":{"payload":"tree cc1e2cd25ade4938a60947daff8256e4599dc98f\nparent f183d901e529b49ab056366b8deb18d49943fdbf\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781415594 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781415594 +0800\n\nfeat(billing): M2 财务·片C 应收侧对账（周期聚合 + draft/locked 封账） (#11)\n\n* feat(billing): reconciliations 对账单表（迁移 + 实体）\n\nreconciliations(period 唯一、status Draft/Locked、total_revenue、total_calls、\nupstream_cost/gap 预留留 NULL、detail jsonb、locked_at)。每周期唯一一张。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 应收侧对账（周期聚合 usage_logs + draft→locked 封账）\n\nPOST /reconciliations 按 YYYY-MM 聚合 usage_logs 营收(SUM charged)+调用数+模型级 detail，幂等\n(不存在建draft/draft重算/locked返400)；GET 列表/详情；POST .../lock 封账(条件 UPDATE 原子，\n枚举参数不硬编码，0行回查区分404/幂等)。全 admin 守卫(跨 org 财务视图)。cost/gap 留 NULL(渠道\n成本未建)。period 边界 [当月1号,次月1号) 左闭右开，手解校验不引 regex。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 对账重算并发护栏(WHERE status=Draft) + lock 用 RETURNING *\n\n- generate 重算的 active.update 改条件 update_many(WHERE id=$ AND status=Draft)：读到 draft 后被\n  并发 lock 时命中 0 行 → 400，消除「读到 draft→并发 lock→仍覆盖封账记录」竞态。\n- lock 改 RETURNING * + from_query_result，命中即直接映射 Model，省一次 find_by_id 回查。Gemini round-1/2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLj6qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW3sQACILu0ipfL13z8BOKc4b17sg\ns7zukYyUlvgO8+wtlvS0cXc+Fh6dQNmcBdV3x6GaU8xaAsiAWvGzQndItMhdRVP2\nTPOwzEeWwL+b8SpfSQv+EY2eY9KKDWNY2GgG8hNsN+4yaZEJmqdDGZYWNOdgrDuV\nInc1Cuht8Gl4e6EbglUm1m9e9muKkW6UCx6TzhsXzjhwmDUXo4Gm65xYQAwMXJAA\nCiqo0BsSr6ljazIMRZqUrNBt21wD68asi0+dkba1IO9NALJsZ7I2N17H+hQRC2xb\n7SjbzMUbpjaYQMph7iRNwEIfz5CJTI1ZOIn3Jpz6TlHM8b6Mztc794hTLlEasFUQ\nBSxKAtGaVIxNJ1OIFccT63pe4R0SeiZptod9tgmogSL7Fqu8L5I0PcbJ4TZKSImi\n4G6qN56jKymil9gHaL2X+zg+vWurrEKlzYzqiBFw43CCPO934W4eY5WvyNWJOEAj\nV7xjdnFybQ47h9OzbJbBH1PJpbAlk/mPLr64woKJJWunS9rJoxeBedm4y8U/kQXQ\n5yxJfnVuy5MyNQQzFvDUPicU2v5a1eteLrZM7u3GQjCWeug+N+1pKZe0nczek0pY\npTitwldY4YbWVi2DYlCPReCQYOfwr0i9cGZp1bkax3pKi2FdWC85IBvsERIA+vs/\nRyjIjXeV+MlUoJJkWFl8\n=uAHV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T