0","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/f183d901e529b49ab056366b8deb18d49943fdbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T04:38:37Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T04:38:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M2 财务·片B 充值订单 + mock 支付（幂等原子入账） (#10)\n\n* feat(billing): orders 充值订单表（迁移 + 实体）\n\norders(org FK cascade、created_by_sales_id 软引用、amount 18,8、pay_channel、trade_no、\nstatus 枚举 Pending/Paid/Failed/Refunded、paid_at)；索引 (org_id,id) 供游标分页。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 充值订单 + mock 支付确认（幂等原子入账）+ admin_guard 抽取\n\n- POST /orders 建单(admin 守卫, org 校验 404, amount round+>0)；GET /orders 看单(Bearer, org\n  隔离, 游标分页)；POST /orders/{id}/confirm mock 确认。\n- confirm 幂等+原子：事务外判存在性/状态(404/已付幂等/非法400)，事务内「条件 UPDATE(WHERE status=1\n  并发护栏)+ 同事务 wallet::recharge 入账」原子提交——片 A recharge 泛型可组合的狗粮。\n- 抽 admin_guard 共享守卫(recharge/orders 复用)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): order 金额上限 + confirm 事务用 AppError + 枚举参数\n\n- create_order 加金额上限 9_999_999_999（否则建单成功但确认时 recharge 拒 → 永远确认不了）。\n- confirm 事务错误类型改 AppError：recharge 的 ? 直接传播保留 400/上下文（不再降级 500）。\n- 条件 UPDATE 的 status 用 OrderStatus::Paid/Pending 枚举参数，不硬编码 1/2。\n- lib.rs:36 误报（称 axum 用 :id）已拒：本项目 axum 0.8 语法即 {id}，confirm e2e 已证命中。Gemini round-1/2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(billing): confirm 用 RETURNING * 省一次 SELECT + pay_channel/trade_no 长度校验\n\n- confirm 条件 UPDATE 改 RETURNING *，命中即 from_query_result 直接映射 Model，省事务内再 SELECT 一次\n  (减一次 RTT + 缩短锁持有)。\n- pay_channel(≤32)/trade_no(≤128) 长度校验，超长拦 400(否则写 varchar 报错 500)。\n- lib.rs:36 critical 误报再次拒：axum 0.8 路径语法即 {id}(:id 反而坏)，confirm e2e 已证 {id} 命中。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): confirm 并发败者非 Paid 态返 400 而非 500\n\nNone 分支(条件 UPDATE 0 行)回查若为 Failed/Refunded 等业务态，属客户端/业务错误，改 BadRequest(400)\n而非 Internal(500)。lib.rs:36 critical 误报第 4 次拒(axum 0.8 即 {id}，e2e 证)。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9356302d8f9bf0f411b9fcd85b8ee769786e4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/d9356302d8f9bf0f411b9fcd85b8ee769786e4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/f183d901e529b49ab056366b8deb18d49943fdbf","verification":{"payload":"tree d9356302d8f9bf0f411b9fcd85b8ee769786e4c3\nparent 7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781411917 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781411917 +0800\n\nfeat(billing): M2 财务·片B 充值订单 + mock 支付（幂等原子入账） (#10)\n\n* feat(billing): orders 充值订单表（迁移 + 实体）\n\norders(org FK cascade、created_by_sales_id 软引用、amount 18,8、pay_channel、trade_no、\nstatus 枚举 Pending/Paid/Failed/Refunded、paid_at)；索引 (org_id,id) 供游标分页。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 充值订单 + mock 支付确认（幂等原子入账）+ admin_guard 抽取\n\n- POST /orders 建单(admin 守卫, org 校验 404, amount round+>0)；GET /orders 看单(Bearer, org\n  隔离, 游标分页)；POST /orders/{id}/confirm mock 确认。\n- confirm 幂等+原子：事务外判存在性/状态(404/已付幂等/非法400)，事务内「条件 UPDATE(WHERE status=1\n  并发护栏)+ 同事务 wallet::recharge 入账」原子提交——片 A recharge 泛型可组合的狗粮。\n- 抽 admin_guard 共