:"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T04:09:21Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T04:09:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M2 财务·钱包基座（wallets + transactions + 结算扣钱包 + 充值/余额预检） (#9)\n\n* feat(core): 钱包基座配置——admin_token 守卫 + InsufficientBalance(402)\n\nRR_ADMIN_TOKEN：RBAC 落地前手动充值的临时守卫；AppError::InsufficientBalance 映射 402。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): wallets + transactions 表（迁移 + 实体）\n\nwallets(余额/授信/冻结,挂 org 一对一)；transactions(只追加资金流水,bigint PK,有符号 amount\n+ balance_after 快照 + TxnKind 枚举 + ref 关联)。金额 numeric(18,8) 对齐。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 钱包余额/充值/消费 + 结算扣钱包 + 看余额/充值端点\n\nwallet.rs：原子 UPDATE...RETURNING + 记流水；ensure_funds 预检、recharge 充值入账、\nconsume 消费扣减。settle 事务内增「扣钱包余额 + 记 Consume 流水」与流水/扣预算原子一致。\nGET /wallet 看余额、POST /recharge 手动充值(X-Admin-Token 守卫,常量时间比较)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 钱包余额预检（可用额度<=0 → 402）\n\n鉴权后、转发前检查 org 钱包可用额度，<=0 直接 402 不浪费上游调用（后扣，放行>0）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 钱包乐观更新+精度+消费校验+token 哈希比较\n\n- 热路径：adjust_balance 改乐观先 UPDATE，0 行才 ensure_wallet 重试（省每次扣减的 INSERT）。\n- 精度：delta round_dp(8) 对齐 numeric(18,8)，避免内存/库截断分歧。\n- 防御：consume 校验 amount>0（否则 -amount 反而给钱包加钱）。\n- 安全：recharge 改 C:TransactionTrait 可嵌入片 B 订单事务；token 比较先 SHA-256 再比定长 32 字节，\n  消除长度泄露计时侧信道。Gemini round-1/2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(gateway): 注记钱包预检的 Redis 缓存延后理由\n\n一次索引主键查开销低，待并发量级证明为瓶颈再引 Redis 缓存可用额度布尔（避免过早造二级设施）。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): consume 事务化 + recharge 校验前先 round\n\n- consume 改 C:TransactionTrait 内包 db.transaction：直接传 DatabaseConnection 调用也保证\n  「扣余额+记流水」原子（在 settle 内则为 savepoint），杜绝扣了钱没记流水。\n- recharge/consume 均先 round_dp(8) 再校验 >0：极小正数 round 到 0 不再记 0 元流水。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): consume 去内层事务(交调用方) + round 到 0 跳过 + recharge org 校验 404\n\n- consume 去掉内层 db.transaction(round-3 的过度修正)：它是 crate 内部原语、唯一调用方 settle 已在\n  事务中，内层事务纯属 savepoint 往返开销。契约改为「调用方负责事务」。\n- 极小金额 round_dp(8) 为 0 时返回 Ok 跳过(而非 Err)，避免回滚 settle 丢失 usage_log。\n- recharge 端点先校验 org 存在，不存在返 404（否则 ensure_wallet 的 FK 失败 → 500）。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): recharge 金额上限校验（防 numeric 溢出 500）\n\namount > 9_999_999_999 时写 numeric(18,8) 会溢出 500，应用层先拦为 400。Gemini round-5。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(billing): recharge 用 ref_type.as_str() 更显式\n\nGemini round-6 误报「Some(&String) 编译错」（实际期望类型驱动 coerce，CI 一直绿）；改 as_str()\n显式表达，避免依赖隐式 coercion。同轮 not_null 建议经核验为误报（列已 NOT NULL，schema 非 _null\n变体本就含 not_null），不改。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bd3b97c531893f32974f33a568bbe65bf7d568b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/1bd3b97c531893f32974f33a568bbe65bf7d568b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bd3b97c531893f32974f33a568bbe65bf7d568b\nparent edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781410161 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781410161 +0800\n\nfeat(billing): M2 财务·钱包基座（wallets + transactions + 结算扣钱包 + 充值/余额预检） (#9)\n\n* feat(core): 钱包基座配置——admin_token 守卫 + InsufficientBalance(402)\n\nRR_ADMIN_TOKEN：RBAC 落地前手动充值的临时守卫；AppError::InsufficientBalance 映射 402。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): wallets + transactions 表（迁移 + 实体）\n\nwallets(余额/授信/冻结,挂 org 一对一)；transactions(只追加资金流水,bigint PK,有符号 amount\n+ balance_after 快照 + TxnKind 枚举 + ref 关联)。金额 numeric(18,8) 对齐。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 钱包余额/充值/消费 + 结算扣钱包 + 看余额/充值端点\n\nwallet.rs：原子 UPDATE...RETURNING + 记流水；ensure_funds 预检、recharge 充值入账、\nconsume 消费扣减。settle 事务内增「扣钱包余额 + 记 Consume 流水」与流水/扣预算原子一致。\nGET /wallet 看余额、POST /recharge 手动充值(X-Admin-Token 守卫,常量时间比较)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 钱包余额预检（可用额度<=0 → 402）\n\n鉴权后、转发前检查 org 钱包可用额度，<=0 直接 402 不浪费上游调用（后扣，放行>0）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 钱包乐观更新+精度+消费校验+token 哈希比较\n\n- 热路径：adjust_balance 改乐观先 UPDATE，0 行才 ensure_wallet 重试（省每次扣减的 INSERT）。\n- 精度：delta round_dp(8) 对齐 numeric(18,8)，避免内存/库截断分歧。\n- 防御：consume 校验 amount>0（否则 -amount 反而给钱包加钱）。\n- 安全：recharge 改 C:TransactionTrait 可嵌入片 B 订单事务；token 比较先 SHA-256 再比定长 32 字节，\n  消除长度泄露计时侧信道。Gemini round-1/2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(gateway): 注记钱包预检的 Redis 缓存延后理由\n\n一次索引主键查开销低，待并发量级证明为瓶颈再引 Redis 缓存可用额度布尔（避免过早造二级设施）。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): consume 事务化 + recharge 校验前先 round\n\n- consume 改 C:TransactionTrait 内包 db.transaction：直接传 DatabaseConnection 调用也保证\n  「扣余额+记流水」原子（在 settle 内则为 savepoint），杜绝扣了钱没记流水。\n- recharge/consume 均先 round_dp(8) 再校验 >0：极小正数 round 到 0 不再记 0 元流水。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): consume 去内层事务(交调用方) + round 到 0 跳过 + recharge org 校验 404\n\n- consume 去掉内层 db.transaction(round-3 的过度修正)：它是 crate 内部原语、唯一调用方 settle 已在\n  事务中，内层事务纯属 savepoint 往返开销。契约改为「调用方负责事务」。\n- 极小金额 round_dp(8) 为 0 时返回 Ok 跳过(而非 Err)，避免回滚 settle 丢失 usage_log。\n- recharge 端点先校验 org 存在，不存在返 404（否则 ensure_wallet 的 FK 失败 → 500）。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): recharge 金额上限校验（防 numeric 溢出 500）\n\namount > 9_999_999_999 时写 numeric(18,8) 会溢出 500，应用层先拦为 400。Gemini round-5。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(billing): recharge 用 ref_type.as_str() 更显式\n\nGemini round-6 误报「Some(&String) 编译错」（实际期望类型驱动 coerce，CI 一直绿）；改 as_str()\n显式表达，避免依赖隐式 coercion。同轮 not_null 建议经核验为误报（列已 NOT NULL，schema 非 _null\n变体本就含 not_null），不改。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLilxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6oYQAEwpI946CCGTk0sC+m8bgPRL\n5tIfS4fRclEyjpdBV/Gocl1j/BNpJaBH/+mRJllJt9zuLemNzi0iaOO2lZF5o3Ke\ngpTTqe/yxTsWIgS3DHXdW0ltJz3CeS+NziU4mDNxIOjcoI/KnSP1v3g+b5EwMjDy\nsK/IFLPrmY3HnzgY+tDZYbf8XC/0tkd0FdllGQ+b/UZkXS0GZgMgoeRDgaq5p/Et\n37C+eDk8ObgizIjop/HAzEOoIa85D9bVJ+x/mUkAwSj1GgUGF2w3vFw0DnKTPGnz\nkEaop0VaSVv/sCbw1HgzQ7xE2jqM6lOIWrR6tAFbLtsGsNDWX7t+cPk7SMdCs/dg\neM9xXjEQMG+6N+YIjeAP4MODdJE9232tePIHYzpenTe520LdEM3MQTheGoiNhvf0\nkYi9UgAlRLmZfL+QYbk4EVw8aIPDCxp9mUHEZsisfqNhaauWDEvICzwCINz1GOLO\nD6zHjosAbsuZSz+ER75LuPCNtpeIeHKkFrH0ZnDoWpeMZpSlK5tYPD9gC0o3XQHT\nG/LRNZvgu5dMo7yVl0RFI/ZvyZoGNLb+FnP8dn82vC7KLN2krj5OIHpnJEQdXhux\nbunm+Q51LUWj/tCHYxDuLhI33St6/hUTP4f9j53mm6Gcjc+9B2g4yT0yMSuYSlqm\n3J1NiLqd9Fyy8OhFkPFP\n=JvFp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T04:09:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDdiY2NlM2UxNTJjMTQ4YmU3OThlNTlhMGY0MDE4MDk0YzE1MDM1NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53","sha":"edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53"}],"sha":"7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/7bcce3e152c148be798e59a0f4018094c1503554"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T03:15:19Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T03:15:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gateway): relay 流式 SSE + 加权随机路由 + 重试退避 + 转发头 (#8)\n\n* feat(gateway): 加权随机故障转移序 + relay 依赖\n\nweighted_failover_order(纯函数+种子化单测)：优先级降序分层、层内按权重随机洗牌，\n同优先级负载均衡；与 rank_routes(确定序,供 /route 预览)区分。引入 rand/async-stream/\nfutures-util/tokio 及 reqwest stream feature(供下一片流式转发)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 流式 SSE + 重试退避 + 转发客户端头\n\n- 流式：不再拒 stream，规范化 stream=true 并注入 stream_options.include_usage，\n  边转发 SSE 边扫描末块 usage，流结束后 settle(is_stream=true) 计费。\n- 重试退避：连接/超时类瞬时错误最多 2 次尝试 + 指数退避；5xx 仍直接转下一渠道。\n- 转发头：OpenAI-Beta/Organization/Project 白名单透传上游。\n- 转发改用 weighted_failover_order 做同优先级加权随机负载均衡。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 流式断连漏单(Drop guard 保结算) + SSE 扫描热路径优化\n\n- 断连漏单：结算原放生成器末尾，客户端提前断连时 axum Drop 流→末尾代码不执行→免单。\n  改用 SettleGuard(随流 Drop 触发，正常/断连都结算；运行时句柄 spawn)；边流边镜像 usage 到 shared。\n- SSE 扫描：流式每 token 一块且多数无 usage，改为先 contains(\"usage\") 关键字预筛、已有\n  request_id 时跳过 JSON 解析；切片处理免每行 drain().collect() 分配。Gemini round-1。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 强制 include_usage + Drop 锁中毒优雅恢复 + 始终取最新 usage\n\n- 计费绕过(critical)：客户端显式 include_usage=false 时原 or_insert 尊重之 → 上游不返 usage\n  免单。改 insert 强制 true，不受客户端影响。\n- 进程 abort(high)：Drop 内 Mutex.unwrap() 遇中毒锁会二次 panic→abort；改 PoisonError::into_inner\n  优雅恢复（流内镜像锁同样处理）。\n- 用量准确(medium)：镜像改为始终用最新非空 scanner.usage（上游可能后续块更新用量）。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 仅连接错重试 + stream_options 规范化 + SSE 缓冲防 OOM + 零拷贝\n\n- 重复扣费(high)：POST 非幂等，超时重试可能让已处理+计费的请求被二次执行。仅 is_connect() 重试。\n- 计费绕过(high)：stream_options 传非对象时 as_object_mut→None 漏注入 include_usage；先规范化为对象。\n- OOM/DoS(medium)：上游无换行超长流致 buf 无限增长，加 64KB 上限超限即清。\n- 零拷贝(medium)：from_utf8_lossy → std::str::from_utf8 免 Cow 分配。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): SSE 缓冲上限 64KB→1MB（容纳大 tool call 块，防误清漏单）\n\n64KB 过小：大型 tool call/复杂 JSON 的单个 SSE 块可能超限触发清空 → 后续 usage 块解析失败\n绕过计费。提到 1MB，兼顾 DoS 封顶与大负载计费可靠。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): SSE 单块超 MAX_BUF 时跳过（修补 OOM 防护漏洞）\n\n上一版 OOM 防护有洞：单个传入块本身 > MAX_BUF 时，清空后仍 extend 该超大块 → 缓冲超限防护失效。\n清空后增加单块超限检查，直接跳过。Gemini round-5。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(gateway): SSE 扫描 O(N²)→O(N)（游标 + 末尾单次 drain）\n\nfeed 每行 drain(..=pos) 搬移后续元素，N 行 → O(N²)；1MB 缓冲多小行时是 CPU DoS 向量。\n改用 consumed 游标在切片上推进，循环结束一次性 drain(..consumed)，O(N)。Gemini round-6。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19f8e0afc0c6117f20960c87187605cb09efe3cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/19f8e0afc0c6117f20960c87187605cb09efe3cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53","verification":{"payload":"tree 19f8e0afc0c6117f20960c87187605cb09efe3cc\nparent 5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781406919 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781406919 +0800\n\nfeat(gateway): relay 流式 SSE + 加权随机路由 + 重试退避 + 转发头 (#8)\n\n* feat(gateway): 加权随机故障转移序 + relay 依赖\n\nweighted_failover_order(纯函数+种子化单测)：优先级降序分层、层内按权重随机洗牌，\n同优先级负载均衡；与 rank_routes(确定序,供 /route 预览)区分。引入 rand/async-stream/\nfutures-util/tokio 及 reqwest stream feature(供下一片流式转发)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 流式 SSE + 重试退避 + 转发客户端头\n\n- 流式：不再拒 stream，规范化 stream=true 并注入 stream_options.include_usage，\n  边转发 SSE 边扫描末块 usage，流结束后 settle(is_stream=true) 计费。\n- 重试退避：连接/超时类瞬时错误最多 2 次尝试 + 指数退避；5xx 仍直接转下一渠道。\n- 转发头：OpenAI-Beta/Organization/Project 白名单透传上游。\n- 转发改用 weighted_failover_order 做同优先级加权随机负载均衡。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 流式断连漏单(Drop guard 保结算) + SSE 扫描热路径优化\n\n- 断连漏单：结算原放生成器末尾，客户端提前断连时 axum Drop 流→末尾代码不执行→免单。\n  改用 SettleGuard(随流 Drop 触发，正常/断连都结算；运行时句柄 spawn)；边流边镜像 usage 到 shared。\n- SSE 扫描：流式每 token 一块且多数无 usage，改为先 contains(\"usage\") 关键字预筛、已有\n  request_id 时跳过 JSON 解析；切片处理免每行 drain().collect() 分配。Gemini round-1。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 强制 include_usage + Drop 锁中毒优雅恢复 + 始终取最新 usage\n\n- 计费绕过(critical)：客户端显式 include_usage=false 时原 or_insert 尊重之 → 上游不返 usage\n  免单。改 insert 强制 true，不受客户端影响。\n- 进程 abort(high)：Drop 内 Mutex.unwrap() 遇中毒锁会二次 panic→abort；改 PoisonError::into_inner\n  优雅恢复（流内镜像锁同样处理）。\n- 用量准确(medium)：镜像改为始终用最新非空 scanner.usage（上游可能后续块更新用量）。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 仅连接错重试 + stream_options 规范化 + SSE 缓冲防 OOM + 零拷贝\n\n- 重复扣费(high)：POST 非幂等，超时重试可能让已处理+计费的请求被二次执行。仅 is_connect() 重试。\n- 计费绕过(high)：stream_options 传非对象时 as_object_mut→None 漏注入 include_usage；先规范化为对象。\n- OOM/DoS(medium)：上游无换行超长流致 buf 无限增长，加 64KB 上限超限即清。\n- 零拷贝(medium)：from_utf8_lossy → std::str::from_utf8 免 Cow 分配。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): SSE 缓冲上限 64KB→1MB（容纳大 tool call 块，防误清漏单）\n\n64KB 过小：大型 tool call/复杂 JSON 的单个 SSE 块可能超限触发清空 → 后续 usage 块解析失败\n绕过计费。提到 1MB，兼顾 DoS 封顶与大负载计费可靠。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): SSE 单块超 MAX_BUF 时跳过（修补 OOM 防护漏洞）\n\n上一版 OOM 防护有洞：单个传入块本身 > MAX_BUF 时，清空后仍 extend 该超大块 → 缓冲超限防护失效。\n清空后增加单块超限检查，直接跳过。Gemini round-5。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf(gateway): SSE 扫描 O(N²)→O(N)（游标 + 末尾单次 drain）\n\nfeed 每行 drain(..=pos) 搬移后续元素，N 行 → O(N²)；1MB 缓冲多小行时是 CPU DoS 向量。\n改用 consumed 游标在切片上推进，循环结束一次性 drain(..consumed)，O(N)。Gemini round-6。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLhzHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgi4QABPP0J284suqmzTjHcobI+Jd\nSNedBZkXYWtiNinU8k86VuA6X080yHsjBit6LjGnh78XBpXkwrazs4j5lWMPazX0\npCQzPk18CBeTMr7+p4oKAhzDhFT4SJBmBk49+MndyxC/LhdOVAKEPz5qYzHy2AfH\nrFnThtBxVXvfKJpGPFkt4+RgTki+SxqV8FjiDcaEtUyBYeahMOKoJBAE7kSZBKW/\n8tBAwd0CmUEtsCAMjIgsxAKdlOh5ajRSplMxIQhOr7iP1dwBHSaxCh5jc5NbSB8r\nxLLYNII+w17yEboDvyScLyzB2GRWVJuZMrJazTkDc/FS9YKguAAZfbdNx2yEzN9X\nBvkF9pVCPPQ1Ji39qSBcY6+EKFMk1ZIZFTvhXCSxSCi96/7KB7WIJmRzq4G4BkRI\nmg/vw4z46zqxQWOQtJ0sLRr5J+Oaxg6htwFi1diDVzFHU+58toAeqiK5oqAznXc9\nHv7uJCrrm118mp9TQviQBBezkbvAPp6U2lO1CQrs/drr6O+vrfLdt3MyhsEfbrb6\nsmCibS1F1jK/cgD9cyA3GpUpR+lHEVj7pvA4App+6o08LIPSSe0poJDJ5kZ4bhr4\n7q5gJoebidYjsVtv/okAMHS/GN5OtdhQha074eGykFHlJ21wB57H5/G/6339/7i4\nl4GhrGDozDnq/5VjWaLY\n=8VOC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T03:15:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKGVkZjlmNjA5ZjI3OGEwMjAyMGY4NWQ5YzcyMzIxZjMwNmZhMDJkNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7","sha":"5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7"}],"sha":"edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/edf9f609f278a02020f85d9c72321f306fa02d53"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T02:18:24Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T02:18:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): M1 同步后扣计费结算（relay→算费→流水→扣预算，闭合 MVP） (#7)\n\n* feat(billing): usage_logs 调用计费流水表（迁移 + 实体）\n\n只追加审计表：无外键软引用、PK bigint（唯一无界增长表）、索引 (org,created)/(key,created)/(created)。\ngroup_slug 为计费当下分组快照，事后改 org 分组不影响历史账。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(pricing): resolve_price_by_group_id 热路径按 id 解析 + ResolvedPrice.model_id\n\n网关计费手握 group_id，免 slug→id 二次查；与 slug 版共用同一 core 解析（所见即所得）。\nResolvedPrice 增 model_id 供流水落库。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 同步后扣结算 + 看流水端点\n\ncharge.rs 纯算费（元/百万 token，Decimal 保精度，8 单测）；settle.rs 编排：\nresolve_price → 算折前/折后 → 插流水 → 原子自增 budget_used → 超限翻 Exhausted。\n/api/billing/usage 按密钥 org 行级隔离（RLS 雏形）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 2xx 成功响应同步结算扣费\n\n成功分支解析上游 usage + id + latency，调 settle_chat 落流水扣预算；\n结算失败只 log（at-least-serve），不拒绝已服务的响应。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 热路径分组容错回落默认价（避免删组导致免单）\n\nresolve_price_by_group_id：group_id 查无分组时回落默认价（group=None），不再 NotFound。\n计费路径与 slug 版（管理台预览，严格报错防拼错）刻意不同——删组只应降级到默认价，\n而非让该次调用结算失败被 at-least-serve 免单丢收入。Gemini round-1。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 负数用量钳制 + 结算事务化（CASE 合并扣费与翻转）\n\n- extract_token_usage 对 token 钳制下限 0，防恶意/buggy 上游返回负数算出负费用（变相退款）。\n- settle_chat 流水落库 + 扣费包入事务；预算自增与超限翻 Exhausted 合并为单条原子 UPDATE\n  （CASE WHEN），消除「已超限但仍 Enabled」崩溃窗口并省一次热路径 RTT。Gemini round-1。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 显式拒绝流式请求（堵免费漏洞）\n\nstream=true 时 SSE 响应体无法解析 usage → settle 静默跳过 → 用户免费使用；\n且 bytes() 全缓冲破坏流式实时性。流式计费未支持前返回 400。流式计费留后续切片。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): Decimal 先乘后除保精度 + /usage 分页\n\n- compute_charge 改 (q*p)/divisor 先乘后除，减少 Decimal 除法精度损失与尺度扩张。\n- /usage 增 offset 参数 + .offset()，支持翻查 200 条以上的更早流水。Gemini round-2。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 健壮流式判定（堵字符串/数字 stream 绕过免费）\n\nstream 仅拦 JSON bool true 时，{\"stream\":\"true\"} / {\"stream\":1} 经 as_bool→None 绕过 →\n宽松上游返 SSE → settle 解析失败静默免单。改为：仅 absent/null/false/0/\"false\" 视为非流式，\n其余真值/疑似真值一律拒 400。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 计费精度 6→8 位（堵微调用 round-to-zero 免费洞）\n\nround_dp(6) 会把极便宜模型微小调用（0.1 元/百万 × 3 token=0.0000003）round 到 0 → 高频免费。\n提到 8 位：charge round_dp(8)、usage_logs 金额列 numeric(18,8)、新增 000010 ALTER api_keys\n预算列对齐 18,8（budget_used 累加 charged，须同精度）。Gemini round-3。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): /usage 改游标分页 + (org_id,id) 支撑索引\n\noffset 分页在无界增长的 usage_logs 上有深翻页全扫与高频追加数据漂移（翻页重复）两个问题。\n改为按 id 倒序的游标分页（cursor=上页末条 id，过滤 id<cursor），走主键有序定位耗时恒定且无漂移；\n补 idx_usage_logs_org_id(org_id,id) 支撑 org 内游标查询。Gemini round-4。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee4d035cf42380838895fe6be7ac7a791f91d2b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/ee4d035cf42380838895fe6be7ac7a791f91d2b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7","verification":{"payload":"tree ee4d035cf42380838895fe6be7ac7a791f91d2b2\nparent 09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781403504 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781403504 +0800\n\nfeat(billing): M1 同步后扣计费结算（relay→算费→流水→扣预算，闭合 MVP） (#7)\n\n* feat(billing): usage_logs 调用计费流水表（迁移 + 实体）\n\n只追加审计表：无外键软引用、PK bigint（唯一无界增长表）、索引 (org,created)/(key,created)/(created)。\ngroup_slug 为计费当下分组快照，事后改 org 分组不影响历史账。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(pricing): resolve_price_by_group_id 热路径按 id 解析 + ResolvedPrice.model_id\n\n网关计费手握 group_id，免 slug→id 二次查；与 slug 版共用同一 core 解析（所见即所得）。\nResolvedPrice 增 model_id 供流水落库。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(billing): 同步后扣结算 + 看流水端点\n\ncharge.rs 纯算费（元/百万 token，Decimal 保精度，8 单测）；settle.rs 编排：\nresolve_price → 算折前/折后 → 插流水 → 原子自增 budget_used → 超限翻 Exhausted。\n/api/billing/usage 按密钥 org 行级隔离（RLS 雏形）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(gateway): relay 2xx 成功响应同步结算扣费\n\n成功分支解析上游 usage + id + latency，调 settle_chat 落流水扣预算；\n结算失败只 log（at-least-serve），不拒绝已服务的响应。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 热路径分组容错回落默认价（避免删组导致免单）\n\nresolve_price_by_group_id：group_id 查无分组时回落默认价（group=None），不再 NotFound。\n计费路径与 slug 版（管理台预览，严格报错防拼错）刻意不同——删组只应降级到默认价，\n而非让该次调用结算失败被 at-least-serve 免单丢收入。Gemini round-1。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(billing): 负数用量钳制 + 结算事务化（CASE 合并