ttps://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f"}],"sha":"5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/5a39f335c2a72dd0b0a92c0096ed7f80bed2a3f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T09:16:26Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T09:16:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(relay): M1 OpenAI 兼容转发管线（auth→route→failover→forward） (#6)\n\n* feat(relay): M1 OpenAI 兼容转发管线（auth→route→failover→forward）\n\n打通 MVP 调用路径（计费结算/流式/任务类留待后续切片）：\n\n- POST /v1/chat/completions（挂根 /v1）：Bearer 鉴权(verify_key) → 模型白名单 →\n  resolve_route → 按故障转移顺序依次转发上游（5xx/连接错误自动转下一渠道）\n- 转发时模型映射到 upstream_model_name、注入渠道 credentials 的 key（Bearer）\n- gateway 依赖 rise-identity（鉴权）+ reqwest（rustls，进程级共享 Client）\n- identity 暴露 bearer_token 供 relay 复用（避免重复实现）\n\n端到端（mock 上游）：bad(p20)→500→failover good(p10)→200，model 重映射 gpt-4o-up、\n注入 Bearer sk-good-up；无 auth 401、白名单外 403、未知模型 404。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n失败转移前批量取候选渠道（is_in + HashMap），把循环内 N+1 查询降为 1 次，\n减少高并发转发的 DB I/O。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\n读上游响应体失败时（连接中断/读超时）转移到下一候选渠道，而非直接 500。\n此时尚未向客户端写任何响应，failover 安全。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n透传上游响应的 Content-Type（而非硬编码 application/json），\n非 JSON 错误响应（HTML/纯文本）也能让客户端正确处理。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"282fdd7cc313b74f1821ed55aa46416beabcacfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/282fdd7cc313b74f1821ed55aa46416beabcacfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f","verification":{"payload":"tree 282fdd7cc313b74f1821ed55aa46416beabcacfe\nparent 7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781342186 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781342186 +0800\n\nfeat(relay): M1 OpenAI 兼容转发管线（auth→route→failover→forward） (#6)\n\n* feat(relay): M1 OpenAI 兼容转发管线（auth→route→failover→forward）\n\n打通 MVP 调用路径（计费结算/流式/任务类留待后续切片）：\n\n- POST /v1/chat/completions（挂根 /v1）：Bearer 鉴权(verify_key) → 模型白名单 →\n  resolve_route → 按故障转移顺序依次转发上游（5xx/连接错误自动转下一渠道）\n- 转发时模型映射到 upstream_model_name、注入渠道 credentials 的 key（Bearer）\n- gateway 依赖 rise-identity（鉴权）+ reqwest（rustls，进程级共享 Client）\n- identity 暴露 bearer_token 供 relay 复用（避免重复实现）\n\n端到端（mock 上游）：bad(p20)→500→failover good(p10)→200，model 重映射 gpt-4o-up、\n注入 Bearer sk-good-up；无 auth 401、白名单外 403、未知模型 404。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n失败转移前批量取候选渠道（is_in + HashMap），把循环内 N+1 查询降为 1 次，\n减少高并发转发的 DB I/O。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\n读上游响应体失败时（连接中断/读超时）转移到下一候选渠道，而非直接 500。\n此时尚未向客户端写任何响应，failover 安全。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(relay): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n透传上游响应的 Content-Type（而非硬编码 application/json），\n非 JSON 错误响应（HTML/纯文本）也能让客户端正确处理。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLR/qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXboQAB+NMC45tD9D1wFR8rGjqOuy\nYwxHe2r1TQZafXJSJSgZ3DdsOORAXGDIlbtEiJnuU5z2JtoPZb9gutRm9GGnE9hI\nSnH6uYDb5XbrsgpL4sFu3rQrtyv4sOUVEayatGMkNwZWj389RshkFDocjDaCvfvo\ns99KylLSrcsWAMRVdLcXhfdoLTKP5M6ARibLA3K0gRgijASKYDv1mDRAsQouvp8I\nlXz7sPoI8ZP7xoXS3ZhZ9KK1j9WEp3tgqCOGBJ+Jvm2WNIHLv79xhBD6h2fMwgpM\ngNnhwNMt/UyFXUov2Pn/L+p+3xEY/MGpt/WjIhCsiOWSMEs2j3SDeVSIRgYFbuMh\nrop1BIF52lAEic6iOyxVeqfeWmfkaDeV7r5NOpDotAIbD4nJGI+SZnY47D/PcSnH\nHcY4j9CEoP9B/7ot9KrlD1PHWqOFnr37Wx1raODwB+JqN4AuI7gBzwFmBcCME+Gn\ns/wAf9Q/xvL9Y4C4XVPo01HLPGnjaK0yt6fZBxOuZtuitVvvpeICcl81/ngJg0Sn\nicFQjAJvwyCdIVpnl2NR9Lmvk+kVGHd+VkSN5KNErTPHfpbog9mbyZysepIQJajB\nMRz2NQSBZsrkxUT4HnP7vGipjPYC2MvajQrAT5Dub1CQttG/pnkKfrXVPebWMfbZ\nQeRBe2dcbkcgm1LaJRxa\n=DQNU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-13T09:16:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDA5NzU4YzJiMzljMmNjNTcyNWFhOTQyMTU4MmJjOTRhZDdkZGI1M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388","sha":"7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388"}],"sha":"09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/09758c2b39c2cc5725aa9421582bc94ad7ddb53f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:25:56Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:25:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(identity): M1 组织 + 虚拟密钥 + 密钥鉴权（verify_key / whoami） (#5)\n\n* feat(identity): M1 组织 + 虚拟密钥 + 密钥鉴权（relay 鉴权地基）\n\n- rise-entity：organizations（计费主体，OrgStatus，商业分组 group_id→定价分组）、\n  api_keys（虚拟密钥，KeyStatus，预算/模型白名单/过期；仅存 sha256 哈希，不派生 serde）\n- 迁移 007/008：organizations、api_keys（唯一 key_hash + 索引 + FK）\n- identity::auth：hash_key(sha256)、evaluate_key 纯函数（状态/过期/预算，6 单测）、\n  verify_key DB 编排（hash→查找→evaluate→org Active 校验→KeyContext）\n- AppError::QuotaExceeded(429)；GET /api/identity/whoami（Bearer→鉴权上下文）\n\n端到端：有效 200(org/group)、过期 401、禁用 403、超预算 429、停用组织 403、未知/无头 401、无哈希泄露。\n用户登录/注册（users+密码）留待后续 identity 子片。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(identity): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n- hash_key 单次预分配 64 字节 + write!，去掉逐字节 format! 的多次小分配（鉴权热路径）\n- bearer 提取改大小写不敏感（RFC 7235 方案名不区分大小写），get(..7) 非 panic\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(identity): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\n- 性能：定义 api_keys→organizations 关系，verify_key 改 find_also_related 单次 JOIN\n  （鉴权热路径少一次 RTT），移除不再用的 find_by_key_hash\n- 类型安全：organizations.org_type/realname_status 改强类型 OrgType/RealnameStatus 枚举\n- 健壮性：bearer 提取去空白并拒空 token，避免 \"Bearer \" 触发无意义查询\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(identity): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\nhash_key 改查表直转 hex，去掉 write!/fmt 引擎开销（鉴权热路径）。\n输出不变（sha256 已知向量单测通过）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61b4a27d47d03bd387c2318a36c1d530132a2e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/61b4a27d47d03bd387c2318a36c1d530132a2e43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/7733028ad370ebc596f06c19e2dce2525bc7e388","verification":{"p