,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b7658601301e57905b6ac2bf0bdeade5e3132434/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:59:57Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:59:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(gateway): M1 网关路由核心 — channels/model_channels + resolve_route() (#3)\n\n* feat(gateway): M1 网关路由核心 — channels/model_channels + resolve_route\n\n定价五要素的\"渠道\"要素 + 路由线（与定价线对称，仅在 models 处相交）：\n\n- rise-entity 加 channels（协议族/base_url/凭据/优先级/权重/状态）、model_channels（路由表，\n  upstream_model_name 映射 + 覆盖优先级/权重 + cost_price 成本与售价分离）\n- 迁移 005/006：channels、model_channels（唯一(model,channel) + 路由热路径索引 + FK CASCADE）\n- gateway::route 纯函数（5 单测）：rank_routes（优先级降序→权重降序→id 稳定）、\n  pick_weighted（最高优先级组内按权重选，注入 rand 便于测试，全 0 权重回落）\n- resolve_route DB 编排（有效优先级=mc.priority??channel.priority）+ GET /api/gateway/route 路由预览\n\n端到端：gpt-4o → [主 p10w70, 备 p10w30, 兜底 p5]，熔断渠道(status=3)正确排除，upstream 映射生效。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n- pick_weighted 改 O(N) 求最高优先级，去掉整组克隆与 O(NlogN) 排序（路由热路径）\n- rank_routes 用 sort_unstable_by（比较器含 channel_id 兜底，结果确定）\n- channels.status 改强类型 ChannelStatus（DeriveActiveEnum，映射 smallint），\n  resolve_route 过滤用 ChannelStatus::Enabled 代替魔术数字 1_i16\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\n- pick_weighted 全程在 slice 上遍历，零堆分配（去掉 collect 临时 Vec），\n  末尾 rfind 满足 clippy（避免 last/next_back 全程迭代）\n- model_channels::Model 补 derive Eq，与 channels/models 一致\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n- model_channels FK ChannelId 加索引（PG 不自动建，优化级联删除避免全表扫描）\n- model_channels 定义 belongs_to models/channels 关系 + Related impl\n- resolve_route 改用 find_also_related 单次 LEFT JOIN（去掉 HashMap 二次查询，避免 N+1）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a6ae5424c5a664dce69a308bd0370e8d8aad7e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/7a6ae5424c5a664dce69a308bd0370e8d8aad7e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/b7658601301e57905b6ac2bf0bdeade5e3132434","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a6ae5424c5a664dce69a308bd0370e8d8aad7e7\nparent b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781333997 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781333997 +0800\n\nfeat(gateway): M1 网关路由核心 — channels/model_channels + resolve_route() (#3)\n\n* feat(gateway): M1 网关路由核心 — channels/model_channels + resolve_route\n\n定价五要素的\"渠道\"要素 + 路由线（与定价线对称，仅在 models 处相交）：\n\n- rise-entity 加 channels（协议族/base_url/凭据/优先级/权重/状态）、model_channels（路由表，\n  upstream_model_name 映射 + 覆盖优先级/权重 + cost_price 成本与售价分离）\n- 迁移 005/006：channels、model_channels（唯一(model,channel) + 路由热路径索引 + FK CASCADE）\n- gateway::route 纯函数（5 单测）：rank_routes（优先级降序→权重降序→id 稳定）、\n  pick_weighted（最高优先级组内按权重选，注入 rand 便于测试，全 0 权重回落）\n- resolve_route DB 编排（有效优先级=mc.priority??channel.priority）+ GET /api/gateway/route 路由预览\n\n端到端：gpt-4o → [主 p10w70, 备 p10w30, 兜底 p5]，熔断渠道(status=3)正确排除，upstream 映射生效。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n- pick_weighted 改 O(N) 求最高优先级，去掉整组克隆与 O(NlogN) 排序（路由热路径）\n- rank_routes 用 sort_unstable_by（比较器含 channel_id 兜底，结果确定）\n- channels.status 改强类型 ChannelStatus（DeriveActiveEnum，映射 smallint），\n  resolve_route 过滤用 ChannelStatus::Enabled 代替魔术数字 1_i16\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\n- pick_weighted 全程在 slice 上遍历，零堆分配（去掉 collect 临时 Vec），\n  末尾 rfind 满足 clippy（避免 last/next_back 全程迭代）\n- model_channels::Model 补 derive Eq，与 channels/models 一致\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(gateway): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n- model_channels FK ChannelId 加索引（PG 不自动建，优化级联删除避免全表扫描）\n- model_channels 定义 belongs_to models/channels 关系 + Related impl\n- resolve_route 改用 find_also_related 单次 LEFT JOIN（去掉 HashMap 二次查询，避免 N+1）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLP/tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA10QQAAl5ctpG2zJWNQdvOZulFJmx\nKqcnluntgvOYrO2AMruwtCrmkjN6aNS4TDRSV0rsEuRMTTLV9sVWMYux+WreGeY3\njpfmLp75lODZ7G5m7+xbKxvpEhsnTtbfU+aiUfcD6cpgLqQ98flzg/JW0RausQb+\nw6SvRIrwLYa7f5QBfCGC6FGU45T1RFyUEt8gaVQpRM30OSmibUU57N6seWDBnaoc\nOA27PJDBLp6NKSlZfox/NSHnMVlKFO25PhN7gUoWM0hneXhiE7nnTT51R1uDDvgq\nWYzWv/mKxwn+EEpUCLhFuOoGKR+V1+xhPqx9ziGSyVrwBSci/i/r64j3UJviROLS\nc4r8J2h0SMcL1gzvo2oDLyOoBLn2xy7f4lXTdOwXU8Y1ZIxYbk5syfJVC7ThwTyY\nGAWZcpEh67mSZ5khnmimZQ/ZZnaz6Ivo8ieqccHsR6lHT8MaVQrfTPX54/HH79aN\nuLYC1BpNF6H0mjP/su+OqBBcDcKmB7UHkwi44dvKV2Nfset2n6TMsDBWmV9opv/M\n4HcZY/OmTOG25zsfh39I+mtAqvBsaj5eC5gfhLT++Pd3Tp6Jj/7oczNCxuMNoGke\neNL/v4bu3rBtbpBeINZcYlOORGQuTQMxwWq83ZsA7+CFSKUcDl8shYZJgbWJHpqY\n6XAhUcx+tbAwN6e+OuYr\n=09nT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-13T06:59:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/b7658601301e57905b6ac2bf0bdeade5e3132434","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKGI3NjU4NjAxMzAxZTU3OTA1YjZhYzJiZjBiZGVhZGU1ZTMxMzI0MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e","sha":"b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e"}],"sha":"b7658601301e57905b6ac2bf0bdeade5e3132434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b7658601301e57905b6ac2bf0bdeade5e3132434"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/commits/b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:03:04Z","email":"wangtao405@gmail.com","name":"Tony Wang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:03:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(pricing): M1 定价五要素核心 — 数据模型 + resolve_price() (#2)\n\n* feat(pricing): M1 定价五要素核心 — 数据模型 + resolve_price\n\n定价五要素解耦的核心落地（docs/data-model.md §5）：\n\n- rise-entity 共享 crate：groups/models/prices/discounts 实体（跨域共用，避免域间循环依赖）\n- 迁移：models（能力目录，display_name i18n JSONB）、prices（模型×分组显式单价 + 热路径索引）、discounts（独立折扣）\n- pricing::resolve：select_price / apply_discounts 纯函数（无 DB，8 个单测覆盖\n  分组专属价优先、版本、有效期、percentage 叠加/不可叠加优先级、fixed 仅登记、scope 过滤）\n- resolve_price DB 编排 + GET /api/pricing/preview 价格预览（与计费热路径复用同一解析）\n\n端到端验证：VIP 取专属价 15/45 × 0.9 折扣 = 13.5/40.5；无分组回落默认价 20/60 无折扣。\n改任一要素不联动其余四要素。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n- resolve_price: 价格/折扣过滤下推到 SQL（命中 idx_prices_lookup，避免热路径全表扫描+内存过滤）\n- 折扣系数全程 Decimal 计算，仅 API 边界转 f64（避免浮点累积误差，财务对账安全）\n- scale_numeric 改 Decimal + round_dp(6)\n- 指定 group_slug 但查无此分组 → 返回 NotFound，不静默回落默认价\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\nscale_numeric 由 JSON 数字字符串直接解析为 Decimal、结果再经字符串转回\nserde_json::Number，全程不经 f64 中间转换，保证财务精度绝对无损。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n- scale_numeric round_dp(6)→(12)：避免极低单价被截断为 0（变免费的计费漏洞）\n- discounts.value decimal(10,4)→(16,4)：大额 fixed 企业减免不溢出\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f1e7ead489c656d955f4abcfdd94097945ebe9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/0f1e7ead489c656d955f4abcfdd94097945ebe9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/b3308ef12eb91682a60f2c15d53ea086a42db87e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f1e7ead489c656d955f4abcfdd94097945ebe9f\nparent bc8ba7aed0606368f618e518737bc0c9b6a0432b\nauthor Tony Wang <wangtao405@gmail.com> 1781330584 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781330584 +0800\n\nfeat(pricing): M1 定价五要素核心 — 数据模型 + resolve_price() (#2)\n\n* feat(pricing): M1 定价五要素核心 — 数据模型 + resolve_price\n\n定价五要素解耦的核心落地（docs/data-model.md §5）：\n\n- rise-entity 共享 crate：groups/models/prices/discounts 实体（跨域共用，避免域间循环依赖）\n- 迁移：models（能力目录，display_name i18n JSONB）、prices（模型×分组显式单价 + 热路径索引）、discounts（独立折扣）\n- pricing::resolve：select_price / apply_discounts 纯函数（无 DB，8 个单测覆盖\n  分组专属价优先、版本、有效期、percentage 叠加/不可叠加优先级、fixed 仅登记、scope 过滤）\n- resolve_price DB 编排 + GET /api/pricing/preview 价格预览（与计费热路径复用同一解析）\n\n端到端验证：VIP 取专属价 15/45 × 0.9 折扣 = 13.5/40.5；无分组回落默认价 20/60 无折扣。\n改任一要素不联动其余四要素。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 1 轮反馈\n\n- resolve_price: 价格/折扣过滤下推到 SQL（命中 idx_prices_lookup，避免热路径全表扫描+内存过滤）\n- 折扣系数全程 Decimal 计算，仅 API 边界转 f64（避免浮点累积误差，财务对账安全）\n- scale_numeric 改 Decimal + round_dp(6)\n- 指定 group_slug 但查无此分组 → 返回 NotFound，不静默回落默认价\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 2 轮反馈\n\nscale_numeric 由 JSON 数字字符串直接解析为 Decimal、结果再经字符串转回\nserde_json::Number，全程不经 f64 中间转换，保证财务精度绝对无损。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(pricing): 处理 Gemini review 第 3 轮反馈\n\n- scale_numeric round_dp(6)→(12)：避免极低单价被截断为 0（变免费的计费漏洞）\n- discounts.value decimal(10,4)→(16,4)：大额 fixed 企业减免不溢出\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLPKYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAe84QAH6XxePPmPZkk2oSe0kmoB+f\nQ9KhfsjJXgAuJkeYzami2O2unxn64lyGuytXUEkCl+IihuUhVYnO1IC+3OB/pOkE\nKIaS1Zt0Y9PouZ+62i86eRwPP+xqKRLBrBsZ87lmhCQ5MMpHKp7TXKWO