_i18n 字段；API 错误 code+参数（后端不绑定语言）；\n  LocaleLayer 协商；可插拔译文随 App Manifest\n- architecture.md: §4.1 设计系统与主题、§6.1 国际化横切、中间件链加 Locale 协商\n- data-model.md: §10.6 i18n 数据约定（locale/timezone 列、_i18n、notification_templates）\n- README/CLAUDE.md: 索引与指引补 i18n 与主题入口\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25009da316831504ff242df55b75d806a37b1725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/trees/25009da316831504ff242df55b75d806a37b1725"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/rise-router/git/commits/537b3e70f607be938e017ba8747126928e5a5350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19380605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/klj890","id":19380605,"login":"klj890","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzgwNjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/klj890","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/537b3e70f607be938e017ba8747126928e5a5350","node_id":"C_kwDOS5OTyNoAKDUzN2IzZTcwZjYwN2JlOTM4ZTAxN2JhODc0NzEyNjkyOGU1YTUzNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/klj890/rise-router/commit/f739b941acc31c1d012001dcfc6747697f9067a3","sha":"f739b941acc31c1d012001dcfc6747697f9067a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/klj890/ri