ative 0.86, and all expo-* packages to SDK 57-compatible\nversions. Migrate splash config to expo-splash-screen plugin and update\nTypeScript 6 settings for the Luma app.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Add the ride-matching lab with a Redis lock so a driver can hold only one ride.\n\nThe dashboard races two requests against the same drivers and lets you drag and inspect each Step Functions state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update the lockfile so Blog CI can install before reporting coverage.\n\nThe coverage summary was missing because frozen install failed on the new UI dependencies, and the report step still ran.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Add a booking map and complete-ride so matched drivers can be released.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b69e42a9e62f8313bf01c7dc96d368c83372e7f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/trees/b69e42a9e62f8313bf01c7dc96d368c83372e7f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/commits/bcfba1f396ffdddb2ed881ce4039070e4253d31d","verification":{"payload":"tree b69e42a9e62f8313bf01c7dc96d368c83372e7f1\nparent db7a6d37921b275cc0c4d78942a7c9002e9d2087\nauthor HungHcc <38785848+buisihung11@users.noreply.github.com> 1790149538 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790149538 +0700\n\nAdd ride-matching lab with booking map and complete-ride (#47)\n\n* feat(luma): add Expo event app with themed create flow and API integration\n\nIntroduce the Luma mobile MVP (feed, create, detail) with NativeWind styling,\nglass UI, gallery cover picker with dominant-color themes, and mock data via\n@everythingme/api. Also fix Metro import resolution in the API foundation lib.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* chore(luma): upgrade to Expo SDK 57\n\nBump Expo, React Native 0.86, and all expo-* packages t