() pre-wired with telemetry, logging, and\n  errorNormalization; ports publish api:event onto __MFE_EVENT_BUS__\n  so pipeline activity is visible to any remote\n- transport.ts — fetchTransport + createMockTransport with latency,\n  flakiness, and hang modes for offline retry/timeout demos\n- dashboard.ts — fetchDashboardStats action with retry(3)/timeout(2s)\n\nmfe_dashboard/Dashboard.tsx:\n- Replace hardcoded stats with fetchDashboardStats() call on mount;\n  loading state and error message while fetching; event-bus wiring intact\n\nmfe-shell:\n- pages/ApiPipelinePage.tsx — pipeline visualiser with four scenario\n  buttons (success, validation fail, retry-succeed, timeout); live\n  middleware timeline and cross-remote Event Bus column\n- app.tsx — /api-pipeline route added\n- components/Sidebar.tsx — \"API Pipeline\" nav entry added\n\nmfe-shared/event-schemas.ts:\n- Added api:event schema (kind, label, feature, action, durationMs, error)\n\nmfe-admin/lessons/api-middleware-pipeline.md — lesson note covering\nkey design decisions and what to do differently next time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* feat(studying): switch MFE API transport to axios\n\nReplace fetch-based transport with a shared axios client and fixture\nadapter for offline demos. Type dashboard stats via output schema and\nregister api:event on the event bus monitor page.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"5332167982cd9e1bb5c0718a0efa7749fafb9a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/trees/5332167982cd9e1bb5c0718a0efa7749fafb9a5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/commits/1d527a7e3189b87b29d0af9f035339a083432c7b","verification":{"payload":"tree 5332167982cd9e1bb5c0718a0efa7749fafb9a5a\nparent 96781b9df8e2e97ee23a653c0ad5a1731efc8517\nauthor HungHcc <38785848+buisihung11@users.noreply.github.com> 1785493021 +0700\ncommitte