metry({ tracer }) — ApiTracer port; span ended in finally\n- logging({ logger? }) — ApiLogger port (default: console); logs\n  start, success with duration, and error\n- retry({ attempts, delayMs, backoff, retryOn }) — exponential backoff;\n  retryOn defaults to skipping ApiValidationError\n- timeout({ ms }) — races next() vs timer; throws ApiTimeoutError;\n  injects AbortSignal into ctx.signal so handlers can cancel fetches\n- errorNormalization() — wraps non-ApiError throws into tagged ApiError\n\nclient.ts: input()/output() now wired as sugar for\nuse(validate(schema)) / use(validateOutput(schema)).\nindex.ts: re-exports all middleware.\nREADME.md: contracts, composition order, ports reference.\n\nTests: 22 new tests (35 total, all passing).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"383f4cb8fbb166e4238b1ab981c8dcd31c0a07a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/trees/383f4cb8fbb166e4238b1ab981c8dcd31c0a07a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/commits/96781b9df8e2e97ee23a653c0ad5a1731efc8517","verification":{"payload":"tree 383f4cb8fbb166e4238b1ab981c8dcd31c0a07a4\nparent 5c29e09cdeff23487bf91b1aaadaee9bf344ae0a\nauthor HungHcc <38785848+buisihung11@users.noreply.github.com> 1785487032 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785487032 +0700\n\nfeat(api): add six built-in middleware to @everythingme/api (#33)\n\nsrc/middleware/: validate, validateOutput, telemetry, logging,\nretry, timeout, errorNormalization — all via createMiddleware,\nall dependency-free with pluggable ports.\n\n- validate(schema) — Standard Schema; throws ApiValidationError;\n  forwards parsed value through next({ input }) (coercions/transforms)\n- validateOutput(schema) — same but for downstream output\n- telemetry({ tracer }) — ApiTracer port; span ended in finally\n- logging({ logger? }) — ApiLogger port (default: console); logs\n  start, success with duration, and error\n- retry({ attempts, delayMs, backoff, retryOn }) — exponential backoff;\n  retryOn defaults to skipping ApiValidationError\n- timeout({ ms }) — races next() vs timer; throws ApiTimeoutError;\n  injects AbortSignal into ctx.signal so handlers can cancel fetches\n- errorNormalization() — wraps non-ApiError throws into tagged ApiError\n\nclient.ts: input()/output() now wired as sugar for\nuse(validate(schema)) / use(validateOutput(schema)).\nindex.ts: re-exports all middleware.\nREADME.md: contracts, composition order, ports reference.\n\nTests: 22 new tests (35 total, all passing).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbF64CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATVsQAFvUOq3Nzq+JSYGOheGTCPIH\nYvg4rm72JGg+i5UHrQj9y/lhP7blapE6SPP9r8TuSo1UNTiTJeAj46p5LbipznRd\nx32PtJ+IczIY3QG/Sg2KbLQHCrbXFGtDNT1EXYP7tMw3rAlkwaoIiU0o4X35DyCR\n9kWLiH6xsLIWz3/niXQdmOg4qm0cqZuLfIKy/yJJi2rQAE7ktNrAkJ0/GkKhayRq\nDvAbHh8YquHSFBD2MSlZ5Dv29bQtJmw9SnvYm9lryBhAlAgBA8qzv94zT0GMtRmr\nYVQEF1Dz37iTAEIb9rpKXx4rEuiD2DgKiB+B4zXNpPfuyyTPCYFiojvLiq6dXYpU\nEtzmAK383PIaNB7KrJlRJbEriuLXLEG7r+bc4dpePIU/lWpl79cr+Oi3dEGjtcAV\n35MJBy8C0jfBAyjImgZrkuIbflK0Fkr/OlgxpDLxcz4+ChJpOGQj8mpThnq4VtAO\nwlprXIzO5EHO27HjNQgNnxy/HurjhZvuSExbj7kVAvrqbyqHKhu2Q8Zd90i+wOm8\nExW04+Mnh/tmgGB7dLUAc5zo241Jno7AsqhV5iHiry90DINAWBPy3oL/Owsk2khu\nio+k9NXy1XazF80xeyiUkX17nwE7wcrtKTjlGkbJzGdf3igXflsjjaXUYujXClNf\nIIyXxDgPx3EA4WCa5aNw\n=RwiF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T08:37:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","