://api.github.com/users/buisihung11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/commits/5c29e09cdeff23487bf91b1aaadaee9bf344ae0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:32:56Z","email":"38785848+buisihung11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"HungHcc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:32:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): add @everythingme/api core — immutable action builder (#32)\n\nScaffolds libs/foundation/api following source-only lib conventions\n(zero runtime deps; main/types -> ./src/index.ts).\n\nPublic surface:\n- StandardSchemaV1 — inline interface, 15 lines, no import needed\n- ApiError / ApiValidationError / ApiTimeoutError / normalizeError\n- ApiMiddlewareRequest with next(options?:{ ctx?, input? }) — the\n  deliberate extension that lets validate middleware forward parsed values\n- createMiddleware() — identity helper for full type inference\n- composePipeline() — folds middleware right-to-left once at handler()\n  time; no per-call rebuilding\n- ApiActionClient — immutable builder: metadata(), input() (stores\n  schema for PR3 wiring), output(), use(), handler()\n- createApiClient<TContext>() — entry point\n\nTests (13 passing via pnpm nx test foundation-api):\n- builder immutability: use/metadata/chain leave original unchanged\n- middleware execution order: left-to-right, ASP.NET unwind\n- next({ ctx }) merge semantics and upstream isolation\n- next({ input }) forwarding and pass-through\n- composePipeline with zero middleware and metadata propagation\n\nRegisters \"@everythingme/api\" in tsconfig.base.json paths and\nadds workspace:* dep to root package.json.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"58f6fdb8ec2b3fee325c26aca17459a8390a2fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/trees/58f6fdb8ec2b3fee325c26aca17459a8390a2fe5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/ever