generators/plugins),\npackage.json (Angular, Vue, webpack, MFE deps), pnpm-workspace.yaml\n(typescript ~5.9.0), tsconfig.base.json (remote entry path aliases),\nand regenerates pnpm-lock.yaml from the updated root package.json.\n\nPreviously written work, never committed — reviewers should focus on\nnx.json wiring and tsconfig.base.json path aliases, not line-reading\nthe Angular/Vue remotes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(studying): isolate tailwindcss v3 from blog''s v4 dependency\n\nRoot-level tailwindcss v3 broke blog CI when resolving @everythingme/ui\nglobals.css. Move postcss tooling to apps/studying/package.json so MFE apps\nkeep tailwind v3 without conflicting with the blog''s tailwind v4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc33bab875787791492cd3e0654c0190eff34012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/trees/cc33bab875787791492cd3e0654c0190eff34012"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buisihung11/everythingme/git/commits/d9a47a4f51612ba14d58bf229eedf18fb5997140","verification":{"payload":"tree cc33bab875787791492cd3e0654c0190eff34012\nparent e790675c76553ce628107a48f6e5b82e98b39b35\nauthor HungHcc <38785848+buisihung11@users.noreply.github.com> 1785479053 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785479053 +0700\n\nfeat(studying): restore micro-frontend app from stash (#31)\n\n* feat(studying): restore micro-frontend app from stash\n\nSelective restore of the MFE study app that was never committed:\n- mfe-shell (React host, webpack module federation)\n- mfe_dashboard, mfe_analytics, mfe_products (React remotes)\n- mfe_users (Angular remote)\n- mfe-products-vue (Vue remote)\n- mfe-admin (admin + lesson tracker)\n- mfe-shared (event bus, auth store, shared types)\n\nAlso applies root wiring: nx.json (MFE targets/generators/plugins),\npackage.json (Angular, Vue, webpack, MFE deps), pnpm-workspace.yaml\n(typescript ~5.9.0), tsconfig.base.json (remote entry path aliases),\nand regenerates pnpm-lock.yaml from the updated root package.json.\n\nPreviously written work, never committed — reviewers should focus on\nnx.json wiring and tsconfig.base.json path aliases, not line-reading\nthe Angular/Vue remotes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(studying): isolate tailwindcss v3 from blog''s v4 dependency\n\nRoot-level tailwindcss v3 broke blog CI when resolving @everythingme/ui\nglobals.css. Move postcss tooling to apps/studying/package.json so MFE apps\nkeep tailwind v3 without conflicting with the blog''s tailwind v4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbD+NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0Y8QAFRJqrP3aXaGhXMGiYOY7x1V\n84lXcTAfcLv4zDWleB4Fv0wXQOm1FO9OpfFJP0hqJl3421qY7iuS/4FTA6ZvpEgP\nOuuamNlys88CN3zxzi5vhW4Mxe8tzuFhEcmBGB39Zg1No7ZEq340omiPnouKdEYb\ngLP4xkOhOx07vPdmGVSnbkUQZjrFyOxLmblgZ5t//szvQ/szaZEj++auVSh8erQi\neFumYbCt2VpQcCqkojCP+Ek7WxqApk5JKay61WBRYNvzinrC/VZKKlEQRPJ6ozA2\nWlKYwYVwK9txQLidi7erAvkGs2h44NLu77A2xPsOXTUrHrQPXAAk0guLVl+8DEmH\nNvGFnhyu7kHTUXfQ6GKCY6mkVrwxr2Lf3LdbdY3gUx/DTRIg3gdW0i5bL3KOJcoL\nTMfPhfEZoRaGGgtIV8q/tkjG+x1dZ95s0JZJUJag5iGLxwV9mEZcLB30k551niUr\nHlcSlA2LuPefLhoC5PH7OqCTCKvFDQrcGU9ybnXiWmRd/pJZXnub9BVCaJoEzBAk\noPpl/SoTuf8zdXt8T5qJkciLPCozLwXrb7YomZhBTMQXfwCIzbIL33bfrckSn7lf\n+SXFQ43usxKZZa5cSEB6T9WLXzE4D7YzcPnOo52NmUxfFKIJxY1QaewTiBslROXA\nv7I9z/KtS7hwzkJ/ehmJ\n=7pK8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T06:24:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users