point, defaults, system prompt appendix\n- org.jahia.se.modules.mcpchat.cfg: template config file with all properties documented\n- ConfigServlet: GET /modules/jahia-mcp-chat/config returns safe fields only\n  (available providers, defaults — never API keys)\n- LlmProxyServlet: API keys now read from McpChatConfigService, never from browser headers\n- Settings panel: reduced to personal MCP token + provider/model preference (only lists\n  providers with keys in OSGi cfg) + max tokens override + skills\n- System prompt appendix from OSGi cfg appended as \"Client-specific instructions\" section\n- useConfig.js: new hook fetches OSGi config on mount\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"61f0e046d548ad2b34c9219ab3f6dd6300362fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/jahia-mcp-chat/git/trees/61f0e046d548ad2b34c9219ab3f6dd6300362fe5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/jahia-mcp-chat/git/commits/3b0a7b61723c416f7c529b85be9f40e2e2a17475","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s