v@vinsmartfuture.tech","name":"Nguyễn Văn Rum (VSF-QTVHNTDVX-PMGTCC)"},"message":"feat: Vite Internals Handbook — from-the-source book pinned to v8.0.16\n\nNine-chapter from-the-source study guide on Vite internals (vitejs/vite\n@ v8.0.16, f94df87), with the RumitX build pipeline and branding.\n\n- 00 Environment & ESM / native-module refresher (the bare-specifier problem)\n- 01 Mental model & repo map (dev-vs-build duality; one-request trace)\n- 02 Config resolution & the plugin container (pre/normal/post; fold vs short-circuit)\n- 03 ★ The dev server, module graph & transform pipeline (transformRequest,\n     EnvironmentModuleGraph, import-analysis, the cache & invalidation)\n- 04 HMR: propagateUpdate boundary search & import.meta.hot\n- 05 Dependency pre-bundling (esbuild scan, Rolldown bundle, the dep hash)\n- 06 The production build (Rolldown): index.html entry, chunks, manifest\n- 07 SSR, the module runner & the Environment API\n- 08 Capstone: a virtual-module plugin, reading a PR, re-pinning\n\nIncludes labs (vite-hello runnable artifact + note templates), a glossary\nwith a verified file:line Key-files index, and the built site (11 pages +\nsingle-file handbook.html).","tree":{"sha":"880bfbf424d5e11c7a4a70b2e5b8a63bdf0ee21d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rumitvn/vite-book/git/trees/880bfbf424d5e11c7a4a70b2e5b8a63bdf0ee21d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rumitvn/vite-book/git/commits/fece299fab0ea105f3cb9ad8e873c918142f6caf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260047152?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-rumnv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-rumnv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-rumnv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v-rumnv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/v-rumnv","id":260