se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/67caabfc3e050b62b5d4f400eddd199b1b062953/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align Agents setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards (#788)\n\n* Fix Agents API flows and Tilt development wiring\n\nAllow gpt-6-luna tool requests by explicitly disabling reasoning, recover\nprogress and cancellation controls after disconnected chat streams, and\nrevalidate triggers when their referenced connections change.\n\nCorrect latency percentiles and clarify that spend estimates omit unpriced\nusage. Watch the remaining Agents Go sources in Tilt and resolve\nhost.docker.internal for external provider pods on Linux.\n\nValidated with 580 portal tests, focused Go suites, UI conformance checks,\nand live Tilt chat, history, tool, approval, webhook, and schedule smoke tests.\nRoot formatting/lint and changed-code provider lint pass; full provider lint\nstill reports five pre-existing findings.\n\n* fix(agents): align setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards\n\n* fix(agents): expire abandoned model verification credentials\n\n* fix(agents): harden diagnostic redaction and approval refresh","tree":{"sha":"c91811b854472e857fff293e35775b5f095b4913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/c91811b854472e857fff293e35775b5f095b4913"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/67caabfc3e050b62b5d4f400eddd199b1b062953","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"veri