.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/13cf53a426cb346d2e96e15339a34a8754b11f2f","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDEzY2Y1M2E0MjZjYjM0NmQyZTk2ZTE1MzM5YTM0YTg3NTRiMTFmMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/ebd35509753ca754eeebeed016e03e0887d61dde","sha":"ebd35509753ca754eeebeed016e03e0887d61dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/ebd35509753ca754eeebeed016e03e0887d61dde"}],"sha":"13cf53a426cb346d2e96e15339a34a8754b11f2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/13cf53a426cb346d2e96e15339a34a8754b11f2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/ebd35509753ca754eeebeed016e03e0887d61dde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:11:41Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T11:11:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove deprecated CLI commands and always write endpoint slice export paths (#751)\n\n* Remove deprecated CLI spellings\n\nThe rename dropped the need for backwards compatibility, so remove the\nhidden pre-1.0 commands and fallbacks:\n- `railgrid get` and `railgrid apply` (use kubectl or `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid kubeconfig edge` (use `railgrid edge kubeconfig`)\n- the hidden `railgrid list`/`ls` shorthand (use `railgrid edge list`)\n- `railgrid dev create --agent-count` (use `--worker-count`)\n- login treating a non-JSON /healthz as an old server with OIDC; it is\n  now an error\n- the unused SaveAgentConfig wrapper\n\nUpdate docs, skills, the edges portal, hub hints and e2e tests to the\ncurrent spellings.\n\n* Always write the export path on APIExportEndpointSlices\n\nA path-less slice is indexed only under its logical-cluster name, so a\nshard''s endpoint-URL publisher, which looks slices up by the binding''s\ncanonical export path, misses it and never publishes its virtual\nworkspace URL for the first binding on another shard. Resolve the\nworkspace path from the LogicalCluster when none is configured and\nalways write it; path-less slices from older SDKs are recreated once.\n\n* Use the install script in the portal CLI quickstart\n\n* Drop removed CLI spellings from the e2e suites\n\nThe CLI suite still expected the hidden ''railgrid ls'' and the edges\nconnectivity suite still called ''railgrid kubeconfig edge''.","tree":{"sha":"acc5e39498c69a96a150bc9f8031db1cf4685e4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/acc5e39498c69a96a150bc9f8031db1cf4685e4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/ebd35509753ca754eeebeed016e03e0887d61dde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events