orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/aa38f04910161f69e30118c9af6c946625439ea3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:23:09Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:23:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0 (#750)\n\n* Bump kcp to v0.33.0 and kcp-operator to v0.10.0\n\nMove every Go module to kcp v0.33.0 (sdk, client-go, cli,\nvirtual-workspace-framework, apimachinery/v2 v2.33.0) and drop the\nmjudeikis/kcp fork replaces; the fork carried kcp#4280, which ships in\nv0.33.0.\n\nAdapt the infrastructure provider to two v0.33 API breaks:\n- CachedResource is renamed to ClusterCachedResource (kcp#4281)\n- APIExport storage.virtual.identityHash is removed (kcp#4326)\n\nPoint local setups at the releases: Tiltfile.cluster defaults to the\nv0.33.0 image, `railgrid dev create kcp` uses chart 0.16.6 with the\nv0.33.0 image, the Makefile kcp binary and apigen move to v0.33.0, the\nexternal install defaults to kcp-operator v0.10.0, and tilt-e2e checks\nout kcp v0.33.0.\n\n* Align kcp apimachinery replaces on v2.33.0 across modules\n\nprovider-sdk, app-studio and code still replaced apimachinery/v2 with\nv2.32.0, which conflicts with the root module in the CI go.work.","tree":{"sha":"c27690a368f02eca032b40d7000fe2da092c6e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/c27690a368f02eca032b40d7000fe2da092c6e77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgri