i.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1b4889b69942155943bf28391c604dd5775ed748/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:59:43Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:59:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rename to railgrid (#744)\n\n* Rename to railgrid\n\n* Fix docs rendering\n\n* Fix ci issue\n\n* Rename faros paths inside base64-encoded Vite shims\n\nThe application and simple-webapp templates embed their Vite config shim\nas base64 in the dev start command, so the text rename missed the\nfile:///faros/bin/preview-bridge-plugin.mjs import inside it.\n\n* Point templates at renamed scaffold repos v0.1.4\n\nThe scaffold repos moved from railgrid/faros-scaffold-* to\nrailgrid/scaffold-*. v0.1.4 carries the faros -> railgrid rename, including\nthe .railgrid-vite.config.mjs gitignore entry, and publishes images under\nghcr.io/railgrid/scaffold-*.\n\n* Import kuery from github.com/railgrid/kuery\n\nrailgrid/kuery#8 renamed the kuery module path, so drop the last faroshq\nreferences and pin the kuery provider to the merge commit.","tree":{"sha":"caa680dc49a0db573d7d5277664a92a3add42f35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/caa680dc49a0db573d7d5277664a92a3add42f35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/1b4889b69942155943bf28391c604dd5775ed748","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.git