,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/67136eb109155f51b56ef210d4fa959f2ac53400","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDY3MTM2ZWIxMDkxNTVmNTFiNTZlZjIxMGQ0ZmE5NTlmMmFjNTM0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260","sha":"10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260"}],"sha":"67136eb109155f51b56ef210d4fa959f2ac53400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/67136eb109155f51b56ef210d4fa959f2ac53400"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:02:21Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:02:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[AUTOMATED BOT PR] fix: field-test batch 1 (web_fetch redirects, on_request approvals, app publish/status, skill) (#726)\n\n* fix(agents): report redirects and private faros apps in web_fetch\n\nweb_fetch printed the requested URL with the final status, so a private\nfaros app that redirected to the portal sign-in page came back as\n\"HTTP 200 <app url>\" with the sign-in page as its content, and agents\nreported the app as working.\n\nIt now reports the final URL (and the URL it was redirected from), and\nstops at a redirect to /auth/apps/authorize, returning a message that the\napp is private and web_fetch cannot sign in.\n\n* fix(app-studio): require approval for promote and provision under on_request\n\npromote_project deploys to production but ran without a pause under the\ndefault on_request approval mode; only its tool description asked the\nmodel to confirm first.\n\ninfrastructure__provision was meant to pause but never did: the check\ncompared projectToolBaseName(name), which strips the provider prefix\n(\"provision\"), against the full prefixed name. It is now matched by full\nname.\n\nprepare_project_deployment is dropped from the list: it is a read-risk\ntool and only runtime-risk tools reach this check.\n\n* fix(cli): stop app publish and app status reading as failures after a change\n\n`faros app publish` printed the POST response, which is written before\nthe production instance reports the new access mode, so a working app\nshowed \"(not ready: Pending)\". It now re-reads the publishing state for\nup to 15s. A ready public publication also notes that anonymous requests\nmay still hit sign-in for about 20s.\n\n`faros app status` printed \"-  -\" for production right after a promote,\nwhile the binding status trails the instance. It now says the instance\nhas not reported yet.\n\n* skills(faros): fold in field-test round 5 and this branch''s fixes\n\nFindings from three apps built cold from the skill (a simple-webapp, an\napplication with a binary asset and an assistant turn, and an application\nwith a cron-job and a scheduled hosted agent):\n\n- Template table gains sandbox component names and where static assets\n  go; `application` has no `connections` input.\n- Machine callers: jobs and hosted agents can''t pass a private or\n  restricted app''s gate; same-workspace workloads call the app''s Service\n  directly. `restricted` and `private` are enforced the same way.\n- \"Your own secrets\": no template takes a Secret reference, and patterns\n  that work instead.\n- cron-job runs can''t be observed; how to drive a public image via env.\n- Assistant: turn status hides failed steps; the approval-mode table.\n- Smoke test on a random Postgres port, no `pkill -f`, the push guard on\n  the working clone, and `git pull --rebase` when App Studio committed.\n\nUpdated for the fixes on this branch: web_fetch now stops at a private\napp''s sign-in redirect; promote_project and infrastructure__provision\nask under on_request; `faros app publish` waits for the publication and\n`faros app status` explains an unreported production.\n\n* skills(faros): read an assistant turn''s outcome from its failure summary\n\nThe turn object now carries failedItems, recoveredItems, rejectedItems\nand failures, so the skill reads those instead of scanning every\nitem.completed event.","tree":{"sha":"88e3664859b1dea40789555b44d0aa37f62a4249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/88e3664859b1dea40789555b44d0aa37f62a4249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDEwMTg2ZmM3YTg0YWY4ZDI2NzUzNzkyNjlhNmVjMjNmOTFmMGIyNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1","sha":"1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1"}],"sha":"10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/10186fc7a84af8d2675379269a6ec23f91f0b260"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:33:36Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:33:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[AUTOMATED BOT PR] feat(app-studio): report failed steps on the assistant turn (#727)\n\n* feat(app-studio): report failed steps on the assistant turn\n\nA turn whose tool steps failed still ends `completed`, and the only way\nto find out was to scan every item.completed event. Field-test agents\nreported half-done work as done because of it.\n\nThe turn object in turn.completed / turn.failed / turn.interrupted\npayloads and in GET .../turns/{turn} now carries:\n\n- failedItems: tool items that ended failed\n- recoveredItems: failures a linked recoveryOf retry repaired (not failed)\n- rejectedItems: steps whose approval was denied (their items read\n  failed, but the user said no; not counted as failed)\n- failures: up to five {itemID, title, category, message, referenceID}\n  from the items'' diagnostics\n\nThe summary is derived from the turn''s durable items, so it needs no\nschema change and the detail route reports it for older turns too. All\nfields are omitted when zero; status keeps its meaning.\n\n* test(portal): match ProviderFrame''s hash-navigation watch after #720\n\n#720 made the watch callback call routeFocus.before() before\npushContext(), so the conformance regex that expected the one-liner\n`() => pushContext()` stopped matching and Root portal has failed on\nmain since. The assertion now accepts a callback block that ends in\npushContext(); it still fails if the watch stops publishing context.","tree":{"sha":"1a8e009e27dad2c04060a20b75e93ceac15d9596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/1a8e009e27dad2c04060a20b75e93ceac15d9596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDFmNzU4NDk2MjA2Y2E0MGRhYjFjNDMzYTkzZTFkYTA4YmI5MjY3ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5","sha":"105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5"}],"sha":"1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1f758496206ca40dab1c433a93e1da08bb9267f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:41Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[AUTOMATED BOT PR] Provider hub access as a declared, consented contract; fix workspace-admin to org-admin escalation (#709)\n\n* hub: make provider hub access part of the provider contract; fix org-admin escalation\n\nEscalation fix (pre-existing):\n- On org-scope routes the tenant middleware used the caller''s WORKSPACE role\n  whenever X-Faros-Workspace was sent, so a workspace admin (every workspace\n  creator) passed org-admin checks; adding an existing member also overwrote\n  their role. Together: any workspace admin could make themselves org admin.\n  TenantContext now carries OrgRole, requireTenantContext authorizes org\n  routes on it, and adding an existing member never changes their role\n  (roles change only through PATCH). Unit and two-user e2e regression tests.\n\nProvider hub access:\n- CatalogEntry spec.hubAccess: a provider requests capabilities from a closed,\n  hub-owned set (memberships.read org|workspace, memberships.invite org with\n  maxRole member and allowInvite). Declaring grants nothing.\n- Consent at Enable (acceptedHubAccess): org-scoped capabilities need an org\n  admin, workspace-scoped a workspace or org admin. Decisions are recorded per\n  capability (accepted / declined) in a generic Grant (tenants.faros.sh,\n  subject kind Provider) in root:faros:system:tenants; capabilities the\n  enabler may not decide keep their earlier decision or stay undecided.\n  Disable deletes the grant.\n- pkg/hub/hubaccess gate in front of the tenant routes replaces the hard-coded\n  delegated membership resolver: a delegated call is admitted only for a\n  route that maps to a capability the provider declares and the workspace\n  granted; the person''s own role still applies; handlers cap the role at\n  member and honour allowInvite; invites are rate-limited and audited.\n- Undecided capabilities fall back to --provider-hub-access-platform-default\n  (default true) for platform providers only; org-owned providers always need\n  an acceptance. Chart value hub.security.providerHubAccessPlatformDefault.\n- Delegated token proof v2 covers the provider''s owner org, so an org-owned\n  provider never uses a platform provider''s grant; v1 platform accounts are\n  re-signed in place.\n- Portal: Enable dialog lists requested capabilities with reasons; enabled\n  listing reports granted/pending; Providers page offers Review access.\n- App Studio declares the hub access it uses (manifest and chart).\n- Docs: providers.md \"Hub access\", byo-providers.md, provider-scoping.md,\n  helm.md, skill references.\n\n* Add roadmap\n\n* bump roadmap and gowork","tree":{"sha":"6a927e4e7f9b901020390ca9edf99f788b9d051b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/6a927e4e7f9b901020390ca9edf99f788b9d051b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDEwNWIxNGE4NzdjNGI0MGJhNTY4NTMzZjVjYTY0M2U0MWUxMWQwZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353","sha":"1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353"}],"sha":"105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/105b14a877c4b40ba568533f5ca643e41e11d0e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5685031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cwilhit","id":5685031,"login":"cwilhit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODUwMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:25:39Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:25:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(portal): scope resource URLs to organizations and workspaces (#703)\n\n* feat(portal): scope resource URLs to organizations and workspaces\n\n* fix(portal): reset account caches and recover failed navigation\n\n* test(kuery): expect scoped impact navigation links","tree":{"sha":"793a0279cc09c0fcb44e7149454ebdd6058224dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/793a0279cc09c0fcb44e7149454ebdd6058224dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDFjODEwNDdkN2ExMDNjN2RiZmNmZDEzNGFlMDk3MzkwNzZhMTkzNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4","sha":"84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4"}],"sha":"1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/1c81047d7a103c7dbfcfd134ae09739076a19353"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"cli: regroup the command tree, add connect/org/workspace members/whoami; tenant cluster-ID headers and provider fixes (#704)\n\nCLI (pkg/cli, test/e2e/suites/cli, docs/cli):\n- Group `faros --help` by intent; make --insecure-skip-tls-verify global;\n  hide legacy spellings (list/ls, kubeconfig edge, get, apply, get-token)\n  and move kcp workspace navigation to hidden `kcp-workspace`.\n- New: whoami, logout, token [--refresh], connect/disconnect (merged\n  faros-<edge> context), edge kubeconfig [-o|--merge], org list|create,\n  workspace list|create, and members list|add|remove|set-role at org and\n  workspace scope over the existing hub REST API.\n- Shared -o wide|json|yaml|name output, --yes confirmations, shell\n  completion for edge names, roles and formats.\n- Fix edge type detection (spec.type no longer exists), hub commands\n  following an edge context after connect, un-externalized proxy URLs,\n  and the error when the edges provider is not enabled.\n- Generated CLI reference (faros docs, make docs-cli, verify-docs-cli in\n  make verify); e2e suite test/e2e/suites/cli (make e2e-cli + CI job) with\n  a two-user hub, the edges provider, an in-process sshd and kind.\n- Refresh-token flow covered by tests against a fake OIDC issuer.\n- Fix install.sh archive names and next steps; dex examples now register\n  faros as a PKCE public client (public: true).\n\nHub and providers:\n- The hub proxy and MCP federation send the kcp cluster ID in\n  X-Faros-Tenant / X-Faros-Cluster and never the workspace path;\n  providers resolve org/workspace via provider-sdk/tenantaccess.\n  BREAKING for providers that parse a path from X-Faros-Tenant: roll\n  providers out before the hub.\n- Delegated provider tokens may read org/workspace rosters and invite to\n  an org (App Studio grants).\n- provider-sdk/apiexportprovider: apiexport multicluster provider that\n  retries failed endpoint watches, with a readiness check; adopted by the\n  hub and providers.\n- Edges: Workload spec.targetNamespace and simple.imagePullSecrets,\n  pod-template metadata preserved, cross-namespace pruning, agent\n  hostname reporting, stdin for ssh exec, backoff for service probes.\n- Kuery: key engaged clusters by cluster ID with an orphan sweep;\n  kuery_query MCP tool takes spec as an object.\n- Agents, App Studio, code: status stamping, GET-by-name routes,\n  publishing mode reporting, invite and preview fixes, build.yaml default.","tree":{"sha":"85da45f9d7daf9a0f211946d4fe12c00875f1d5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/85da45f9d7daf9a0f211946d4fe12c00875f1d5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKDg0ZDBkMGYyNWYyYzFmZmMxN2NkNGJkMTRjMzNmMDY2YjJmNjE5YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/9032c573b42db31309b6d605fb0f9f1819906856","sha":"9032c573b42db31309b6d605fb0f9f1819906856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/9032c573b42db31309b6d605fb0f9f1819906856"}],"sha":"84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/84d0d0f25f2c1ffc17cd4bd14c33f066b2f619c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/9032c573b42db31309b6d605fb0f9f1819906856/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:09:24Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T12:09:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"remove graphql (#694)","tree":{"sha":"b3cf1abd01f119cf2235c8f3653e6d0e3039ac93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/b3cf1abd01f119cf2235c8f3653e6d0e3039ac93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/9032c573b42db31309b6d605fb0f9f1819906856","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_