com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commits/ea95f434f27202f84b8ef2f0c579348e5697d2c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:07:15Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T17:07:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Drive App Studio from a terminal, add app access tokens, federate org providers into MCP (#692)\n\nCLI: new `faros env`, `faros app`, `faros commit` and `faros sandbox`\ncommands, sharing one hub client with --org/--workspace, so a laptop, CI\njob or AI agent can run the full App Studio loop. `faros mcp` now prints\nthe long-lived workspace MCP token from the hub''s connect endpoint.\n\nHub: POST /auth/apps/token mints short-lived, sealed, app-bound `fapp_`\ntokens; POST /auth/apps/verify re-runs the SubjectAccessReview for the\naccess gate. The aggregate MCP endpoint now federates the verified\ncaller''s own org-owned providers over the edge route with a delegated\ntoken (never the caller''s bearer), with org copies shadowing platform\nproviders.\n\nApp Studio / code / infrastructure: binary files end to end (base64,\ncapability-gated), file upload/download routes and Code tab support,\nbatched and rate-limit-aware project commits, synchronous dev exec\n(`run` action, `dev_exec` tool), applied-revision tracking in the dev\nagent, and a `connections` input on workload templates that injects\nDATABASE_URL / REDIS_URL from sibling instances.","tree":{"sha":"27ae8bc587ceb69aa5cae0df879c3d4ccac6d3cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/trees/27ae8bc587ceb69aa5cae0df879c3d4ccac6d3cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-app-studio/git/commits/ea95f434f27202f84b8ef2f0c579348e5697d2c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/ea95f434f27202f84b8ef2f0c579348e5697d2c3","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hKY9oAKGVhOTVmNDM0ZjI3MjAyZjg0YjhlZjJmMGM1NzkzNDhlNTY5N2QyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-app-studio/commit/bb872a29ae38c6a78091