rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/19ad21731f5685070a34f867015cb36b482602b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5685031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cwilhit","id":5685031,"login":"cwilhit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODUwMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/1dd3365d5303782485b8f90cb6b2fc2e4fb55545/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:02:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align Agents setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards (#788)\n\n* Fix Agents API flows and Tilt development wiring\n\nAllow gpt-6-luna tool requests by explicitly disabling reasoning, recover\nprogress and cancellation controls after disconnected chat streams, and\nrevalidate triggers when their referenced connections change.\n\nCorrect latency percentiles and clarify that spend estimates omit unpriced\nusage. Watch the remaining Agents Go sources in Tilt and resolve\nhost.docker.internal for external provider pods on Linux.\n\nValidated with 580 portal tests, focused Go suites, UI conformance checks,\nand live Tilt chat, history, tool, approval, webhook, and schedule smoke tests.\nRoot formatting/lint and changed-code provider lint pass; full provider lint\nstill reports five pre-existing findings.\n\n* fix(agents): align setup, recovery, and reporting with design standards\n\n* fix(agents): expire abandoned model verification credentials\n\n* fix(agents): harden diagnostic redaction and approval refresh","tree":{"sha":"3c89aadcab5e2d1a10b3b9fea221dfd440bf2d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/3c89aadcab5e2d1a10b3b9fea221dfd440bf2d75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/1dd3365d5303782485b8f90cb6b2fc2e4fb55545","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/1dd3365d5303782485b8f90cb6b2fc2e4fb55545","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKDFkZDMzNjVkNTMwMzc4MjQ4NWI4ZjkwY2I2YjJmYzJlNGZiNTU1NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/79e70bff06360037f4592ab07d9bbbbf0994803d","sha":"79e70bff06360037f4592ab07d9bbbbf0994803d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/79e70bff06360037f4592ab07d9bbbbf0994803d"}],"sha":"1dd3365d5303782485b8f90cb6b2fc2e4fb55545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/1dd3365d5303782485b8f90cb6b2fc2e4fb55545"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/79e70bff06360037f4592ab07d9bbbbf0994803d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:38:02Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T05:38:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Take the upstream fixes for four new govulncheck findings (#783)\n\n* Take the upstream fixes for four new govulncheck findings\n\nThe vulnerability database gained four entries the gate reaches from this\ntree, and each has a fix to take rather than an exposure to accept:\n\n  GO-2026-6497, GO-2026-6499  oras.land/oras-go/v2            2.6.1 -> 2.6.2\n  GO-2026-6505                otel otlptrace exporters         1.44  -> 1.45\n  GO-2026-6597                github.com/containerd/containerd 1.7.35 -> 1.7.36\n\nThe otel one needs the grpc and http exporter modules bumped as well as the\nparent: they are separate modules and the advisory names all three. Root and\nproviders/edges carry them; provider-sdk does not. Both gates pass locally.\n\n* Carry the same fixes into every module that links the affected packages\n\nThe vulnerability database is read live, and the first pass bumped only the\ntwo modules the gate had failed on by then. Every module that links the\notel trace exporters needs the same pin — provider-sdk directly, and\nquickstart through its provider-sdk replace, where otel itself had to follow\nto 1.45 for the exporters'' semconv. The modules that replace the root\nmodule (agents) only needed their go.sum brought up to date with the root''s\nnew graph; without that the agents image stopped building.\n\nEvery module builds and every govulncheck gate passes locally.","tree":{"sha":"f95f3aa9ad6dfb5e9613d6d47dc6b8057c0952d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/f95f3aa9ad6dfb5e9613d6d47dc6b8057c0952d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/79e70bff06360037f4592ab07d9bbbbf0994803d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"h