mmitter":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/8c74b82fe4165fcf83431fb27abb67e67733fc30","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKDhjNzRiODJmZTQxNjVmY2Y4MzQzMWZiMjdhYmI2N2U2NzczM2ZjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020","sha":"429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020"}],"sha":"8c74b82fe4165fcf83431fb27abb67e67733fc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/8c74b82fe4165fcf83431fb27abb67e67733fc30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T08:26:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"cli: regroup the command tree, add connect/org/workspace members/whoami; tenant cluster-ID headers and provider fixes (#704)\n\nCLI (pkg/cli, test/e2e/suites/cli, docs/cli):\n- Group `faros --help` by intent; make --insecure-skip-tls-verify global;\n  hide legacy spellings (list/ls, kubeconfig edge, get, apply, get-token)\n  and move kcp workspace navigation to hidden `kcp-workspace`.\n- New: whoami, logout, token [--refresh], connect/disconnect (merged\n  faros-<edge> context), edge kubeconfig [-o|--merge], org list|create,\n  workspace list|create, and members list|add|remove|set-role at org and\n  workspace scope over the existing hub REST API.\n- Shared -o wide|json|yaml|name output, --yes confirmations, shell\n  completion for edge names, roles and formats.\n- Fix edge type detection (spec.type no longer exists), hub commands\n  following an edge context after connect, un-externalized proxy URLs,\n  and the error when the edges provider is not enabled.\n- Generated CLI reference (faros docs, make docs-cli, verify-docs-cli in\n  make verify); e2e suite test/e2e/suites/cli (make e2e-cli + CI job) with\n  a two-user hub, the edges provider, an in-process sshd and kind.\n- Refresh-token flow covered by tests against a fake OIDC issuer.\n- Fix install.sh archive names and next steps; dex examples now register\n  faros as a PKCE public client (public: true).\n\nHub and providers:\n- The hub proxy and MCP federation send the kcp cluster ID in\n  X-Faros-Tenant / X-Faros-Cluster and never the workspace path;\n  providers resolve org/workspace via provider-sdk/tenantaccess.\n  BREAKING for providers that parse a path from X-Faros-Tenant: roll\n  providers out before the hub.\n- Delegated provider tokens may read org/workspace rosters and invite to\n  an org (App Studio grants).\n- provider-sdk/apiexportprovider: apiexport multicluster provider that\n  retries failed endpoint watches, with a readiness check; adopted by the\n  hub and providers.\n- Edges: Workload spec.targetNamespace and simple.imagePullSecrets,\n  pod-template metadata preserved, cross-namespace pruning, agent\n  hostname reporting, stdin for ssh exec, backoff for service probes.\n- Kuery: key engaged clusters by cluster ID with an orphan sweep;\n  kuery_query MCP tool takes spec as an object.\n- Agents, App Studio, code: status stamping, GET-by-name routes,\n  publishing mode reporting, invite and preview fixes, build.yaml default.","tree":{"sha":"cfc66086a77220533c257971f8cb1794230463dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/cfc66086a77220533c257971f8cb1794230463dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKDQyOWM0NDFlOWNlMzZlMjNlNWZiNTY3YjMyZWRlYzEzYTAyNzIwMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425","sha":"6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425"}],"sha":"429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/429c441e9ce36e23e5fb567b32edec13a0272020"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:03:24Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:03:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(kuery): dial the edge proxy as the workspace-local engagement SA (#698)\n\nKuery engaged zero edges on console-dev even though the tenant had two\nconnected KubernetesCluster edges. Every engage failed with\n\"discovery failed ... Forbidden\" from the edges consumer proxy.\n\nKuery dialled the proxy with its provider SA token. The edges provider\ntreats that as a foreign SA and posts the TokenReview to the SA''s home\nworkspace with its own credential; the hub''s kcp proxy pins every SA\ncaller to the caller''s own workspace by prepending /clusters/{home}, so\nthe review landed on /clusters/{edges}/clusters/{kuery}/.../tokenreviews,\nkcp answered 404, the proxy answered 403. The e2e for that branch probes\nwith the edges provider''s own SA, whose home equals the caller''s, so the\nrewrite is a no-op there.\n\nUse the per-workspace \"faros-kuery\" ServiceAccount kuery already\nprovisions for edge discovery as the data-path credential instead. It is\nissued in the consumer workspace, so the edges proxy authenticates it\nnatively through the APIExport VW (the same path agent and delegated\ntokens take). A separate, created \"faros-kuery-edgeproxy\" ClusterRole +\nbinding grants it verb \"proxy\" on kubernetesclusters: kuery claims only\nget/list/watch/create on clusterroles and a claim on an existing\nAPIBinding is never widened, so the identity''s own role cannot be\nupdated in workspaces enabled before this change, while a new object\nlands in every enabled workspace on the next reconcile with no\nDisable/Enable cycle. tenantaccess gains EnsureGrant for exactly this.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26d003cedcb9dc52739a63139e49b6c85825ff42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/26d003cedcb9dc52739a63139e49b6c85825ff42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/6d035b3c4602b4103a972d105a78c33737fa0425","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKDZkMDM1YjNjNDYwMmI0MTAzYTk3MmQxMDVhNzhjMzM3MzdmYTA0MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/f1e78d5ac6eec2b1a10fca24cb5adf986ee955dd","sha":"f1e78d5ac6eec2b1a10fca24cb5adf986ee955dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/