ges): isolate paginated reads by context\n\n* fix(app-studio): keep overlays in provider scope\n\n* fix(infrastructure): align template layout controls","tree":{"sha":"c56de2b5697b4da0dac9f988b751b7b788e5379f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/c56de2b5697b4da0dac9f988b751b7b788e5379f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/be40df1f01ff6c0800c0a67212f0597ff689b6c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/be40df1f01ff6c0800c0a67212f0597ff689b6c8","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKGJlNDBkZjFmMDFmZjZjMDgwMGMwYTY3MjEyZjA1OTdmZjY4OWI2Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2","sha":"f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2"}],"sha":"be40df1f01ff6c0800c0a67212f0597ff689b6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/be40df1f01ff6c0800c0a67212f0597ff689b6c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5685031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cwilhit","id":5685031,"login":"cwilhit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODUwMzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cwilhit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:17:23Z","email":"cdwilhite0601@gmail.com","name":"Craig D Wilhite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:17:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Standardize provider UI on canonical k-* recipes (#565)\n\n* Standardize provider UI on canonical k-* recipes\n\n* fix(ui): close provider conformance regressions\n\n* fix(ui): normalize checkbox focus treatment\n\n* fix(agents): align route panel spacing\n\n* fix(databricks): preserve checkbox activation\n\n* fix(edges): preserve header action sizing\n\n* fix(ci): satisfy goimports in edges e2e","tree":{"sha":"ded88a546f26d23c9c7415823721d4925d4d88b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/ded88a546f26d23c9c7415823721d4925d4d88b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2","node_id":"C_kwDOS5hLPdoAKGY3MWYzYWQ4MjQwMGEwOTYwOGFmZDNmODZkMTEwNDE5OGMzZTJkZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/railgrid/provider-kuery/commit/2fe5154e5a9990a5890c957ae53874ea819666e0","sha":"2fe5154e5a9990a5890c957ae53874ea819666e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/2fe5154e5a9990a5890c957ae53874ea819666e0"}],"sha":"f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/f71f3ad82400a09608afd3f86d1104198c3e2df2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/2fe5154e5a9990a5890c957ae53874ea819666e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:12:51Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:12:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Drop cross-provider identity claims so providers mix across deployments (#564)\n\nA permission claim on another provider''s resources must pin that\nprovider''s APIExport identityHash, and an export can pin exactly one\nidentity per claimed resource — for every consuming workspace at once.\nThe moment one org self-hosts a dependency (infrastructure, code, edges)\nwhile others use the platform copy, no single pin is correct: kcp\nsilently stops serving the claimed resources to whoever mismatches, and\nEnable refuses the binding outright (the claim-identity 409).\n\nRemove every cross-provider first-party claim and replace the access\npath with workspace-local ServiceAccounts acting through each tenant\nworkspace''s OWN bindings — which reach whichever copy of the dependency\nthat workspace binds, platform or self-hosted, with no identity\ninvolved. The identities are provisioned over the still-claimed built-in\ntypes (serviceaccounts, secrets, RBAC), which carry no identityHash.\n\napp-studio (was: instances + repositories claims):\n- New shared provider-sdk/tenantaccess package: per-workspace SA +\n  ClusterRole/Binding + legacy token Secret, and a client that dials\n  {hub}/clusters/{cluster} as that SA (the hub proxy forwards kcp SA\n  tokens natively).\n- Project and Studio reconcilers route all instance/repository writes\n  through the tenant-path client; finalizers now block on the identity\n  instead of treating an unserved resource''s 404 as \"already gone\" and\n  orphaning live instances.\n- All identity-hash plumbing removed (chart env/values, Makefile\n  auto-discovery, BYO recipe requiredValues).\n\nkuery (was: edges claim):\n- The engagement controller now keys off the consumer''s reflexive\n  APIBinding to kuery''s own export (visible through the VW without any\n  claim), provisions a per-workspace faros-kuery SA owned by that\n  binding, and polls KubernetesCluster edges through the workspace''s own\n  edges binding. Per-edge sharding, claims, and the edgeproxy data path\n  are unchanged.\n- This also removes a three-way drift: init stamped faros.sh/edges, the\n  CatalogEntry declared edges.faros.sh/kubernetesclusters, and the\n  Makefile resolved the identity from core.faros.sh — a combination\n  under which Enable''s identity poll could never succeed.\n\nNo enableable provider pins another provider''s identity anymore; the\nEnable-time claim-identity check remains as a safety net for future\nclaim-based providers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53202e44480af50ac7fb1ef2082bb2ae45434759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/53202e44480af50ac7fb1ef2082bb2ae45434759"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/2fe5154e5a9990a5890c957ae53874ea819666e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committ