}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/250cf01a2de46e4e9257d0a2431cb312bd6dc8d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:28:38Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:28:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(kuery): add Helm deployment guide (#329)\n\n* docs(kuery): add Helm deployment guide (Postgres + SQLite)\n\nDocument deploying the kuery provider to a host cluster: namespace,\nprovider kubeconfig Secret (key must be \"kubeconfig\"), building the\nPostgres DSN from the database Secret, the helm upgrade --install\ninvocation with each key flag explained, the SQLite alternative, and\nverification steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add identity-hash\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"228087cd6e41ec8ae56d910e5a747875af859eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/228087cd6e41ec8ae56d910e5a747875af859eb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/250cf01a2de46e4e9257d0a2431cb312bd6dc8d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198