ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/5a01979f2e70713896527106c7d55ee9551c5ce2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T14:18:53Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T14:18:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump kuery to a4c5aac (ambiguous-name + JSONPath fixes; Postgres test suite) (#328)\n\na4c5aac fixes two more Postgres-only SQL bugs surfaced from the running\nprovider:\n\n- \"column reference name is ambiguous\" (42702): tenant scoping adds a\n  clusters JOIN to relations queries, and SELECT * collided with the\n  clusters.name column. Now selects only the objects columns.\n- \"single boolean result is expected\" (22038): the JSONPath filter used\n  jsonb_path_match on a plain path; now uses jsonb_path_exists.\n\nIt also makes kuery''s entire engine test suite runnable against a real\nPostgreSQL (go test -tags pgtest), with a CI job, so this class of\ndialect bug is caught upstream instead of in the deployed provider.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f36b51b76317f910ef4c8a13dc0e92b7acdf345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/7f36b51b76317f910ef4c8a13dc0e92b7acdf345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/5a01979f2e70713896527106c7d55ee9551c5ce2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null