:3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/commits/8c751671475133c2d9d09bb64d6af5bbb1002ce5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T13:36:36Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T13:36:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump kuery to 3fbe9b2 (jsonb UNION fix + clusters-root e2e coverage) (#325)\n\n3fbe9b2 follows 7fcd75d with the second half of the clusters-rooted\nUNION fix: the synthesized annotations/owner_refs/conditions columns are\nnow typed jsonb on Postgres, so they no longer fail \"UNION types text and\njsonb cannot be matched\" (SQLSTATE 42804) against the objects table''s\njsonb columns. It also adds a Root=clusters Postgres e2e test that\nreproduces both 42804 variants (caught only against real Postgres, since\nSQLite is dynamically typed).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3a887a24a23a5147ff7585b06f7248e7c32b916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/trees/a3a887a24a23a5147ff7585b06f7248e7c32b916"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/railgrid/provider-kuery/git/commits/8c751671475133c2d9d09bb64d6af5bbb1002ce5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith