_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasbrentano","id":131728775,"login":"lucasbrentano","node_id":"U_kgDOB9oFhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/commits/c3be03cf6e84dd2666d5fbb75ae4f2d8c4af6556/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T07:10:14Z","email":"lucas.brentano@edu.pucrs.br","name":"Lucas Aquino Brentano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T07:10:14Z","email":"lucas.brentano@edu.pucrs.br","name":"Lucas Aquino Brentano"},"message":"chore: empacota o T3 em Docker com compose e pipeline de deploy (US-10)\n\nAdiciona ao T3 (eloo-metrics-mfe) o caminho Docker, para subir o remote\nsem npm e ter release reprodutível como nos backends T1/T2 (ADR-0012):\n\n- Dockerfile multi-stage: builda o app e serve o remote com `vite preview`\n  (:5176), reusando o proxy do vite.config (/api -> T2, /auth-api -> T1).\n- docker-compose.yml (raiz): sobe só o metrics; alvos de proxy por env,\n  backends do host via host.docker.internal; projeto `metrics-mfe`.\n- .dockerignore: exclui node_modules/dist/dev-login do contexto de build.\n- .github/workflows/cd.yml: no push para main, roda os gates e builda via\n  `docker compose build`, depois publica release beta idempotente (espelha\n  o cd.yml do T2).\n- ADR-0012 + índice de ADRs; doc de backlog da US-10.\n\nRefs #28","tree":{"sha":"eb2efa6117808638cc132a493b702f20de3ae2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/