","email":"carlosebmascarello@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Mascarello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:30:33Z","email":"carlosebmascarello@gmail.com","name":"Carlos Mascarello"},"message":"test(event-metrics): cobre detalhe de evento com unit + integração MSW (US-05)\n\n- Unit: EventHeader, TimeSeriesChart (dados/vazio/erro/acessibilidade),\n  GranularitySelector, ForbiddenState e NotFoundState (render + onBack).\n- Serviço: getEventById (mapeamento + 403/404 tipados), taxas (rate do backend,\n  derivação e valor-limite denominador 0) e getTimeSeries (normalização,\n  query e envelope).\n- Integração MSW: caminho feliz, 403 → ForbiddenState e 404 → NotFoundState sem\n  fetches secundários, falha isolada em checkin-rate, troca de granularidade só\n  refaz timeseries, 401 → sessionExpired, série vazia, fallback /series e erro\n  genérico com retry.\n- Handlers base do MSW para events/{id}, checkin/certification-rate, timeseries\n  e series (contrato ADR-0009).","tree":{"sha":"0be7e16458db35d7ae8786497c49941f9d815001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/trees/0be7e16458db35d7ae8786497c49941f9d815001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/commits/505f6199588410688f03fedd248cd3fb6af7be86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124840709?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosMascarello/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosMascarello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosMascarello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosMascarello/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CarlosMascarello","id":124840709,"login":"CarlosMascarello","node_id":"U_kgDOB3DrBQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarlosMascarello/orgs","received_events