 provando o fluxo ponta-a-ponta:\n\n- services/authApi.ts: reusa o storage/sessão do mfe-auth (token `mfeAuth.*`, evento `sessionExpired`) — sem reimplementar login.\n- services/metricsApi.ts: `listEventMetrics` tipada (Bearer, mapeamento snake↔camel, mapa de erros 401→sessionExpired / 403 / 404 / 422 / 5xx).\n- DashboardPage: busca counters de `/metrics/events`, exibe o total e o gráfico, tratando loading / erro (com \"tentar novamente\") / vazio / sessão expirada.\n- Testes de integração (MSW): mapeamento, header Bearer e todos os caminhos de erro; estados da tela cobertos.\n\nGates verdes: eslint, prettier, tsc, vitest (cobertura 100% linhas / 91% branches), playwright (smoke).\n\nRefs #2","tree":{"sha":"551017f7e1fa7ea4fba4827e1a2db24029eaca89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/trees/551017f7e1fa7ea4fba4827e1a2db24029eaca89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/commits/3c5dc1bdb32b1c7e3ec549c39889e15377f51fce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131728775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasbrentano","id":131728775,"login":"lucasbrentano","node_id":"U_kgDOB9oFhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/subscriptions","t