oling:\n- Vite 5 + React 18 + TS 5 + MUI 6 + MUI X Charts + Tailwind 3 + react-router 6\n- vite.config: remote \"mfeMetrics\" (expõe DashboardPage, shared), proxy /api\n  (Metrics) + /auth-api (Auth); dev :5177, serve:remote :5176\n- theme MUI (tokens do DESIGN.md), Tailwind, ESLint + Prettier\n- src/pages/DashboardPage placeholder (contrato ADR-0005) + gráfico MUI X\n\nTestes (ADR-0011) e CI:\n- Vitest + RTL (unit, cobertura 100%), MSW (base p/ integração), Playwright\n  (smoke E2E)\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: lint → format → typecheck → test → e2e → build\n\nGates locais verdes: eslint, prettier, tsc -b, vitest (cov 100%), build, e2e.\n\nRefs #1","tree":{"sha":"1cf6b025ebfc78881b9815bfe71fb139c45cd782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/trees/1cf6b025ebfc78881b9815bfe71fb139c45cd782"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/commits/4b97688ee8d9cf4337bc4159f0322ee3279d83a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131728775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasbrentano","id":131728775,"login":"lucasbrentano","node_id":"U_kgDOB9oFhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us