de página remote, design Stitch,\n  processo de V&V/gestão, refatoração dos forks (SNS→SQS + RDS na Ministack),\n  contrato da API de métricas (T2→T3) e contrato do remote com o shell.\n- CLAUDE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md — diretrizes do agente, GitFlow e Conventional Commits.\n- .claude/ — subagents (architecture-guard, vv-check) e skills (/commit, /create-issue).\n- docs/backlog/ — US-00 a US-07, espelhando o board GitHub Projects (issues #1–#8).\n- .ai_log/ — log de prompts da sessão (evidência de uso crítico de IA, ADR-0007).\n\nRemove:\n- frontend_metrics/ — protótipo Vite antigo, substituído pelo eloo-metrics-mfe.","tree":{"sha":"e21efaa91bc14754d9aba47e92cda0cc96276ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/trees/e21efaa91bc14754d9aba47e92cda0cc96276ada"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pucrs-csw-2026-1/0x_t3/git/commits/c89f8356e2abd629b9902847c973d19770f75e1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131728775?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasbrentano","id":131728775,"login":"lucasbrentano","node_id":"U_kgDOB9oFhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasbrentano","user_view_type":