xus::launch composes the server-fn root as \"\" + \"/\" + base_path, a\nrelative URL whose parse panics inside the first server-fn call\n(RelativeUrlWithoutBase), killing hydration. Compose the absolute root\nfrom window.location.origin ourselves and call the web launcher\ndirectly, skipping that block; the wasm transport only ever sends\nurl.path(), so the origin is parse ballast.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"540a90becb37a346ff78de02dd813cd6799e1105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/git/trees/540a90becb37a346ff78de02dd813cd6799e1105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/git/commits/bddba7fd8ca9e1ab63be82ac12a4c941fa73c2e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91695523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/valeratrades","id":91695523,"login":"valeratrades","node_id":"U_kgDOBXcpow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/commit/bddba7fd8ca9e1ab63be82ac12a4c941fa73c2e5","node_id":"C_kwDOS860CtoAKGJkZGJhN2ZkOGNhOWUxYWI