:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T16:37:59Z","email":"valeratrades@gmail.com","name":"Valera"},"message":"feat: bootstrap external DB from R2 on first boot\n\nA volume that has never synced (fresh PVC, or one predating R2 sync — e.g.\nthe old embedded-data image that seeded git-LFS pointer files) adopts the\nlatest remote snapshot before serving. Synced volumes are left to the\noperator. Fixes prod serving unrenderable LFS-pointer images.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ad48b5aeb4aaa1b649b01818cb2a5a768d02e36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/git/trees/9ad48b5aeb4aaa1b649b01818cb2a5a768d02e36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/git/commits/80b8dfd3feb5978cc4a52d8ffcc4bde66bb146c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91695523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/valeratrades","id":91695523,"login":"valeratrades","node_id":"U_kgDOBXcpow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valeratrades","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EV-invest/real_estate_allocation/commit/80b8dfd3feb5978cc4a52d8ffcc4bde