e so shared-ui/shared-utils still\n  resolve to local source inside this workspace even though their\n  dependents now use semver ranges instead of workspace:*\n- README/docs: document running any submodule standalone (clone-only,\n  GITHUB_TOKEN setup, per-module BFF + Vite playground, Storybook,\n  shared-utils tests) and publishing shared-ui/shared-utils to GitHub\n  Packages via a version tag\n\nSubmodule pointers updated to each repo''s pushed feature branch:\nmodule-a (standalone dev harness), module-b/module-c (doc note),\nshared-ui (merged shadcn + chart components), shared-utils (build/\npublish pipeline). These still need their own PRs merged before\nbumping to commits on main.","tree":{"sha":"84ac36f854284e84f22f577f3a63fd05fc01cfb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hrtbrxkxr/poc-blueprint/git/trees/84ac36f854284e84f22f577f3a63fd05fc01cfb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hrtbrxkxr/poc-blueprint/git/commits/c67c2ebeae7137cf13b5862e1e035d21f880ecaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78243739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hrtbrxkxr","id":78243739,"login":"hrtbrxkxr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MjQzNzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co