auto-migration: jsx preserve -> react-jsx.\n- Migrate ESLint 8 (.eslintrc.json) -> ESLint 9 flat config\n  (eslint.config.mjs), since eslint-config-next@16 only ships a flat\n  config and crashes when loaded as a legacy extend. Bumped eslint to\n  ^9.39.4 and eslint-plugin-boundaries to ^6.0.2 (flat-config compatible).\n- Fix real bugs newly caught by the upgraded lint rules:\n  - @next/next/no-assign-module-variable: renamed `module` locals to\n    `moduleConfig` in moduleResolver.ts, permissions.ts, ModuleRenderer.tsx\n  - react-hooks/static-components (React Compiler''s analyzer, bundled in\n    eslint-plugin-react-hooks@7): lazy() must never be called inside a\n    component body when used as a JSX tag, even cached/memoized — the\n    analyzer flags any CallExpression feeding a JSX tag. Fixed by building\n    all lazy components eagerly into a module-scope map (loadModule.ts)\n    and having ModuleRenderer index into it instead of calling a getter.","tree":{"sha":"a634ca3def408a8a15ac353acd41968b0a8ddc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hrtbrxkxr/poc-blueprint/git/trees/a634ca3def408a8a15ac353acd41968b0a8ddc30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hrtbrxkxr/poc-blueprint/git/commits/59ea62bca358e9e04744957975f9e9fc3ddd5a27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78243739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hrtbrxkxr","id":78243739,"login":"hrtbrxkxr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MjQzNzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrtbrxkxr/received_events","re