thub.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/6d9fa225d1c2338ce48276176a17b54854aa0d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:50:04Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:50:04Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): show elapsed/total time for a chat turn\n\nWhile the agent works, the working bubble shows a live ticking timer\n(\"agent · 8s\"); once the turn finishes it shows the total (\"Took 12s\").\n\nUI-only: the hook stamps startedAt on send and, on the single turn-end path\n(reply / stop / timeout / send-error, all routed through endTurn), captures\nlastDurationMs. The panel ticks a 1s interval off startedAt while working and\nrenders the final duration after. Compact format (8s, 1m 5s).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b506c20dc7fe673a49c8c766e285245f9242d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/0b506c20dc7fe673a49c8c766e285245f9242d96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/6d9fa225d1c2338ce48276176a17b54854aa0d5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev