nts":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e","sha":"eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e"}],"sha":"062a3b93f2a43c9ad5a4861fe87de2e7349c9ed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/062a3b93f2a43c9ad5a4861fe87de2e7349c9ed9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:42:51Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:42:51Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): stop a running agent turn from the chat panel\n\nWhile the agent is working, the composer''s Send button becomes a red Stop\nbutton. Stop kills the conversation''s hcom agent and records a \"(stopped by\noperator)\" note.\n\n- api: POST /agent/chat/:conversation/stop — kills the hcom agent tagged with\n  the conversation id (reuses lazybones_engine::cancel_agent) and appends the\n  note (which also clears the panel''s working indicator via SSE).\n- engine: stream_replies ends its wait promptly when the agent it was watching\n  is no longer alive (stopped or crashed), instead of holding for the full\n  180s timeout and emitting a misleading \"did not reply in time\" note.\n- ui: stopAgentChat client + useAgentChat.stop(); the panel swaps Send→Stop\n  while working.\n\nVerified end-to-end: a working agent goes from `active` to gone on Stop, and the\nconversation shows the stopped note with no stray timeout note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ac7885e23f0f669a75b050f204d8a191f0703f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/3ac7885e23f0f669a75b050f204d8a191f0703f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKGVlYmZhODczNDU4ZmY5MjU1NmU0MzRlZTZhNDIyMTBhZWQ0ZjdkMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b","sha":"2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b"}],"sha":"eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/eebfa873458ff92556e434ee6a42210aed4f7d0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:32:05Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:32:05Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): stream live \"working\" activity to the chat panel\n\nThe panel showed a dead spinner with no sign the agent was doing anything until\nits final reply (5–180s later). Now the runner polls the agent''s hcom tool-status\nevents and streams ephemeral activity ticks (\"Running a command…\", \"Reading a\nfile…\", \"Searching…\") to the per-conversation SSE, so the panel shows live\nprogress.\n\n- store: LiveEvent::AgentActivity { conversation_id, text } (transient, never\n  persisted) + StoreHandle::report_agent_activity.\n- api: per-conversation SSE forwards it as an `activity` event; global /stream\n  drops it (per-conversation only).\n- engine: stream_replies resolves the agent''s hcom base name lazily (a freshly\n  spawned agent isn''t in `hcom list` immediately) and maps its tool:X status\n  events to human notes, coalescing repeats; tool-status events are keyed by base\n  name, not the conversation id.\n- ui: useAgentChat listens for `activity`; the WorkingBubble shows the latest\n  note instead of a generic \"working…\".\n\nVerified end-to-end against the daemon: the SSE now carries an `activity` event\n(\"Running a command…\") before the final `message`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d836820653d02f76c6de42bdea12e4396607899","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/5d836820653d02f76c6de42bdea12e4396607899"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKDJiMGIzZWVjMTZiMWI5OWQ5MzU1NGU2NDYwNWRkYWQ1MDU3NGQ5OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2","sha":"c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2"}],"sha":"2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/2b0b3eec16b1b99d93554e64605ddad50574d99b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:08:40Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T09:08:40Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"fix(agent): skill toggles dropping/unticking in the settings card\n\ntoggleSkill closed over `draft` and passed a recomputed array to set(), so\ntoggling several skills in quick succession read a stale snapshot — a later\ntoggle overwrote an earlier one, dropping just-ticked skills (they appeared to\nuntick on save). Switch to a functional setDraft that reads the latest draft.\n\nAlso re-seed the draft from the server''s response after a successful save, so\nthe form provably reflects the persisted config (no silent form/backend drift).\nThe backend already round-trips enabled_skills correctly; this was UI-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56632be3fa3bc897e84f2370ba91b81f2cbc4be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/56632be3fa3bc897e84f2370ba91b81f2cbc4be7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKGMyNGMyZDMxZDYyODRhMWI5NWZiOWMzZTJhOGY1OGE0YjgxNmY1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3","sha":"645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3"}],"sha":"c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/c24c2d31d6284a1b95fb9c3e2a8f58a4b816f5c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:52:38Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:52:38Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"got chat working","tree":{"sha":"5d2b3e8607e392c8cbd51d3634e19e329a45f55b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/5d2b3e8607e392c8cbd51d3634e19e329a45f55b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKDY0NWQ5NzkxNTNlNjE1MjdiMjAzZmRiZjYwNGQ4ZGY1ZTNkMWQ1ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c","sha":"73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c"}],"sha":"645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/645d979153e61527b203fdbf604d8df5e3d1d5f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:34:09Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:34:09Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): page-level + per-template resume scope\n\nThe resume prompt now fires on list pages, not just entity detail panels:\n\n- pageScopeKey falls back to `view:<view>` when no specific entity is in scope,\n  so \"chatting on Templates\" (or Skills/Workflows lists) is itself a resumable\n  scope — fixes the prompt never appearing on the Templates grid.\n- Per-template grounding: opening a template''s edit dialog sets\n  selected_template_id on the agent context (via a new TemplateDialog\n  onOpenChange prop), so chatting while editing a template scopes to that\n  template and resume is per-template. Closing the dialog reverts to page scope.\n\nNet: page-level resume by default, upgraded to per-template when a specific\ntemplate is open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22086d4146537ce9f5f46511c462f5f950d776b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/22086d4146537ce9f5f46511c462f5f950d776b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKDczZWExNWQ1NWFjYzhmYjMwYjg5MGQwN2QxZWU5OTY1NGZjODFkNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45","sha":"ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45"}],"sha":"73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/73ea15d55acc8fb30b890d07d1ee99654fc81d6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:28:12Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:28:12Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): prompt to resume the last session for the current page scope\n\nWhen the chat panel opens on a fresh thread while viewing a specific\ntemplate/skill/task/workflow, and a past conversation exists for that same\nscope, show a \"Resume your last session on this template from 10 min ago?\"\nbanner with Resume / Dismiss. Resume reopens it with full history; Dismiss\nstarts fresh (and won''t re-nag for that conversation this panel session).\n\nScope is matched on the in-scope entity id (most-specific first), ignoring\nincidental fields like repo/branch, so it matches the *thing* not the exact\nenvelope. View-only/global pages never prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d38453f5e78d5874d875586dae0ad4d692cd859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/6d38453f5e78d5874d875586dae0ad4d692cd859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKGVhMWFiNDFlY2FkY2FmMWRmZGEwNjljYjZmYjM0NjY0MWJiMjBlNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef","sha":"f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef"}],"sha":"ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/ea1ab41ecadcaf1dfda069cb6fb346641bb20e45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:25:34Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:25:34Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): render agent chat replies as markdown\n\nAgent (and tool) bubbles in the Lazybones Agent panel now render through the\nshared Markdown component (react-markdown + remark-gfm, already a dependency),\nso replies show bold/lists/tables/links and fenced code blocks (```json, ```txt,\netc.) instead of raw text. Operator turns stay plain text. Raw HTML is escaped\nby react-markdown, so this stays XSS-safe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2914fb4d00e7f5b0fc1150615008872dc33f87b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/2914fb4d00e7f5b0fc1150615008872dc33f87b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKGY0MzQyMjAyMGZlYTc1ODRiYWU3YWExNDA5MGNkYjY3MTY4OTEyZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/d2154935a103be64034185083bc5fa1c50548e72","sha":"d2154935a103be64034185083bc5fa1c50548e72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/d2154935a103be64034185083bc5fa1c50548e72"}],"sha":"f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/f43422020fea7584bae7aa14090cdb67168912ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/d2154935a103be64034185083bc5fa1c50548e72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:07:47Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T08:07:47Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(agent): Lazybones Agent — conversational operator aide (Phases 1–3)\n\nA first-class, page-aware management agent embedded in the UI that authors\nworkflows/tasks/templates/skills and explains run state through the same REST\nAPI a human uses. It acts only within a scoped bearer token''s capabilities and\nnever starts/runs anything itself (docs/agent/lazybones-agent-scope.md).\n\nPhase 1 (MVP):\n- Store: ManagementAgentConfig (settings row) + agent_conversation/agent_message\n  persistence; LiveEvent::AgentMessage on the bus.\n- API: GET/PUT /settings/management-agent (Author + catalog validation);\n  POST /agent/chat, GET /agent/chat/:conversation, GET /agent/conversations,\n  per-conversation SSE at /agent/chat/:conversation/stream.\n- Engine: management/ runner — builds the system prompt (persona + enabled skill\n  runbooks + page context + REST cheat-sheet), spawns/resumes an hcom session,\n  streams the reply back via the bus. Scoped token minted API-side (Author/\n  ReadOnly), never Claim/Secret.\n- Skills: lazybones-add-{workflow,task,template,skill}, -supervise runbooks.\n- UI: settings card, page-context provider wired into workflow/task detail, and\n  a global chat panel reusing task-chat styling with per-conversation SSE.\n\nPhase 2 (gated lifecycle):\n- AuthorAndManage profile ([Read, Author, Block]); the agent PROPOSES lifecycle\n  actions via a tool-agnostic `CONFIRM: {json}` sentinel. The runner persists a\n  `confirm` message; the UI renders a Confirm/Cancel card and issues the call\n  under the operator''s loop token — the agent''s token never carries lifecycle.\n- lazybones-retry gated runbook.\n\nPhase 3 (polish & breadth):\n- Conversation list/history switcher in the panel.\n- Agent context wired into skills + runs pages.\n- Optional structured skill actions (typed SkillAction with validation; OQ2).\n- Per-scope config: per-workflow overrides resolved as override ?? global (OQ1).\n\nRuntime fixes (headless spawn):\n- Runner provisions a scratch dir (.lazy/agent) with a bootstrapped Claude\n  allow-list so a headless agent clears the folder-trust gate, and filters\n  --dangerously-skip-permissions (which triggers a consent screen it can''t\n  answer; the allow-list makes it unnecessary).\n- hcom spawn scrubs inherited CLAUDECODE/CLAUDE_CODE_* env so a daemon launched\n  from inside a Claude session doesn''t poison spawned agents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ac3e59ec117cbf929ae1ed202cd5881b473146a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/5ac3e59ec117cbf929ae1ed202cd5881b473146a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/d2154935a103be64034185083bc5fa1c50548e72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"http