":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/362205006f343a7b6ba5bae73b52a7cd84d5adb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T00:55:52Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T00:55:52Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(gh): local branch listing via git (no remote required)\n\nThe GitHub-API branches() needs {owner}/{repo} to expand, which fails on\na repo with no remote (''no git remotes found''). Add branches_local()\nusing `git for-each-ref` with %(upstream:track,nobracket) for safe\nahead/behind (never aborts on branches without an upstream). New\nLocalBranch struct + parser. Tests cover the no-remote repo and the\ntracked/ahead-only/behind-only parse forms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3754b8104e2852d0f947ceaf7beeab9bff87c5a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/3754b8104e2852d0f947ceaf7beeab9bff87c5a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/362205006f343a7b6ba5bae73b52a7cd84d5adb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","followi