 \"reuses <id>\" badge\nwhen reuse_from is set. The task detail panel gains a Worktree-mode row (marked\nwhen overridden) and a \"Reuses worktree of\" row.\n\nThe add-task dialog (worktree-mode picker + conditional reuse_from picker) was\nalready in place; this closes the read-side so reuse edges are legible on the\nboard, not just authorable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e6b360bd1a2a09a67d1e074019c76a03ab77f43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/8e6b360bd1a2a09a67d1e074019c76a03ab77f43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/8ac11b6d22ef7285c23d686163534214ac329fc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/8ac11b6d22ef7285c23d686163534214ac329fc7","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKDhhYzExYjZkMjJlZjcyODVjMjNkNjg2MTYzNTM0MjE0YWMzMjlmYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698","sha":"a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698"}],"sha":"8ac11b6d22ef7285c23d686163534214ac329fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/8ac11b6d22ef7285c23d686163534214ac329fc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T00:22:24Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T00:22:24Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"test(api): assert reuse_from missing-target blocks with a reason\n\nExtends the workflows REST integration suite with the cross-workflow-reuse\nfailure mode required by docs/workflows-scope.md §reuse_from: a reuse-mode task\nwhose reuse_from points at a task that was never claimed (no stored worktree)\nmust block with a specific reason naming the missing source — never panic, never\nsilently fall back to a fresh tree. Asserts the block reason and that the\nworkflow derives to needs-attention.\n\nThe reuse-chain happy path (wf-2 resolves wf-1''s worktree path) was already\ncovered by three_workflows_run_concurrently_with_reuse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee8a2242f7354857158f725e7ebf229b88fd5346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/ee8a2242f7354857158f725e7ebf229b88fd5346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/a37a1804837827a2270f01fb89dfc5e5a8b70698","node_id":"C_kwDOS8_zPtoAKGEzN2ExODA0ODM3ODI3YTIyNzBmMDFmYjg5ZGZjNWU1YThiNzA2OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lazybones/commit/4d529f9a3c227b2148af24308a280b74cd243a4f","sha":"4d529f9a3c227b2148af24308a280b74cd243a4f","url":"https://api.gith