users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/commits/434c20ffc065a454eb5ee7f77a2a749c0d428ec0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T23:28:52Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T23:28:52Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"feat(ui): Workflow detail — Plan graph, Board, Events tabs, add-task, start/cancel\n\nWorkspace summary + derived state + progress, with three tabs: a dependency\ngraph laid out by depth (fan-out visible), the existing task board filtered to\nthis run_id, and the transition log filtered to this workflow''s task ids (the\nevent log is keyed by the shared run label, so we filter by run_id membership).\nAdd-task offers a template picker (spec then supplied by the template), a dep\nmulti-select, a worktree-mode override, and reuse_from shown only when the\neffective mode is reuse. Start only promotes (never claims); cancel is guarded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"798d39ba35658d2f7fa5127d420c2137ef982880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/trees/798d39ba35658d2f7fa5127d420c2137ef982880"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lazybones/git/commits/434c20ffc065a454eb5ee7f77a2a749c0d428ec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com