e rule\nset in the page.evaluate callback, so a Cloudflare challenge on submission\nreliably retains the page for noVNC recovery. SubmitOutcome now carries\nchallenge evidence (never raw text/headers/Response) instead of a\npre-computed verdict.\n\nAlso harden readPassportIdentity against makeWidgetSecrets().read()\nthrowing on non-ENOENT failures (EACCES, EISDIR, ...) by wrapping both\nreads with errore.try and returning an empty BrowserConfigurationError,\nand add a fast test proving the POST-challenge path retains the page\nwithout a second POST.","tree":{"sha":"847c08127fd225e5793a50ff629cfc0881ac04a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/847c08127fd225e5793a50ff629cfc0881ac04a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/a05d5e0bfb14eecb919952764e4b40fcb9173916","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/a05d5e0bfb14eecb919952764e4b40fcb9173916","node_id"