-07-13T21:03:08Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T21:03:08Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"fix(ui): replace hardcoded font names with --font-sans/--font-mono tokens\n\nMyDevicesDialog.module.css and AddDeviceModal.module.css spelled the font\nfamily as ''Hanken Grotesk''/''JetBrains Mono'' with no fallback. The actual\nloaded @fontsource-variable faces are ''Hanken Grotesk Variable''/''JetBrains\nMono Variable'', so the bare names never matched and the browser silently\nfell back to its default serif font.\n\nAlso swaps CompactTier.module.css''s stray `Georgia, serif` badge font for\n--font-mono, matching the same pill/badge pattern used elsewhere in the\nwidget (DebtChips, WeekStrip, UserToggle).","tree":{"sha":"0bf5f4e7ed3c4914d1b72831f0b4edbd93074553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/0bf5f4e7ed3c4914d1b72831f0b4edbd93074553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/88caf0442e2e81b54d44de64095f4547e123d79a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":