gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"fix(activation): reuse scanner-return on camera-denied and add a login escape hatch\n\nThe camera-denied fallback dead-ended into add-device manual entry with no\nway back to the invite/login screen it came from, silently dropping the\ninvite token. Its \"Ввести код вручную\" button now calls the same\ncloseScanner() (scanReturn/closeScan) mechanism already used by the\nscanner overlay''s own close button.\n\nAlso adds a \"Войти с passkey\" cross-link on the registering step, so a\nstale/foreign add-device link doesn''t strand the user with registration\nas the only option.","tree":{"sha":"03532e4951e5ff0db8e52875bc2b0d5ab8f8eb82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/03532e4951e5ff0db8e52875bc2b0d5ab8f8eb82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/e39914e1e6ed8b5ad78869c3597e1285436288f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi