://claude.ai/code/session_014WxJdTbkN9TqohWzAkKcfM","tree":{"sha":"93d6cd6707e5798a1298d2146ffbfe78c1901f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/93d6cd6707e5798a1298d2146ffbfe78c1901f06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/a36b13e6df81fd5930e17c72a4fe9148eec18eb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/a36b13e6df81fd5930e17c72a4fe9148eec18eb0","node_id":"C_kwDOS9EJdtoAKGEzNmIxM2U2ZGY4MWZkNTkzMGUxN2M3MmE0ZmU5MTQ4ZWVjMThlYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe","sha":"e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe"}],"sha":"a36b13e6df81fd5930e17c72a4fe9148eec18eb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/a36b13e6df81fd5930e17c72a4fe9148eec18eb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:05:04Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T19:05:04Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"refactor(activation): idiomatic Reatom lifecycle for add-device flow\n\nBind pending-status polling to atom connection instead of a manual\nsetInterval: a `poll` atom with withConnectHook starts/clears the timer\nwith the ''waiting'' screen''s connection, so polling no longer leaks past\nnavigation (mirrors account-model''s `now` clock). Drop beginPolling/\nstopPolling; the interval self-stops on a terminal mode change.\n\nSource the \"Создать passkey\" pending flag from startRegistration''s\nwithAsync status via a `ceremonyPending` computed, removing the React\nuseState + .finally() bookkeeping in AddDeviceScreen.\n\nMove screen transitions into the model as named actions (goToScan/\ngoToManual/goToChoose on add-device, goHome on activation) instead of\nraw atom.set() calls in the view. Refresh the now-stale init comment\n(the route loader awaits it once, not a mount effect).\n\nUpdate the interval-driven polling tests to connect `poll` the way the\nmounted ''waiting'' screen does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014WxJdTbkN9TqohWzAkKcfM","tree":{"sha":"e5f16e3c6f5691469386774ca0cda2793db1c9d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/e5f16e3c6f5691469386774ca0cda2793db1c9d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe","node_id":"C_kwDOS9EJdtoAKGUwZGY0ZTYxZTMxZWQwN2NkZWU0NDg0YmIwY2FhOTQ1YTI1ZjU0ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060","sha":"7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060"}],"sha":"e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/e0df4e61e31ed07cdee4484bb0caa945a25f54fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:16:51Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:16:51Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"docs(deps): explain the @reatom/react useLayoutEffect patch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2118c40db006996d4e6f8b64d16a5e0cfd60486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/f2118c40db006996d4e6f8b64d16a5e0cfd60486"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060","node_id":"C_kwDOS9EJdtoAKDc3ODlhMzAwOWE2ZmM3MTgwN2MyMTdjNzc2MWM2NjRlMTRjMjkwNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi/myboard/commit/0878d1d5d1ca57a8cd6ab3ac2ae2a86db2dfbb22","sha":"0878d1d5d1ca57a8cd6ab3ac2ae2a86db2dfbb22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/0878d1d5d1ca57a8cd6ab3ac2ae2a86db2dfbb22"}],"sha":"7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/7789a3009a6fc71807c217c7761c664e14c29060"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/0878d1d5d1ca57a8cd6ab3ac2ae2a86db2dfbb22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:10:37Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:10:37Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"fix(deps): patch @reatom/react to subscribe via useLayoutEffect\n\nreatomComponent''s mount() (which calls _render.subscribe(...), the\nbridge that turns a Reatom dependency change into a React re-render)\nwas wired to React.useEffect. useEffect runs post-commit, after the\nJS engine has already drained the microtask queue -- so any Reatom\ncomputed that resolves via pure microtasks (no real async I/O, e.g.\nactivateRoute''s loader, which does zero network/storage work) can\nfinish and update the reactive graph *before* mount() ever subscribes.\nThe change is then permanently missed: reatomAbstractRender''s own\n`changedVar` staleness flag only gets set when `_render` itself\nreactively recomputes, which never happens because nothing was\nsubscribed to it yet.\n\nSymptom: in a real browser (confirmed in `vite build`, `vite dev`, and\nofficial `vite preview` -- not a jsdom/act() artifact, not caused by\nStrictMode, not caused by loader.data() vs loader.ready()), /activate\nand /add-device rendered the Shell chrome and then hung on the\nLoadingCard spinner forever. jsdom + Testing Library''s `act()` masked\nthis because it flushes effects and microtasks differently than a\nreal browser''s event loop, so the whole automated suite (237/237) and\nthree rounds of code review passed despite the regression.\n\nRoot-caused by instrumenting reatomRoute''s render/loader with debug\nlogs and reading reatomAbstractRender.ts + methods/variable.ts\ndirectly: useLayoutEffect runs synchronously during React''s commit,\nbefore the JS call stack unwinds and microtasks get a chance to run,\nso the subscription is always established before even a same-tick\nloader can resolve. Verified with the patch: /activate, /add-device,\n?token=abc, ?token= (empty), ?scan=1, and the in-app\naddDeviceRoute.go()/activateRoute.go({}, true) transitions all render\ncorrectly with no artificial delay. Full workspace `pnpm test`\n(server, widget-runtime, widget-sdk, client, both widgets) stays\ngreen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d1fa7c90e58ca304cc26c69bf01d7662712cf74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/2d1fa7c90e58ca304cc26c69bf01d7662712cf74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/0878d1d5d1ca57a8cd6ab3ac2ae2a86db2dfbb22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/org