ilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T11:28:57Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"feat(activation): auto-apply a code embedded in the add-device link\n\nOpening /add-device?token=<code> now auto-validates the code against the\nserver on mount and lands straight on the \"Создать passkey\" step, instead\nof leaving the code field empty. A present code overrides scan=1 (we skip\nthe camera). The passkey ceremony still needs a real user gesture, so\nauto-submit stops at the validated \"Создать passkey\" button rather than\nstarting navigator.credentials.create() on load.\n\nA new `validating` flag gates the passkey button while the background\ncheck runs, so an early click can''t finish the ceremony before validation\nand revert a later ''waiting'' mode. `init` is idempotent for StrictMode''s\ndouble-invoked mount effect.\n\ne2e: happy path opens the link with the code and taps \"Создать passkey\";\nthe invalid-code case surfaces the error with no ceremony; the denied case\nmoves to hand-typed manual entry to keep that path covered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9461555463fecb35e99a50d0b325460d77f42bfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/9461555463fecb35e99a50d0b325460d77f42bfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/commits/6aaa83f218670ccd0842a5546b807fd771d6bf18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24359879?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":2435987