i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khmilevoi","id":24359879,"login":"khmilevoi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzU5ODc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmilevoi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/commits/b36fd2adafb38f3c85d9f5394c30b7fa4aac4b68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:41:13Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:41:13Z","email":"khmilevoi@gmail.com","name":"khmilevoi"},"message":"feat(activation): four-screen ActivateScreen (home/activate/no-code/used)\n\nRewrites ActivateScreen around Task 2''s screen atom (home/activate/\nactivate-no-code/activate-used) instead of the old mode-based UI, wiring\nthe scan action to the injected navigate (default navigateInApp) and\ncross-links back to home. Direct atom.set() from raw onClick handlers\nonly flushes subscribers on a microtask by default in Reatom, so the\ncross-link handlers call notify() right after screen.set(''home'') --\nsame pattern @reatom/react''s own useAtom hook uses -- to keep the\nre-render synchronous.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9534efbcaf210dfdacd0fd3cf745f43f5759acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmilevoi/myboard/git/trees/b9534efbcaf210dfdacd0fd3cf745f43f5759acc"},"url":"https